  ".  After all the chapter has done for them they are ungrateful.": "",
  ".  All of the surfaces are made up of highly polished stainless steel.  An occasional small water fountain or plant decorates the place.  ": "",
  ".  Consider your next words thoroughly and deliberately.": "",
  ".  Even something as small as water, raw material, and sustenance can have a profound efect.": "",
  ".  How may I assist you this day?": "",
  ".  I represent the interests of the Tau Empire.  We wish to exist in peace beside you for now, and hope that one day you will see the wisdom of the Greater Good. We will be more than happy to accept you into the fold, for the way of the Tau is one of benevolence and acceptance.": "",
  ".  If this warboss were to perish the rest might be dealt with in a more languorous fashion.  He is located on ": "",
