  ".  It is unlikely ": "",
  ".  None of this concerns you.": "",
  ".  Now free, it seems bent upon slaying your marines.  Onboard you have ": "",
  ".  Of course I still intend to kill you, regardless, but I can give credit where credit is due.": "",
  ".  Only ": "",
  ".  Our most damaged vessel is the {temp[40]} - it has {min(99, round(_hull_normalized * 100))}% Hull Integrity.": "",
  ".  Something has to change.": "",
  ".  Such a loss is impossible to ignore.": "",
  ".  Such a massive loss of battle brothers will be felt for decades to come, if the chapter ever recovers.": "",
  ".  Such a massive loss of ships will be felt for decades to come, if the chapter ever recovers.": "",
  ".  The Ordo Xenos tells us that this particular xeno ": "",
  ".  The weak, and petty must be corrected by force if needed, before they forget their place in the universe.": "",
  ".  There are no words to describe such loss.": "",
  ".  There is no reason for you to talk to such a villain, your only interactions should be both short lived and extremely violent.": "",
  ".  They should view the chapter with respect and fear, not scorn.": "",
  ".  This includes those recently recovered from our fallen comerades-in-arms.": "",
  ".  This particular xenos is said to ": "",
  ".  Would you like to spectate the event?": "",
  ".  Your ranks are made up of ": "",
