  "?wait=true": "",
  "A ": "",
  "A A": "",
  "A Black Crusade led by the Chaos Lord {faction_leader[eFACTION.CHAOS]} has arrived in {obj_ini.sector_name}.  His forces have already carved a bloody path through many sectors and yours is next.  {faction_leader[eFACTION.CHAOS]} also seems to be set on killing you.  The Black Crusade's current target is system {fleet_target.name}.": "",
  "A Bloodletter swings a Hellblade into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A Bolter that can be built directly into the structure of the vehicle, armor, another weapon or Dreadnought. When used as a weapon, it leaves both hands free, allowing to use any, even a twohanded weapon, efficiently.": "一种可直接嵌入载具、盔甲、其他武器或无畏机甲结构的爆弹枪。作为武器使用时解放双手，可高效使用任何武器乃至双手武器。",
  "A Captain ": "一名连长",
  "A Chaplain ": "一名牧师",
  "A Crusade is called; our forces are expected at {star_id.name} in {_eta} months.": "",
  "A Daemonette rakes and claws at {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A Doomsday Arc crackles with energy and then fires at {target_type}.  The resulting blast is blinding in intensity, the ground shaking before its might.  ": "",
  "A E": "",
  "A I": "",
  "A Maulerfiend advances, wrenching and smashing its claws into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A O": "",
  "A Pink Horror spits out a globlet of bright energy.  The bolt smashes into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A Plaguesword is swung into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A Predator-compatible turret mounting a reliable all-purpose autocannon capable of doing effective damage to infantry and lightly armored targets.": "适配捕食者坦克的炮塔，搭载可靠的全能自动炮，能对步兵与轻型装甲目标造成有效伤害。",
  "A Predator-compatible turret mounting a twin-linked lascannon.": "适配捕食者坦克的炮塔，搭载双联激光炮。",
  "A Rogue Trader fleet has arrived in the ": "",
  "A Servo-Harness is a special type of augmetic aid, often used by Chapter's Master of the Forge or his senior Techmarines. It consists of many blessed tools, two Servo-arms and a couple of deadly weapons. With it, one can make battlefield repairs on any vehicle, shore up defences, or even assist his battle-brothers in combat.": "伺服背带是一种特殊的机械辅助装置，常由战团的铸造之主或其资深技术军士使用。它由众多祝圣工具、两条伺服臂及数件致命武器组成。有了它，可对任何载具进行战场维修、加固防御，甚至能在战斗中协助战斗兄弟。",
  "A Staff of Light crackles with energy and fires upon {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A Thunder hammer is a weapon with a long pole and a double headed hammer on the top. This weapon unleashes a massive, devastating disruption field on impact. Only experienced Astartes can use Thunder Hammers, typically Terminators.": "雷神之锤是一种长柄顶部装有双面锤头的武器。命中时释放巨大而毁灭性的干扰力场。只有经验丰富的阿斯塔特——通常指终结者——才能使用雷神之锤。",
  "A Twin-linked Bolter consists of two Bolter weapons mounted side by side, typically on a vehicle or a dedicated weapons platform.": "双联爆弹枪由并排安装的两支爆弹枪组成，通常装在载具或专用武器平台上。",
  "A WAAAGH! led by the Warboss {_ork_leader} has arrived in {obj_ini.sector_name}.  With him is a massive Ork fleet.  Numbering in the dozens of battleships, they carry with them countless greenskins.  The forefront of the WAAAGH! is destined for the {starf.name} system.": "",
  "A Xenophase Blade is a potent, Power Sword-like melee weapon derived from xenos technology used by select warriors of the Deathwatch Chapter who have earned by their deeds and time of service in the Long Vigil the special trust of their watch fortress' watch commander.": "异形相位刃是一种威力强大的类动力剑近战武器，源自异形科技，由死亡守望战团的精选战士使用。他们凭漫长守望中的功绩与服役岁月，赢得了守望堡垒指挥官的特别信任。",
  "A and B": "",
  "A back-mounted device containing jets powerful enough to lift an Astartes in Power Armor over great distances. Utilizing these, Assault Marines bring devastation to the foe.": "一种背部装置，内含足以让身着动力装甲的阿斯塔特远距离升空的喷射器。借助它们，突击星际战士将毁灭带给敌人。",
  "A banner that represents the honor of a particular company and will bolster the morale of nearby Astartes.": "代表某个连队荣誉的旗帜，可提振附近阿斯塔特的士气。",
  "A bigger version of the Grav-Gun which utilises the gravitic reaction principle most commonly seen powering grav-vehicles such as the Land Speeder.": "重力枪的大型版本，运用最常见于兰德快艇等重力载具的重力反应原理。",
  "A bolter has been integrated.": "已集成一把爆弹枪。",
  "A brutal character, often solving problems with intimidation or violence": "一个残暴的角色，常以威吓或暴力解决问题",
  "A brutal crushing claw capable of tearing open armor and flesh with ease utilizing disruptor fields.": "一只残暴的碾压之爪，利用干扰力场能轻易撕开护甲与血肉。",
  "A child, blind to the ways of the world, may demand things from an adult but all he gets is a bloody nose.  Insolent whelp.": "不识世故的孩子可以向大人索求一切，但得到的只有一顿鼻血。放肆的小崽子。",
  "A child, handing an adult a misshapen failure of a sculpture made of spit, rocks and hope. Still, perhaps we shall find space for it, somewhere.": "一名孩童递给一名成人一件由唾液、石块与希望捏成的畸形雕塑。不过，或许我们总能在某处为它腾出空位。",
  "A civilization does not survive for as long as ours has without knowing when to put down its weapons. One must also know when to use them again, however.": "一个文明若不懂何时放下武器，是无法像我们这样存续至今的。不过，也得懂得何时再次拿起武器。",
  "A cloaked, ragged figure approaches your forces and hails you. ": "一个裹着斗篷、衣衫褴褛的身影走近你的部队并招呼你。",
  "A column of {number_of_shots} Attack Bikes sweeps past, heavy weapons hammering away in a thunderous strafing run- ": "",
  "A compact, secondary Bolter weapon often attached under the barrel of a larger firearm. It allows for rapid fire in close quarters combat.": "一种紧凑的副武器爆弹枪，常挂在较大火器的枪管下方。可在近距离战斗中快速连射。",
  "A custom suit of power armored created by master artificiers and decorated without compare, this ancient Power Armour is beyond priceless. This suit's history is ancient and its users many.": "一套由大师级工艺师打造、装饰无与伦比的定制动力装甲，这件古老装备的价值远超无价。此装甲历史古老，历经众多使用者。",
  "A daemon unbound from an Artifact wreaks havoc upon and destroys your vessel '": "一头挣脱神器束缚的恶魔在你的舰上肆虐横行，摧毁了你的舰船。",
  "A duplicate {_icon_name} icon replaced another existing one with the same name!": "",
  "A few grenades is all it takes to blow {_gender_pronouns} body to smithereens.  ": "",
  "A few have raised questions over his experience.": "少数人对他的经验提出了质疑。",
  "A form of Needle sniper rifle. Boasts a powerful telescopic sight that allows the wielder to target enemy weak points and distant foes with extreme accuracy, firing slivers of crystallized toxins.": "一种针弹狙击步枪，配备强力瞄准镜，让持用者能极度精准地瞄准敌人弱点与远处目标，发射结晶毒素碎片。",
  "A formidable laser weapon, the lascannon can pierce most vehicles or power armored targets from a tremendous range. The weapon is known for its reliability in combat.": "激光炮是强大的激光武器，能从极远距离贯穿多数载具或动力装甲目标。此武器以战场可靠性著称。",
  "A game? not only heretics but fools then begone Daemon": "一场游戏？不只是亵渎者，还有蠢货。滚吧，恶魔！",
  "A gift more valuable than most but still something I have come across before. I shall have it stored in my personal vaults.": "一份比多数礼物贵重、但也是我见过之物。我会把它收进我的私人宝库。",
  "A good soldier obeys without question. A good officer commands without doubt.": "好士兵无问服从；好军官无疑指挥。",
  "A great amount of requisiton is set aside for the event": "为活动拨出了大量征用资源",
  "A handful of loyalist {global.chapter_name} make a fighting retreat to the engine of the vessel, '": "",
  "A handful of loyalist {global.chapter_name} overload the main reactor of your vessel '": "",
  "A hastily assembled Power Armor that first started appearing during the Horus Heresy to act as a stopgap while new suits were produced and sent to loyalist legions. It excels in close combat but it has limited sensors for ranged combat.": "一种仓促组装的动力装甲，在荷鲁斯之乱期间首次出现，作为新装甲生产并运抵忠义军团前的临时替代。它近战出色，但远程战斗的传感器有限。",
  "A heavy Needler sniper rifle used by the Deathwatch for long-range anti-personnel and anti-materiel work. A highly-respected and revered weapon, it is often selected as the weapon of choice for snipers in many Deathwatch Kill-teams.": "死亡守望用于远程反人员、反器材作战的重型针弹狙击步枪。这款备受敬重的武器，常被许多死亡守望猎杀小队选为狙击手的首选。",
  "A heavy ammunition backpack commonly used by devastators in conjunction with a heavy support weapon.": "重型弹药背包，常由毁灭者与重型支援武器搭配使用。",
  "A heavy rotary autocannon with a devastating fire rate that can be counted in the hundreds per minute, in a twin mount. It is incredibly effective against infantry and lightly armored targets.": "重型旋转自动炮，双联安装，射速惊人，以每分钟数百发计。对步兵与轻型装甲目标极为有效。",
  "A heavy rotary autocannon with a devastating fire rate that can be counted in the hundreds per minute. It is incredibly effective against infantry and light armored targets.": "重型旋转自动炮，射速惊人，以每分钟数百发计。对步兵与轻型装甲目标极为有效。",
  "A heavy two-handed power axe used to rend armor and tear through multiple infantry at once.": "重型双手动力斧，用于撕裂护甲，一次斩开多名步兵。",
  "A heavy variant of the plasma gun, its power output is significantly higher and its damage capability shows. However, it is mounted in a tank turret.": "等离子枪的重型变体，功率输出显著更高，杀伤力立现。然而它安装在坦克炮塔上。",
  "A heavy variant of the plasma gun, its power output is significantly higher and its damage capability shows. However, it maintains the overheating risk of the Plasma Gun": "等离子枪的重型变体，功率输出显著更高，杀伤力立现。不过它保留了等离子枪过热的风险",
  "A heretic rarely speaks with such a kind tongue, but this is an unknowable galaxy and stranger things have happened.": "异端鲜少如此善言，但这是个难以捉摸的银河，更离奇的事也发生过。",
  "A hidden Genestealer Cult on {name()} Has been discovered by marine garrisons!": "",
  "A hidden Genestealer Cult on {name()} Has suddenly burst forth from hiding!": "",
  "A hidden Genestealer Cult on {name()} has Started a revolt.": "",
  "A huge vehicle-mounted flame weapon that fires with explosive force. The reservoir is liable to explode.": "巨大的车载火焰武器，以爆发之力喷火。其燃料箱有爆炸之虞。",
  "A huge vehicle-mounted flamethrower cannon, the heat produced by this terrifying weapon can melt armoured ceramite.": "巨大的车载喷火加农炮，这件恐怖武器产生的热量能熔化装甲陶瓷。",
  "A kind gesture, even if it is a little... pointless. I am grateful that you have seen past the foolish prejudices of your species.": "一片好意，尽管有些……无用。我很感激你能超越你种族那愚蠢的偏见。",
  "A lack of suitable forge worlds in the system has halted construction of your requested ship.": "星系内缺乏合适的铸造世界，你请求建造的舰船已停工。",
  "A large body of water meant for excersize or relaxation.": "供锻炼或休憩的大片水域。",
  "A large facility with Gene-Vaults and additional spare rooms, this structure safely stores the majority of your Gene-Seed and is ran by servitors.  Due to its secret nature you may amass Gene-Seed and Test-Slave Incubators without fear of Inquisition reprisal or taking offense.": "一座设有基因宝库与备用室的大型设施。它由奴仆机仆掌管，安全存放着你大部分基因种子。因其隐秘性质，你可囤积基因种子与试炼奴仆孵化器，而不必畏惧审判庭的报复或被其察觉。",
  "A large facility with Gene-Vaults and additional spare rooms, this structure safely stores the majority of your Gene-Seed and is ran by servitors.  Since being discovered all the contents are known to the Inquisition.  Your Gene-Seed remains protected but you may wish to build a new, secret one.": "一座设有基因宝库与备用室的大型设施。它由奴仆机仆管理，安全存放着你大部分基因种子。事发后，其一切内容已为审判庭所知。你的基因种子仍受保护，但或应另建一座隐秘新库。",
  "A large necron claw strikes at {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A large, ceramite clad gauntlet surrounded by an power energy field. Though cumbersome to use, it dishes out tremendous damage to enemies, leaving very little behind.": "覆满陶瓷装甲的巨大拳套，环绕着能量力场。虽使用笨重，却能给敌人造成巨大伤害，几乎不留活口。",
  "A large, ceramite clad gauntlets surrounded by power energy fields. Though cumbersome to use, they dish out tremendous damage to enemies, leaving very little behind.": "覆满陶瓷装甲的巨大拳套，环绕着能量力场。虽使用笨重，却能给敌人造成巨大伤害，几乎不留活口。",
  "A larger, well-stocked cookery, complete with a number of Imperial Chef servants.": "规模更大、储备充足的厨房，配有多名帝国厨师仆役。",
  "A lighter, more maneuverable version of a Storm Shield. Due to its flexibility, Combat Shields leave other hand of a Space Marine free to use other hand-to-hand weaponry.": "风暴盾更轻便、更灵活的版本。由于灵活性，战斗盾让星际战士另一只手空出，可再持一件近战武器。",
  "A logical transaction.  What is your answer, Chapter Master?": "合乎逻辑的交易。战团长，你的答复是？",
  "A loud weapon that roars with fury, this gun vaporizes flesh and armor alike. Due to heat dissipation, it has only a short range.": "一杆咆哮怒吼的枪，血肉与护甲同被汽化。因散热问题，射程较短。",
  "A ludicrous proposal, illogical and dangerous. Take it somewhere else.": "荒谬的提议，不合逻辑且危险。拿到别处去吧。",
  "A manipulator mechandendrite, also known as a Servo-arm. This artificial limb is a great aid to help trained Techmarines repair damaged vehicles on the battlefield, yet may be used in melee combat, thanks to its considerable crushing power and weight.": "一种操纵用机械触手，又名伺服臂。这条人造肢体是受过训练的技术军士在战场上维修受损载具的巨大助力，凭借其可观的碾压力与重量，也可用于近战。",
  "A marine is observing and communicating with a Death Company marine, to ensure they are responsive, when that Death Company marine drops down and suddenly begins shoveling parts of enemy corpses into his mouth.": "一名星际战士正注视着并与一名死亡连队的士兵交谈，确认他还醒着，就在此刻，那死亡连队士兵骤然倒地，开始将敌人尸体的残块一把把塞进自己口中。",
  "A massive claw slices through {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A massive heretic uprising on {n_name} threatens to plunge the star system into chaos.": "",
  "A massive plasteel bastion protects your forces.": "一座巨型塑钢堡垒守护着你的部队。",
  "A massive shockwave eminates from the marine, who is knocked out cold!  All of his equipment is damaged!": "一道巨大的冲击波从该星际战士身上迸发，他被震昏过去！他的全部装备均受损！",
  "A massive war-machine that can be piloted by an honored Astarte, who otherwise would have fallen in combat. Some of the Astartes consider this a fate worse than death": "一台庞大的战争机器，可由一位本会在战斗中陨落的受尊崇阿斯塔特驾驶。一些阿斯塔特认为这比死亡更惨的命运",
  "A massive wave of {number_of_shots} Astartes rise, their Jump Packs a furious beast. They crash down, smashing their foe- ": "",
  "A massive wave of {number_of_shots} Astartes rolls ahead on top of their mighty Bikes. They crash into enemy lines, smashing their foe- ": "",
  "A massive, ego boosting throne.": "一座恢弘、足以膨胀虚荣的王座。",
  "A master of speed covering distances quickly to enter the fray": "速度大师，迅速跨越距离投入战斗",
  "A meaningless gesture, Chapter Master, but it brings us a little closer to your inevitable demise so it is appreciated.": "战团长，这毫无意义的姿态倒是让我们离你注定的败亡更近了一步，所以聊表感激。",
  "A measure of how much punishment the creature can take. Marines can go into the negatives and still survive, but they'll require a bionic to become fighting fit once more.\\n\\nContributing factors:\\n": "一项衡量该造物所能承受伤害的指标。星际战士即使陷入负值仍可存活，但要重新投入战斗，仍需生化义肢。\\n\\n影响因素：\\n",
  "A medium-sized weapon which utilises the gravitic reaction principle most commonly seen powering grav-vehicles such as the Land Speeder.": "中型武器，运用最常见于兰德快艇等重力载具的重力反应原理。",
  "A mighty gift from a mighty ally, Chapter Master. It will be remembered as one of the many great deeds you have done for this sector.": "强者之礼来自强者之盟，战团长。这将被铭记为你为本星区立下的诸多伟业之一。",
  "A minor amount of requisition has been dedicated for the event": "为活动拨出了少量征用资源",
  "A moderate sized Arsenal, this structure has ample holding area to store any number of artifacts and wargear.  Since being discovered it may no longer hide Chaos and Daemonic wargear from routine Inquisition inspections.  You may wish to construct another Arsenal on a different planet.": "中型军械库，有充足空间存放任意数量的神器与装备。被发现后，它再也无法在审判庭例行检查中藏匿混沌与恶魔装备。你或许想在别的星球另建一座军械库。",
  "A moderate sized garage fit to hold, service, and display vehicles.": "中型车库，可容纳、维护与展示载具。",
  "A moderate sized secret Arsenal, this structure has ample holding area to store any number of artifacts and wargear.  Chaos and Daemonic items will be sent here by your Master of Relics, and due to the secret nature of its existance, the Inquisition will not find them during routine inspections.": "中型秘密军械库，有充足空间存放任意数量的神器与装备。混沌与恶魔物品将由你的圣物之主送往此处，由于它性质隐秘，审判庭在例行检查中不会发现它们。",
  "A modest, less elaborate forge able to employ a handful of Astartes or Techpriest.": "简朴的小型铸造所，可容纳少量阿斯塔特或技术神甫工作。",
  "A most auspicious gift, Chapter Master, which will not be forgotten.": "战团长，这是一份无比吉利的礼物，我们不会忘记。",
  "A mouse does not invite himself to the table of a dragon. You should learn from it and, if you work hard, perhaps one day you will be almost as insignificant.": "老鼠不会自己爬上龙的餐桌。你该向它学习——若你够努力，也许有朝一日能像它一样无足轻重。",
  "A multi-purpose medkit designed to deal with basic battlefield ailments until further medical assistance can be sought.": "多用途医疗包，用于处理基本战场伤病，直至获得进一步医疗援助。",
  "A multitude of spikes, of varying sizes, adorn it.": "大小不一的尖刺点缀其上。",
  "A non-powered suit made up of carapace armour and ballistic nylon. Includes biohazard shielding, nutrient feed, and camouflage.": "由甲壳护甲与防弹尼龙制成的无动力套装。包含生化防护、营养供给与迷彩功能。",
  "A number of diplomatic incidents occured over the period which had considerable negative effects on our disposition with the planetary governor (disposition -{_effect})": "",
  "A petty, insignificant, pointless gesture of deference but a gesture of deference nonetheless and I will remember it when my hand is around your throat.": "一个微不足道、毫无意义的恭敬姿态——但好歹也是恭敬。等我掐住你喉咙时，会记着这份情。",
  "A pistol variant of the plasma gun, this dangerous-to-use weapon has exceptional armor-piercing capabilities.": "等离子枪的手枪变体，这把使用危险的武器拥有非凡的穿甲能力。",
  "A promethium flamethrower has been built in to the bottom of the weapon.": "武器底部内置了一具普罗米修斯燃料喷火器。",
  "A proposal that needs further consideration and some negotiation.  Meet me at ": "这提议还需细加斟酌与商议。在…与我会面",
  "A putrid, corrosive stream of Daemonic vomit spews into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A rapid-firing weapon able to use a wide variety of ammunition, from mass-reactive explosive to solid shells. It has been found to be incredibly effective against large groups of targets and even Traitor Astartes to an extent.": "一种速射武器，可发射从质量反应高爆弹到实心弹的多种弹药。经实战证明，对成片目标乃至一定程度的叛徒阿斯塔特都极为有效。",
  "A rare kind of Power Weapon, a power blade mounted on the end of a long shaft, requires great skill to wield. When active, the blade becomes sheathed in a lethal haze of disruptive energy and can tear through all manners of material with ease.": "一种罕见的动力武器——装在长杆末端的力量刃，需要高超技艺才能使用。激活时，刃身被致命的干扰能量之雾笼罩，能轻易撕裂各种材料。",
  "A rare, but accurate judgement, ": "一个罕见却准确的判断，",
  "A razor-sharp claw slashes into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A recent siege in aid of the Imperium has reduced the number of your Marines greatly. You retain a normal amount of equipment, but some is damaged.": "一场援助帝国的近期围城战使你的星际战士损失惨重。你保有正常数量的装备，但部分有所损坏。",
  "A recent string of unfortunate events has left your Chapter decimated. You have very little left, will your story continue?": "一连串近期的不幸事件让你的战团损失惨重。所剩无几，你的故事还能继续吗？",
  "A relic owned by a being such as you cannot be taken at face value, much like the honeyed words of a serpent. We are watching you, Astartes.": "像你这样的存在献出的圣物，不能只看表面，正如毒蛇的蜜语不可轻信。我们正盯着你，阿斯塔特。",
  "A repulsive way to put it, Mon'keigh...but yes.": "真令人反感的说法，蒙凯……但确实如此。",
  "A roaring tide of {number_of_shots} Attack Bikes tears along the line, sidecar guns blazing without pause- ": "",
  "A robust bike that can propel an Astartes at very high speeds. Boasts highly responsive controls that allow for fluid movement on the battlefield and respectable Twin-Linked Bolters for offensive action.": "坚固的摩托，能以极高速度载着阿斯塔特飞驰。配备高度灵敏的操控，在战场上行动流畅，并装有可观的双联爆弹枪用于进攻。",
  "A room meant for displaying trophies.  May be purchased successive times.": "用于陈列战利品的房间。可多次购买。",
  "A seasoned warrior, having fought for many years": "身经百战的老兵，数年来征战不休。",
  "A series of labyrinthian corridors and veins connect the galaxy.  The planet you know as ": "一片迷宫般的走廊与甬道贯通银河。你所熟悉的星球",
  "A series of thick plasteel walls protect your forces.": "一连串厚重的塑钢墙壁守护着你的部队。",
  "A significantly heavier flamer attached to the sponsons on a vehicle.": "安装在载具侧舷炮座的显著加重的喷火器。",
  "A significantly heavier flamer typically utilized on vehicle mounts. To carry them on foot requires Power Armor.": "通常安装在载具上的显著加重的喷火器。徒步携带需动力装甲。",
  "A simple gesture, Chapter Master... but we thank you.": "举手之劳，战团长……但我们仍心怀感激。",
  "A simple solution for fighting in dark environments, searchlights serve to illuminate enemies for ease of targeting.": "黑暗环境作战的简单解决方案，探照灯用于照亮敌人、便于瞄准。",
  "A single shot hunter killer missile that serves as a powerful anti armour/aircraft deterent.": "单发猎杀者导弹，充当强大的反装甲/反飞行器威慑武器。",
  "A small army of Chapter Serfs and servitors enter the room, carrying with them a truly massive silver plate.  Bore much like a palanquin, the massive dish is covered by an equally large and decorated cloche.  As the main course inches across the room it gathers quite the number of looks.  After struggling a bit the dish is set front and center in the room, the lid removed.  Contained within is a giant, boiled Deathcoleri from Zeriah II.  The once spikey carapace is now a healthily cooked red, the crustacean smelling absolutely delicious.": "一小队战团仆役与奴仆机仆走进大厅，抬着一面巨大的银盘，仿佛抬着辇轿。巨大的盘子上盖着一只同样巨大而华美的餐盖。主菜尚未到齐便已引来不少目光。几经周折，餐盘终于放在大厅正中央，盖子被揭开。盘中卧着一只巨大的、煮熟的泽里亚二号死亡利爪虾。那原本多刺的甲壳现已熟透成漂亮的红色，这只甲壳类生物闻起来相当美味。",
  "A small mind is easily filled with faith.": "愚昧的心易于为信仰填满。",
  "A smaller variant of Bolter, intended to be useable by unaugmented humans.": "爆弹枪的小型变体，旨在让未接受改造的人类也能使用。",
  "A smaller version of the Grav-Gun which utilises the gravitic reaction principle most commonly seen powering grav-vehicles such as the Land Speeder.": "重力枪的小型版本，运用最常见于兰德快艇等重力载具的重力反应原理。",
  "A smaller, more compact version of the venerable Boltgun. This model is produced in the standard Godwyn pattern.": "经典爆弹枪更小巧紧凑的版本。此型号按标准戈德温型生产。",
  "A sound suggestion, let it be so!": "这个建议不错，就这么办！",
  "A special challenge is needed for Aspirants to be judged worthy of becoming Astartes.  After completing the Trial they then become a Neophyte, beginning implantation and training.  (This can be changed once in game, but the chosen trial here will affect the spawn characteristics of your starting Space Marines).": "申请者必须通过一项特殊挑战，方有资格被评定为星际战士。完成试炼后，他们便成为新兵，开始接受植入与训练。（游戏中可更改一次，但此处选定的试炼将影响你初始星际战士的出身特征）。",
  "A special plasma charge, this bomb can be used to seal underground caves or destroy enemy structures.": "一种特殊等离子装药，这枚炸弹可用于封堵地下洞穴或摧毁敌方建筑。",
  "A specialized Lightning Claw variant designed for Dreadnoughts, these claws are capable of ripping through enemy vehicles and infantry with ease.": "为无畏机甲设计的专用闪电爪变体，这些利爪能轻易撕开敌方载具与步兵。",
  "A standard Bolter with an underbarrel Flamer for expanded tactical utility.": "标准爆弹枪，枪管下加挂喷火器以扩展战术用途。",
  "A standard Bolter with an underbarrel Grav-Gun for expanded tactical utility.": "标准爆弹枪，枪管下加挂重力枪以扩展战术用途。",
  "A standard Bolter with an underbarrel Meltagun for expanded tactical utility.": "标准爆弹枪，枪管下加挂热熔枪以扩展战术用途。",
  "A standard Bolter with an underbarrel Plasma Gun for expanded tactical utility.": "标准爆弹枪，枪管下加挂等离子枪以扩展战术用途。",
  "A standard Bolter, a two-handed firearm that launches rocket propelled projectiles that detonate after penetrating the target. It is a versatile and iconic weapon of Adeptus Astartes, their resounding detonations carry the Emperor's Wrath.": "标准爆弹枪，一种发射火箭推进弹药的双手火器，弹丸贯穿目标后爆炸。这是阿斯塔特修会多用途的标志性武器，其响亮的爆炸承载着帝皇之怒。",
  "A standard Chainsword. It is popular among Assault Marines due to their raw power while maintaining speed.": "标准链锯剑。因其保留速度的同时拥有蛮横威力，在突击星际战士中颇受欢迎。",
  "A study fit to hold a staggering amount of tomes and scrolls.": "可容纳海量典籍与卷轴的书房。",
  "A suit dating back to the Horus Heresy, first tested by the Raven Guard. It contains boosted olfactory and auditory sensors that increase the ranged accuracy of the wearer. This however makes it more fragile to an extent.": "一套可追溯至荷鲁斯之乱时期的盔甲，最初由鸦卫测试。它强化了嗅觉与听觉传感，以提高穿戴者远程瞄准的精度，但代价是其变得更为脆弱。",
  "A suit of Adeptus Astartes power armour. The Mark can no longer be determined- it appears to be a combination of several types.": "一套阿斯塔特修会动力装甲。型号已无法判定——它似乎是数种型号的组合。",
  "A suit of light power armour, intended to be useable by the regular humans.": "一套轻型动力装甲，旨在让普通人类也能使用。",
  "A suspicious mind is a healthy mind.": "多疑之心是健康之心。",
  "A symbol that is equally weapon and holy icon given only to those trained by the Adeptus Mechanicus and have shown their devotion to the Omnissiah in battle.": "既是武器又是圣徽的象征物，仅授予受机械神教训练并在战斗中证明对万能机虔诚之人。",
  "A task best suited to the more knowledgable or wise of your Commanders": "最适于指派给更有学识或更睿智的指挥官的任务",
  "A trade of goods and services would be most useful at this time.": "眼下，货物与服务的交易最为有用。",
  "A treasured relic of the Imperium’s glorious past? You do us great honour, Chapter Master.": "帝国辉煌过往的珍稀遗宝？你令我们受宠若惊，战团长。",
  "A twin mount of rotary autocannons, boasting an incredible rate of fire numbering in the hundreds of shots fired per second.": "双联旋转自动炮，射速惊人，以每秒数百发计。",
  "A twin-linked significantly heavier flamer attached to the sponsons on a vehicle.": "安装在载具侧舷炮座的双联显著加重喷火器。",
  "A two-handed weapon that launches blobs of plasma at the target. They are considered both sacred and dangerous, overheating through rapid firing of the weapon. Overheating can result in detonation of the weapon, killing the wielder.": "一种向目标抛射等离子团的双手武器。它们既神圣又危险，快速射击会过热。过热可能导致武器自爆，杀死使用者。",
  "A vehicle thunders forward, armoured hulls crashing into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "A veteran of the many wars against the Tyranid swarms": "对抗泰伦虫群诸多战役的老兵。",
  "A vicious combat attachment that is attached to Bolters, in order to allow them to be used in melee combat.": "一种凶残的战斗配件，装在爆弹枪上，使其可用于近战。",
  "A weapon most frequently seen in the hands of Traitor Astartes, the Chainaxe uses motorized chainsaw teeth to maim and tear. Astartes often duel-wield them to increase frequency of attacks.": "链锯斧最常见于叛徒阿斯塔特之手，用电动链锯齿撕扯伤残。阿斯塔特常双持以提升攻击频率。",
  "A weapon of the Emperor, and His divine judgment, this weapon can be placed upon a planet to obliterate it entirely.": "帝皇的武器，祂的神圣裁决。此武器可投放于行星之上，将其彻底抹灭。",
  "A whole company (110) would not be confined in the huge spaces that such a ruin contain": "",
  "A wicked man speaks wicked lies, but even a stopped chrono is right twice a day.": "恶人尽说恶毒的谎言，但停摆的时钟一天也有两次正确。",
  "A {_hostile_weapon} crackles and is swung into {target_type}.  ": "",
