  "AbsltMace": "",
  "Absolutely not.  We of the Tau Empire have pride of our own to maintain.": "",
  "Accelerate recruitment with req": "使用征用点加速招募",
  "Accept": "",
  "Accessory": "配件",
  "Accipiter": "",
  "Acolytes": "",
  "Aconite": "",
  "Active Necron Tomb": "活跃死灵墓穴",
  "Adapting infantry-grade armaments for hull-mounting necessitates the manufacture of reinforced recoil-dampening cradles and high-capacity automated ammunition feeds. Enables the assembly of pintle, sponson, and turret-mounted weapon systems for the Chapter's vehicle pool.": "",
  "Adapting primary weapon frames with secondary firing units and synchronized ammunition-feed routing. This expansion allows for the assembly of multi-purpose combi-weapons and dual-linked systems.": "",
