  "Add Tags": "添加标签",
  "Add Test-Slave": "添加测试奴工",
  "Add disadvantages or decrease Chapter Stats": "添加劣势或降低战团属性",
  "Add tags to current Marine selection": "为当前选中的陆战队员添加标签",
  "Add the gene-seed to chapter vaults.": "将基因种子存入战团宝库。",
  "Add to Forge Queue": "加入锻炉队列",
