  "Adeptus Astartes": "阿斯塔特军",
  "Adeptus Astartes (": "",
  "Adeptus Mechanicus": "机械教",
  "Adeptus Mechanicus (": "",
  "Adeptus Mechanicus research within the Necron Tomb of ": "",
  "Adeptus-Dominus/ChapterMaster": "",
  "Advanced": "",
  "Advanced Ceramite Bonding": "高级陶瓷装甲键合",
  "Advanced and accurate rifles from mars given to skitarii sharpshooters": "",
  "Advanced options for colouring": "高级着色选项",
  "Advantages": "",
  "Advantages cost points, and improve the performance of your Chapter in a specific domain. You can only have one trait of the same category, shown in brackets.": "",
  "Advisor Names": "顾问姓名",
  "Aeldari Flamer": "灵族火焰喷枪",
  "Aeldari Plasma Pistol": "灵族等离子手枪",
  "Aeldari Power Blades": "灵族动力刃",
  "Aeldari Power Weapon": "灵族动力武器",
  "After": "",
  "After a brief descent all of the drop-pods smash down, followed quickly by your marines pouring free.  Their ranks are made up of ": "短暂下落之后，所有空投舱轰然砸落，随后你的星际战士如潮涌出。他们的队伍由以下兵力组成：",
  "After a brief descent all of the drop-pods smash down.  Your marines exit the vehicles, shaking off their vertigo and nausea with varying degrees of success.  Their ranks are made up of ": "短暂下落之后，所有空投舱轰然砸落。你的星际战士走出载具，不同程度地压下眩晕与恶心。他们的队伍由以下兵力组成：",
  "After closing this message, you will be prompted to describe what you were doing.\\n": "关闭此消息后，系统将提示你描述当时的操作。\n",
  "After disabling an enemy vessel your Astartes will launch a new boarding mission at the nearest enemy.": "瘫痪敌方舰船后，你的阿斯塔特将向最近的敌人发起新的登舰任务。",
  "After ensuring proper placement your marines return to their vessels.  A short while later the Exterminatus activates- the air itself ignites across ": "确保布放无误后，你的星际战士撤回舰上。片刻之后，灭绝令如期降临——整个天空的烈焰如幕布般升起。",
  "After eventual investigation it appears the eldar anticipated the would be ambushers and turned the tides. {_squad_units[_dead_marine].name_role()}s body is eventually discovered some way off from the main battle his rent armour and body showing the extent of combat that must have occured": "",
  "After every battle the Astartes have a chance to feast upon their fallen enemies, or seldom, their allies.": "每场战斗后，阿斯塔特都有机会噬食倒下的敌人，偶尔是他们的盟友。",
  "After exploring for many the exploration team reach a large chamber branching into three halways one of which is sealed by a thick blast door": "经过长时间探索，探索队抵达一座通向三条走廊的巨大殿堂，其中一条被厚重的防爆门封死。",
  "After several hours of descent the entrance to the Necron Tomb finally looms ahead- dancing, sickly green light shining free.  Your marine confirms that the Plasma Bomb is ready.": "历经数小时下降，死灵墓穴的入口终于在前方隐隐浮现——病态绿光摇曳闪耀。你的星际战士确认等离子炸弹已就绪。",
  "Agreed Garrison of {name()}": "",
  "Agreed Garrison of {name()} complete": "",
  "Agreed, may the Emperor bless us both.": "同意，愿帝皇护佑你我。",
  "Agri": "",
  "Ah, the ever cautious Mon'keigh, too scared by the shadow of his precious Emperor to try something new, to adventure a little. Hardly surprising.": "",
  "Ah, you have something that might possibly allow us both to benefit of The Greater Good?": "",
  "Ahhhh.  You require something, ": "",
  "Akrasiel": "",
  "Alcohol": "",
  "Alfie": "",
  "Alien contamination in ": "",
  "All Infantry": "全部步兵",
  "All Ships": "全部舰船",
  "All Vehicles": "全部载具",
  "All about battle and smashing foes or protecting allies.": "专注于作战，粉碎敌人或守护盟友。",
  "All ceremite on the weapon has been substituted for polished adamantium.": "",
  "All loyalty changes are halved": "所有忠诚度变化减半",
  "All of the successors for {name()} are removed or otherwise made indisposed.  Paperwork is slightly altered.  Rather than any sort of offical one of your Chapter Serfs is installed as the Planetary Governor.  The planet is effectively under your control.": "",
  "All of your Astartes and the Mechanicus Research party have been killed down to the last man.  The research is a bust, and the Adeptus Mechanicus is furious with your chapter for not providing enough security.  Relations with them are worse than before.": "",
  "All of your Astartes and the Mechanicus Research party have been killed down to the last man.  The research is a bust.  To make matters worse the Necron Tomb has fully awakened- countless numbers of the souless machines are now pouring out of the tomb.  The Adeptus Mechanicus are furious with your chapter.": "",
  "All souls call out for salvation.": "所有灵魂都在呼唤救赎。",
  "All tag filters will remain in place re-open the tag manager to add oor remove filters": "",
  "All that can be seen twists and shifts, as though looking through a massive, distorted lens.  ": "",
  "All the bass one could ever imaginably need.": "",
  "All these schemes i can hardly be bothered to keep track. Do this and you shall have fates favour.": "",
  "All were completed to a standard STC compliant quality!": "全部按标准建造模板（STC）规格完成！",
  "All you space marines seem da same ta me. I reckon we'll be seein' each other soon enough...": "",
  "Allied": "",
  "Allied Fleets:": "盟军舰队：",
  "Allies": "盟友",
  "Allies:": "盟友：",
  "Allow Astartes Transfer": "允许阿斯塔特调动",
  "Allow Other Competitors": "允许其他竞争者",
  "Allow mass equip": "允许批量装备",
  "Allow the official successor to become Planetary Governor.": "允许正式继任者成为行星总督。",
  "Along with using a lower-capacity fuel tank it has much reduced range, which makes it suited for assault and close-combat purposes, incinerating foes at short range. The weapon is often used by assault squads.": "",
  "Alpha": "阿尔法",
  "Alpha Legion": "阿尔法军团",
  "Alpha Plus": "阿尔法加",
  "Alpha Strike: targeting Chapter Master at {resolve_block_label(cm_block)} unit_index={cm_index}": "",
  "Alright ‘umie, whatcha want? I got betta things ta do today but ‘umies are always good for a laugh so I'll give ya a little while.": "",
  "Also called the 'Soul's Armour', this amulet has a powerful built-in shield generator. They are an icon of the Imperial Creed and the Emperor's Protection.": "",
  "Always bet on Duke.": "永远押注「驻军公爵」。",
  "Amasec": "",
  "Amazons": "",
  "Ambushers": "",
  "Amends made with Ecclesiarchy enemy.": "已与国教一方的敌人和解。",
  "Amends made with Imperium.": "已与帝国和解。",
  "Amends made with Inquisition enemy.": "已与审判庭的敌人和解。",
  "Amends made with Mechanicus enemy.": "已与机械教一方的敌人和解。",
  "Amethyst": "",
  "Ammo: {ammo}#": "",
  "Among the first issued to the Space Marine Legions. Having additional plating and shield generators installed within the shoulder pads resulted in severe straining of the suit's exoskeleton and reduced the wearer's maneuverability, leading to its decline among some legions.": "",
  "An A": "",
  "An Aegis Defense Line protects your forces.": "一列宙盾防御带守护着你的部队。",
  "An Artifact has been found within the ancient ruins. It appears to be a {fetch_artifact(_art_idx).get_type_name()} but should be brought to the Lexicanum and identified posthaste.": "",
  "An Artifact has been retrieved from the Space Hulk and stowed upon {loc}.  It appears to be a {fetch_artifact(last_artifact).get_type_name()} but should be brought home and identified posthaste.": "",
  "An Artifact was discovered within the ancient ruins, but no suitable ship was available for its retrieval. The sacred object remains unclaimed.": "古代废墟中发现了一件神器，却没有合适的舰船将其运回。这件圣物至今无人认领。",
  "An Aspirant’s spiritual and mental capability is every bit as important as his physical characteristics.  It is wise to impose Trials not upon their body, but on the mind.  Either through psychic powers, chemical agents, or endurance trials, the Aspirant’s willpower is tested.  Those unworthy do not survive the stress and trauma placed upon their hearts- only those whose minds are proven to be unbreakable are welcomed into our ranks.": "申请者的灵性与心智之素养，与其身体条件同等重要。与其将试炼施加于肉体，不如施于精神。无论是通过灵能、化学药剂还是耐力试炼，申请者的意志都会受到考验。承受不了这些压力与心灵创伤者无法生还——唯有心智证明坚不可摧者方被迎入我们之中。",
  "An Astartes Shotgun capable of firing slug and other specialist munitions deadly up close but loses effectiveness at range.": "一种阿斯塔特霰弹枪，可发射独头弹及其他特种弹药，近距致命但远距离威力衰减。",
  "An E": "",
  "An I": "",
  "An Imperial Fists descendant, the Crimson Fists are more level-minded than their Progenitor and brother chapters.  They suffer the same lacking zygotes as their ancestors, and more resemble the Ultramarines in their balanced approach to combat. After surviving a devastating Ork WAAAGH! the chapter clings dearly to its future.": "帝国之拳的后代，绯红之拳比其基因祖先与兄弟战团更为冷静克己。他们继承了祖先相同的缺陷基因种子，且在平衡的战斗方式上更接近极限战士军。在一场毁灭性的兽人WAAAGH！浩劫中幸存后，他们紧抓自己得来不易的未来。",
  "An Inquisitor is trusting you with a special mission.": "一位审判官委托你一项特殊使命。",
  "An Inquisitor is trusting you with a special mission.  The planet {string(_star.name)} {scr_roman(planet)}": "",
  "An O": "",
  "An STC Fragment appears to be located upon {name()}": "",
  "An STC Fragment has been retrieved from the Space Hulk and safely stowed away.  It is ready to be decrypted or gifted at your convenience.": "一块STC碎片已从太空巨舰中打捞并安全存放，随时可根据你的安排解密或转赠。",
  "An STC Fragment upon {name()} appears to be located deep within a Mechanicus Vault": "",
  "An acceptable proposition.  You will have to talk it over with my scribes.": "可以接受的提议。你需要与我的书记官商谈。",
  "An advanced engine that increases tactical flexibility by enabling more options for movement and faster repositioning.": "先进引擎，通过提供更多移动选项与更快的重新部署，提升战术灵活性。",
  "An advanced medical field kit these allow Apothecaries to heal wounds or recover Gene-Seed from fallen Astartes.": "先进野战医疗包，让药剂师能治疗伤员或从阵亡阿斯塔特体内回收基因种子。",
  "An advanced shield capable of providing extreme protection to heavy vehicles.": "能为重型载具提供极致防护的先进护盾。",
  "An advanced thermal weapon from a bygone era, Volkite Culverins are able to ignite entire formations of enemy forces. In this case it is mounted to the sponsons on a vehicle.": "来自往昔时代的先进热能武器，伏尔凯炮能点燃整片敌军阵形。此处它被安装在载具侧舷炮座上。",
  "An advanced thermal weapon from a bygone era, Volkite sakers are optimized for spreading damage across swaths of enemy troops.": "来自往昔时代的先进热能武器，伏尔凯轻炮专为在大片敌军中扩散伤害而优化。",
  "An advanced, psychically-attuned close combat weapon that is only fully effective in the hands of a psyker.": "先进的灵能同调近战武器，只有灵能者手持时才能发挥全部威力。",
  "An ancient Plasma Cannon variant born in the bowels of Mother Mars. Once a staple of heavy weapons squads in the time of Legiones Astartes, now a revered relic with power beyond compare with any modern weapons, even those made in the forges of Mars and Ryza in this dark age. Sharing some design and components with Ryzan patterns, it features the same purple glow that makes them so easily distinguishable.": "诞生于火星母亲深处的古代等离子炮变体。它曾是星际军团时代重型武器小队的常备武器，如今是超越一切现代武器的敬仰遗宝，即使黑暗时代的火星与瑞萨锻造之物亦无法相比。它与瑞萨型号共享部分设计与组件，同样带有那标志性的紫色辉光，使其极易辨认。",
  "An ancient artifact, these powerful conversion field generators are granted to high ranking battle brothers or heroes of the chapter. Bearers are often looked to for guidance by their fellow Astartes.": "古老神器，这些强大的转换力场发生器被授予高阶战斗兄弟或战团英雄。持有者常被同袍视为指引。",
  "An ancient relic of the Dark Age of Technology, the Heavy Conversion Beamer is a marvel of destructive science rarely entrusted to Imperial commanders. This esoteric weapon channels vast reserves of energy into a focused beam of coruscating light, tearing matter apart at the molecular level and converting it into raw energy in a cataclysmic chain reaction. The weapon’s lethality grows with distance — the further its target, the more apocalyptic the discharge. To stand at the far end of a Heavy Conversion Beamer’s wrath is to be annihilated in a searing blaze that leaves nothing but scorched ruin in its wake. Few battlefields have witnessed its fury and remained unchanged, for the weapon is as much a terror to its enemies as a reminder of the Imperium’s dwindling grasp on its most potent technologies.": "暗科技时代的远古遗物，重型转换光束炮是一门毁灭性的科学奇迹，鲜少受托帝国统率。这件深奥的武器将庞大的能量汇聚成一道耀眼的灼光，在分子层面撕裂物质，并在毁灭性的连锁反应中将其转变为纯粹的原始能量。武器威力随距离递增——目标越远，迸发出的终结越骇人。站立于光束怒威尽头，便是在灼烧炼狱中被彻底抹灭，身后徒留焦骸。极少战场见证其怒火之后还能原样留存，因这武器对敌人是恐怖，对帝国自身则提醒：它对最强悍科技的掌控日渐萎缩。",
  "An ancient set of Power Armor dating back to the early Great Crusade. The Mark III has heavier armor plating but is far heavier then its contemporaries.": "可追溯至大远征早期的古老动力装甲。III型装甲板更厚重，但比同期型号重得多。",
  "An arcane hood that protects Psykers from enemy psychic powers and enhances control of their psychic abilities.": "神秘兜帽，保护灵能者免受敌方灵能侵害，并增强对其灵能能力的掌控。",
  "An archaic twin-linked autocannon design dating back to the Great Crusade. The Reaper Autocannon is effective against infantry and armored targets. This version is mounted onto vehicles.": "可追溯至大远征的古老双联自动炮设计。收割者自动炮对步兵与装甲目标均有效。此版本安装在载具上。",
  "An armoured column of {_hostile_shots} vehicles smashes into {target_type}, grinding everything in its path.  ": "",
  "An armoured column of {number_of_shots} vehicles smashes into the enemy, grinding everything in its path- ": "",
  "An attachment for the front of vehicles, useful for clearing difficult terrain and can be used as an improvised weapon. ": "安装在载具前端的配件，用于清除复杂地形，也可充当临时武器。",
  "An ego is nothing more than a tool for the darkness to use against a servant of the Emperor. Say what you will of me.": "自负不过是黑暗用来对付帝皇仆从的工具。随你怎么评价我。",
  "An emblem of a Fire Drake is embossed on the cover.": "封面上压印着火蜥的徽记。",
  "An enclosure with simulated greenery and foilage meant to hold beasts.": "带模拟草木环境的围场，用于圈养野兽。",
  "An enemy has been made within the ": "",
  "An extremely finely crafted scope, with several lenses, sits on top.": "顶部装有一具极尽精工、多镜片组成的瞄准镜。",
  "An honourable and venerated chapter, the Ultramarines are considered to be amongst the best of the best. Their Primarch was the author of the great tome of the “Codex Astartes”, and they are considered exemplars of what a perfect Space Marine Chapter should be like.": "一个受崇敬的战团，极限战士军素来被视为出类拔萃中的出类拔萃。他们的原体著有伟大典籍《阿斯塔特圣典》，他们被视为完美星际战士战团应有的表率。",
  "An interesting proposal.  I look forward to the fruition of this deal.": "有趣的提议。期待这笔交易的成果。",
  "An obscenely large Chainsword, this two-handed weapon can carve through flesh and plasteel with equal ease.": "一柄大得离谱的链锯剑，这件双手武器能同样轻易地切开血肉与塑钢。",
  "An open mind is like a fortress with its gates unbarred and unguarded.": "开放的思想如同城门大开、无人把守的要塞。",
  "An unfair bargain does no good for any... but you force our hand.": "不公平的交易对谁都没好处……但你是逼我们出手。",
  "An unlikely alliance, at best.  Still, it shall happen.": "充其量是个不可能的联盟。不过，它终究会成。",
  "An unreasonable trade, whatever our working relationship might be. I refuse.": "无论我们的工作关系如何，这笔交易都不合理。我拒绝。",
  "Ancient": "",
  "Ancient Armoury": "远古军械库",
  "Ancient Blades of various origins smited through arcane forging or lost techniques, these blades are deadly beyond belief. These peerless blades slice through ceramite and flesh with ease.": "",
  "Ancient Blades of various origins smithed through arcane forging or lost techniques, these blades are deadly beyond belief. These peerless blades slice through ceramite and flesh with ease.": "",
