  "Bionic Augmentation is something a unit can do to both enhance their capabilities, but also replace a missing limb to get back into the fight.": "生化增强既能让部队强化自身能力，也能替换缺失肢体重返战场。",
  "Bionic {part_display}": "",
  "Bionics": "",
  "Bionics may be given to wounded Astartes to quickly get them back into a combat-ready state, replacing damaged flesh. This is utilized when a Astarte enters a critical state.": "可为负伤的阿斯塔特装设生化义体，以损毁之躯快速重归作战状态。当阿斯塔特陷入垂危状态时便会采用此法。",
