  "Boarding Shield": "登船护盾",
  "Boarding other ships is the specialty of your Chapter. Your Chapter is more lethal when boarding ships, have dedicated boarding squads, and two extra strike cruisers.": "登舰作战是贵团专长。你的战团登舰时更为致命，拥有专职登舰小队，并额外配备两艘突击巡洋舰。",
