  "Born Leader": "天生领袖",
  "Born with a guardian's heart, they vow to shield their charges, defending them unto death": "生而怀守护之心，誓死护卫所托之人",
  "Brandish Bloody Trophies": "挥舞鲜血战利品",
  "Brave are they who know everything yet fear nothing.": "知一切而无所畏惧者，方为勇士。",
  "Brave sky warriors hailing from the icy deathworld of Fenris, the Space Wolves are a non-Codex compliant chapter, and deadly in close combat.  They fight on their own terms and damn any who wish otherwise.": "来自芬里斯冰寒死世界的天空勇士，太空野狼是不合圣典的战团，近战致命。他们以自己的方式来战，毫不在意他人如何想。",
