  "Bright Lance": "辉光长矛",
  "Bringers": "",
  "Bronze-clad Astartes of unknown Founding, the Minotaurs prefer to channel their righteous fury in a massive storm of fire, with tanks and artillery. They could be considered the Inquisition’s attack dog, since they often attack fellow chapters suspected of heresy.": "身披青铜甲的阿斯塔特，建团时期不明。米诺陶战团偏爱以坦克与火炮将义怒倾泻成漫天火雨。他们可被视作审判庭的猎犬，常讨伐疑似叛教的兄弟战团。",
  "Brothers": "",
  "Brothers, hear my words! It is time to embark on a sacred journey of redemption, a penitence crusade to cleanse our souls. Our past wrongdoings have led us astray form the Emperor, but through unwavering determination and righteous deeds, we shall forge a path to absolution. With every battle fought, every sacrifice made, we shall restore honor to our name and rekindle the flame of righteousness within. ": "兄弟们，听我一言！是时候踏上神圣的赎罪之旅，一场净化灵魂的苦修远征。我们昔日的过错使我们偏离了帝皇，但凭坚定的决心与正义之举，我们将铸就一条救赎之路。每一场战斗、每一次牺牲，都将重振战团之名，重燃心中正义之火。",
  "Brown": "",
  "Brute": "",
  "Buffer {buffer} not found!": "",
  "Bug Reporter": "BUG 报告器",
  "Build": "",
