  "Build Vehicle Hanger({upgrade_cost} req)": "",
  "Build: {0}": "构建版本：{0}",
  "Bulk": "",
  "Burn the heretic. Kill the mutant. Purge the unclean.": "烧死异端。杀死变种人。清洗不洁者。",
  "Burna": "",
  "Burna Boy": "火枪小子",
  "Burst Rifle": "连发步枪",
  "But still I am puzzled by you /noble/ Astartes. You come before me and put yourself at my mercy. I could extinguish your life in an instant, crush you beneath my boot heel faster than the lowliest insect. These are not the actions of a Space Marine. Long have you fought for Him. So tell me then Astartes, why do you come to me now?": "",
  "Buy": "",
  "By Holy Terra, I need but one more reason to wipe the stain of your existence from the universe and if you do not cease trading in Genetic material, I will have it.": "",
  "By striking at me, you strike at the entire Imperium! You will live to regret this.": "",
  "By the Blood of Sanguinius": "以圣吉里乌斯之血起誓",
  "By the sacred oath I have sworn, I bear witness to your darkest secrets. Know this: I am compelled to report your heresy to the Inquisition. Redemption or retribution, their verdict shall decide. May the Emperor's mercy guide your path.": "",
