  "Commonly referred to as Power Maul, is a blunt weapon surrounded by a power field. It's quite different from the less lethal Shock Maul, which is a similar type of close combat weapon. In the hands of a skilled warrior, the Power Mace is not just a weapon, it's a statement of power and authority in the grim darkness of far future.": "",
  "Compact and double-barreled, this bolt weapon is inaccurate but grants an enormous amount of firepower. Its psychological effect on the enemy should not be understated.": "",
