  "Disruption Field Generation": "干扰场生成",
  "Distribute Scouts": "分派侦察兵",
  "Distribute Scouts\\nCheck to have your Scouts split across ships in the fleet.": "",
  "Distribute Veterans": "分派老兵",
  "Distribute Veterans\\nCheck to have your Veterans split across the fleet.": "",
  "Disturbing Voice": "令人不安的声音",
  "Do Nothing": "无所作为",
  "Do not attempt exchanges with those so far above you, lapdog of the Corpse Emperor, it makes you look even more idiotic than you already do.": "",
  "Do not attempt to sway the mind of an Inquisitor, Chapter Master, it cannot be done.": "",
  "Do not be fictitious, Chapter Master.  What is it you covet?": "别耍花招，战团长。你究竟想要什么？",
  "Do not delude yourself in thinking I was truly going to trade with you. Much of my interest was a ruse.": "",
  "Do not insult me with such an offer.": "不要用这种提议侮辱我。",
  "Do not mourn your fallen, mewling wretch of the Imperium.  Their deaths were not in vain.  Each was a sacrifice to the Gods of the Warp and you pleased them greatly this day.  For there is no paradise at the side of the False Emperor awaiting them, no glorious final battle.  There is only the Warp.  Even now their souls writhe in torment as they are chewed by the teeth of madness, and they will do so for all eternity.  This same fate, and more, awaits you.": "",
  "Do not presume that I come to you out of admiration or seeking friendship.  I merely wish to trade you enough rope to hang yourself with.": "",
  "Do not presume to understand us well enough to appreciate the full breadth and complexity of our actions.": "",
  "Do not presume, Chapter Master, for you too will be judged by the Inquisition.": "",
  "Do not repeat": "勿再重复",
  "Do not think me ungrateful but I am a little suspicious as to what has caused this sudden largesse. Perhaps this gift is not as pure as it seems?": "",
  "Do not think me your fool whom you can ask to do whatever you wish.": "",
  "Do not think that you can demand everything because you are an Astartes. I decline.": "",
  "Do not trifle with me, worm.": "别戏弄我，蠢货。",
  "Do not waste my time with incongruous statements.": "",
  "Do not waste my time.": "不要浪费我的时间。",
  "Do not worry, thrall of the corpse Emperor, I shall grant you both death and freedom from your bonds of ‘loyalty'.": "",
  "Do nothing.": "什么也不做。",
  "Do you need help to kill some heretics?": "需要帮忙杀些异端吗？",
  "Do you suppose me to be mad? Do you judge me by your own standard? No.": "",
  "Do you take me as a fool, {obj_ini.master_name}?  Even in the Eye there are whispers of your running to and fro at the Inquisition’s beck and call, like a dog playing fetch. You’re a well-trained, and maybe even a clever, dog. I’ve killed so many clever dogs in my time. How do I know this isn’t just a hopelessly doomed plot to try and kill me, hatched by your Inquisition masters still holding your leash?": "",
  "Do you think simple gifts will make us firm friends? I think not, you villainous cur! Away with you, though I will keep this gift, if only to deprive you of it.": "",
  "Do you want to open the latest release page in your browser?": "要在浏览器中打开最新发布页面吗？",
  "Do you want to save your Chapter?": "要保存你的战团吗？",
  "Do you want to send the error log, debug log, and your last autosave to our Discord as a bug report? The process is automated and takes a few seconds, you won't notice anything.": "",
  "Do you wish to trade with me for some of the resources in my possession?": "",
  "Doesn't have black carapace installed and therefore can't use power armour to its maximum potential.\\n": "",
