  "Dragon Scales are an advanced armour utilized by tech priests, it is remarkably lightweight for the protection it affords and is often greatly modified by it's wearer while also being designed to directly interface with the user's cybernetic body.": "龙鳞甲是技术神甫使用的先进护甲，以提供的防护而言异常轻便，穿戴者常大幅改装，且设计为直接与穿戴者的机械义体相连。",
