  "Dun't sound like fun, Spash Mareen. I fink I'll take the boys for a scrap someplace else.": "",
  "During the Great Crusade, there came a need for a hand-held weapon of high rate of fire and respectable firepower that's easy to manufacture. Some Techpriest, or perhaps a Techmarine, put two bolters together and thus the Combi-Bolter was born. Phased out by the Storm Bolter, it is nevertheless a respectable weapon and a relic of more civilised times.": "",
