  "Eta: {_cur_slave.eta} months": "",
  "Even Astartes are held to the rule of Law. And those laws decree that Gene-seed is to remain within the Chapter of its origin.": "",
  "Even a man who has nothing can still offer his life.": "纵是一无所有的人，仍可献出生命。",
  "Even before your rise to Chapter Master you were a renowned warrior, nearly without compare.  Increases Chapter Master Experience and all stats.": "",
  "Even in death they still serve. Your Chapter places a staunch reverence for its forebears and has a number of additional Venerable Dreadnoughts in service.": "",
  "Even in the face of unsurmountable odds this marine will hold defiantly as befitting a son of Dorn": "",
