  "Expect consequences for this offense.": "此罪必有后果。",
  "Expected. You have done nothing than fulfill my projected outcome. If you think yourself clever for refusing or especially loyal to your leader, do not. You are no more fervent or intelligent than any other Mon'keigh soldier.": "",
