  "Fleet Based": "舰队驻留",
  "Fleet Based\\nRather than a homeworld, your Chapter begins near their recruiting world.  The fleet includes a Battle Barge, which serves as a mobile base, and powerful ship.": "舰队基业\n贵团没有母星，而是以招募世界为起点。舰队中包含一艘作为机动基地与强力战舰的战斗驳舰。",
  "Fleet Combat Ended- Loss - Enemy:": "舰队战斗结束——败北——敌方：",
  "Fleet Combat Ended- Victory - Enemy:": "舰队战斗结束——胜利——敌方：",
