  "Force Dome": "灵能穹盾",
  "Force Staff": "灵能权杖",
  "Force Sword": "灵能剑",
  "Force Weapon": "灵能武器",
  "Force weapons and gear necessitate the inclusion of rare psycho-conductive materials and warp-attuned crystalline circuits within the blade or haft to channel psychic energy. This allows the forge to produce specialized armaments for the Librarium.": "",
