  "Forge Worlds": "锻炉世界",
  "Forge has a vehicle hanger": "锻炉配有载具库",
  "Forged in the forges of Mars and carried into battle by the mightiest of the Emperor's warriors, the Kheres Assault Cannon is a weapon of devastating reputation. Its rotary barrels roar with unceasing fury, unleashing a deluge of mass-reactive shells that tear through flesh, ceramite, and adamantium alike.": "",
  "Forges: {_forge_gain}#": "",
  "Forging high-strength magnetic containment coils and hydrogen-fuel canisters to safely harness superheated matter. This expansion allows for the production of plasma-based weapons and their critical safety-venting systems.": "",
  "Forgiveness is earned, not given.  Show us your worth, Chapter Master.": "",
