  "Grot Blasta": "小鬼爆枪",
  "Ground Combat - {(defeat ? ": "",
  "Ground Combat Started": "地面战斗开始",
  "Grovelling before The Greater Good?  Do you have no pride?": "在“至善”面前卑躬屈膝？你难道毫无自尊？",
