  "HP remaining": "剩余生命",
  "HTTP {_http_status}, skipping": "",
  "Ha, I know ya dun't mean that!": "哈，俺知道你不是真心的！",
  "Ha, sounds like a good time but dere's too many squigs on me plate right now.": "",
  "Ha, this is gunna be a whole lot of fun! I'm in!": "哈，这肯定会很好玩！俺算一个！",
  "Ha, you givin' me a somefin ta shove down your throat, beaky!?": "",
  "Hacks": "",
  "Had the best instruction in the imperium on technology from the Tech Priests of Mars": "",
  "Haemorrhage": "",
  "Hail My lord.##": "向我的领主致敬。##",
  "Hail {obj_ini.name[0][0]}! You asked for a report?\\n\\n": "",
  "Hail, Chapter Master. Were it not a logical fallacy, I would wish you luck in your coming endeavors.": "",
  "Hail, hero of ": "",
  "Hail, hero of {sector}, how may I assist you this day?": "",
  "Hailing from the Asharn Marches and having established their homeworld on the planet Dekara, these proud sons of Dorn suffer from an extreme lack of supplies, Ork raids, and more. Though under strength and lacking equipment, they managed to forge an interstellar kingdom loyal to both Emperor and Imperium.": "",
  "Half a standard company (55) could easily operate effectivly in the many wide spaces and caverns": "",
  "Half-way through the mission a small army of Praetorian Servitors and Skitarii bear down upon your men.  The Mechanicus guards seem to be upset.": "",
  "Hammer of Wrath": "天谴之锤",
  "Hammer of Wrath(M)": "天谴之锤（近战）",
  "Hammerhead": "",
  "Hand Flamer": "手持喷火器",
  "Hand over all Chaos and Daemonic Artifacts": "交出所有混沌与恶魔神器",
  "Hands": "",
  "Happiness is a delusion of the weak.": "幸福是弱者自欺的幻象。",
  "Happy Hunting": "猎运亨通",
  "Harlequin Troupe": "笑神剧团",
  "Harlequin presence Report": "笑神剧团现身报告",
  "Harlequin's Kiss": "笑神之吻",
  "Harsh Beginnings": "艰难开端",
  "Has a bionic {_body_parts_display[i]}.": "",
  "Has a faulty Catalepsean Node reducing his awareness when tired.": "",
  "Has an Assignment rating of {_psionic_assignment} ({psionic}) ": "",
  "Has managed to galvanise the populace to overcome the former governor of the planet turning much of the local pdf to it's cause, it must be stopped, lest it spread.": "",
  "Has many bionic replacements.": "拥有众多仿生改造。",
  "Has no bodily augmentations besides his astartes gene-seed and organs.": "",
  "Has some bionic replacements.": "拥有部分仿生改造。",
  "Has the attention of Khorne": "受恐虐注视",
  "Hated": "仇视",
  "Hatred is the emperor's greatest gift to humanity.": "憎恨是帝皇赐予人类最伟大的礼物。",
  "Have a care that you do not overstep the mark, Chapter Master, I see no reason to accept such a trade.": "",
  "Have a deep mistrust and loathing of technology": "对科技深怀不信任与厌恶",
  "Have many talents but being fast ain't one of them": "多才多艺，却与“快”无缘",
  "Have you finally seen the light, at long last?": "你终于开窍了？",
  "Having squads assigned to Garrison Duty will increase relations with a planet over time, it will also bolster planet defence forces in case of attack, and reduce corruption growth. Press G to toggle": "",
  "Havoc": "",
  "Havoc Launcher": "浩劫发射器",
  "Hawks": "",
  "Hazzards": "",
  "He Built It": "他建造了它",
  "He begins to gibber as psychic backlash overtakes him.": "灵能反噬袭来，他开始语无伦次地胡言乱语。",
  "He explodes into a cloud of gore, splattering guts and ceramite across the battlefield.": "他炸成一团血雾，内脏与陶瓷甲碎片飞溅整个战场。",
  "He failed to work effectively with the existing chain of command": "他未能与现有指挥链有效协作",
  "He is disliked by many.": "他为人所厌恶。",
  "He is generally well liked": "他颇受欢迎",
  "He is like by all of his tech brothers": "他的技术兄弟们都喜欢他",
  "He is not generally well liked": "他不怎么受欢迎",
  "He is not unanimously liked.": "",
  "He lights on fire from the inside out, burning in agony!": "他由内而外地燃起，在剧痛中焚尽！",
  "He mostly disliked": "",
  "He must brought into the guided sphere of the librarium immediately or else dealt with by other methods for the good of the chapter.": "必须立即将他纳入图书馆员的影响范围，否则为战团之故，也只能以其他方式处置了。",
  "He who keeps silent consents.": "沉默即默许。",
