  "Hex": "",
  "Hey, if it isn't me favorite ‘umie! What can I do for ya? Want some help with some skumgrods, a quick trade or just come to chat with old ": "",
  "Hidden Secret Base": "隐秘基地",
  "Hidden armoury that stores unused Chaos and Daemonic artifacts, preventing them from discovery.": "",
  "Hidden gene-vault that off-sources the majority of your Gene-Seed and Test-Slave Incubators.": "",
  "Hidden {display_type} on {name} {scr_roman(run)} has been completed.": "",
