  "High Penetration": "高穿透",
  "Highly": "",
  "Hippodrome": "",
  "Hippos": "",
  "Hirelings": "",
  "His gene-seed is pure and has no mutations.\\n": "他的基因种子纯净无变异。\n",
  "His mind is burned fiercely by the warp.": "他的心智被亚空间剧烈灼烧。",
  "His mind is seared by the warp, now unable to cast more powers for {marine_casting_cooldown[unit_id]} hours.": "",
  "His particularly grueling regimes and standards imposed upon the senior officers of the pdf caused friction with physical injury being caused to one officer": "他在行星防卫军高级军官身上强加的严苛训练与标准引发了摩擦，甚至造成一名军官身体受伤。",
  "His rare talent is of great benefit to the chapter and could one day be a candidate for Chief of the Librariam.": "他罕见的天赋对战团裨益甚大，有朝一日或可成为智库长之职的候选人。",
  "His rare talent is of great benefit to the chapter and will likely one day be a candidate for Chief of the librariam if he does not succumb to either the material or immaterium.": "他罕见的天赋对战团裨益甚大，若不被物质或非物质所惑，或将有朝一日成为智库长之职的候选人。",
  "Hive": "",
  "Hive Fleet": "虫巢舰队",
  "Hive Tyrant": "巢穴暴君",
  "HllGun": "",
  "HllRifle": "",
  "Hmm.  Agreed.  I hope that this will pave the way to better relations overall.": "",
  "Hmm.  I will say yes...this time.": "嗯……这一次，我答应你。",
  "Hmm... perhaps you are not beyond redemption.  May the Greater Good be with you, Chapter Master.": "",
  "HndFlmr": "",
  "Hold a Memorial": "举行纪念仪式",
  "Holds a massive feast and celebration for your astartes.": "为你的阿斯塔特举行盛大宴席与庆典。",
  "Home Spwan\\nLocation": "出生点\n位置",
  "Home System Planets": "母星系行星",
  "Home warp access": "母港亚空间通路",
  "Homeworld": "",
  "Homeworld Rule": "母星规则",
  "Homeworld\\nYour Chapter has a homeworld that they base on.  Contained upon it is a massive Fortress Monastery, which provides high levels of defense and automated weapons.": "母星\n你的战团以一颗母星为基地。其上坐落着宏伟的要塞修道院，提供极高防御与自动化武器。",
  "Honed and tempered in the flames of war this marine has chained the emotions that killed his genesire": "",
  "Hono": "",
  "Honor to Allies": "盟友之荣",
  "Honorable": "",
  "Honoring: ": "",
  "Honour Guard": "荣誉卫队",
  "Honoured ally, you have performed your function with incredible efficiency.": "",
  "Hope is the first step on the road to disappointment.": "希望是通往失望之路的第一步。",
  "Hormagaunt": "",
  "Horned": "",
  "Hornets": "",
  "Horrible": "",
  "Host": "",
  "Hostile": "敌对",
  "Hounds": "",
  "How brutish, how dirty. I shall fear to put it down, in case it contaminates part of my Craftworld. Perhaps the void would be a better place for it?": "",
  "How dare you offer us such an artifact!": "你竟敢献上如此神器！",
  "How diplomatic your Chapter is. \\nA low score will lower starting dispositions of Imperial factions and make disposition increases less likely to occur.": "",
  "How easily new mutations and corruption can occur with your Chapter's gene-seed. \\nAffects the amount of random mutations your existing Space Marines have, and the amount new Aspirants get after the implantation is finished.": "",
  "How many Space Marines your Chapter has. \\nFor every score below five a company will be removed; conversely, each score higher grants 50 additional Astartes.": "",
  "How many Terminator Armours?  Max: 5": "需要多少套终结者甲？上限：5",
  "How many inherent mutations your gene-seed has. \\nEach score below ten requires one mutation to be chosen.": "",
  "How much of a champion can a dead man really be. Enjoy your gift.": "",
  "How quaint, a relic of the “golden age” of your “civilisation”.  Nevertheless, you meant it to be a kind gesture and I thank you.": "",
  "How shiny the majority of marine paint and components will be drawn": "",
  "How shiny the trim and metallic components of marines will be drawn": "",
  "How strong a unit. Strong units can wield heavier equipment without penalties and are more deadly in close combat.##Influences Melee Attack#Influences Melee Burden Cap#Influences Ranged Burden Cap": "",
  "How very like you to back out of things. I seem to recall your vows to guard this sector from Xenos, heretics and mutants. Strange, but some still seem to be around.": "",
  "Howling": "",
  "Howling Banshee": "嚎叫女妖",
  "Howling Banshee Exarch": "嚎叫女妖元首",
  "Howls and grunts ring from the surrounding terrain as the Orks announce their presence.  ": "",
  "HrcBltrs": "",
  "Human we may be, but the Adepta Sororitas are second in loyalty only to the astartes themselves.  Why do you ignore us so?": "",
  "Humble": "",
  "Hunt Beasts": "猎杀野兽",
  "Hunt the Fallen": "追猎堕落者",
  "Hunt the Fallen Completed": "追猎堕落者完成",
  "Hunt the Fallen Failed": "追猎堕落者失败",
  "Hunter": "",
  "Hunters": "",
  "Hunting the Hunter": "狩猎猎手",
  "Hurricane Bolter Sponsons": "飓风爆弹侧炮",
  "Hurricane Bolters are large hex-mount bolter arrays that are able to deliver a withering hail of anti-infantry fire at short ranges. This version is mounted onto the sides of vehicles.": "",
  "HvyArm": "",
  "HvyBltr": "",
  "HvyBltrs": "",
  "HvyCnvBm": "",
  "HvyCnvBmr": "",
  "HvyFlmr": "",
  "HvyFlmrs": "",
  "HvyThndHmr": "",
  "HvyWpPck": "",
  "Hybrid": "",
  "Hybrid Claws": "混血之爪",
  "Hyper-Stimulated Omophagea": "过度亢奋的食感器官",
  "Hyperactive Ossmodula": "过度活跃的骨生器官",
  "Hysterical Frenzy": "歇斯底里的狂乱",
  "I AM GOING TO RIP YOUR HEARTS OUT AND CONSUME THEM IN FRONT OF YOU!": "我要掏出你们的心脏，当着你们的面吞下去！",
  "I COME NOW, ": "",
  "I accept, we surrender our will to the father": "我接受，我们向父献出意志",
  "I agree, though it will change little in the grand scheme of the galaxy.": "我同意，尽管这在银河的大局中改变不了什么。",
  "I agree, though not for the reasons you present.": "我同意，但并非出于你所言的理由。",
  "I almost refused to believe that my little trap hadn't done you in, but here you are.  I may have misjudged you, ": "我几乎无法相信我的小陷阱居然没要你的命，可你还是来了。也许我低估了你，",
  "I am awaiting your query.": "我在等待你的问题。",
  "I am mobilizing the Segmentum battlefleet.  You may run, heretic, but it will do you no good.": "我正在动员星区舰队。你可以逃，异端，但那无济于事。",
  "I am not a being of unlimited leisure time, Chapter Master, so you will need to be swift with your words.": "战团长，我不是时间无限清闲之辈，你说话得快些。",
  "I am not convinced.  A shame.  I was hoping you might actually be of use- but now it is apparent that your use will only be as a bloody, broken offering to the Dark Gods.": "我并不信服。可惜。我曾希望你当真有用——但现在看来，你的用途只会是献给黑暗诸神的鲜血残躯。",
  "I am saddened by your lack of respect, and can only attribute it to inferior cultural surroundings.": "你的无礼令我痛心，只能归咎于你低劣的文化环境。",
  "I am sorry but I will have to say no for now.": "很抱歉，目前我只能拒绝。",
  "I am sorry, friend, but I simply cannot comply at this time.": "抱歉，朋友，我此刻实在无法照办。",
  "I am truly sorry, Lord, but I have to chance of fulfilling your request.": "至为抱歉，阁下，我根本无法满足你的要求。",
  "I am unable to be swayed by ingratiating words; the truth of your statement is clear to all.": "阿谀之词动摇不了我；你的话中真相，众人皆明。",
  "I answer only to the Emperor himself, not to the likes of you.": "我只对帝皇本人负责，而非你这等人物。",
  "I apologize but my resources must be directed in a different direction.": "抱歉，但我的资源必须投向其他方向。",
  "I apologize, Chapter Master, but I have more pressing concerns.  The Emperor protects.": "抱歉，战团长，我有更要紧的事要处理。帝皇庇佑。",
  "I apologize, but my resources must be directed in a different direction.": "抱歉，但我的资源必须投向别的方向。",
  "I await your arrival on {_name}, in case it has slipped your mind.": "",
  "I believe this trade would be beneficial to us both.": "我相信这笔交易对双方都有利。",
  "I believe we shall both come to regret this, but I agree.": "我想我们都会后悔，但我同意。",
  "I believe we would both benefit greatly from an exchange.": "我相信一笔交易对我们双方都大有裨益。",
  "I can only conclude that you have no conception of how despicable your actions are because you have lost all feeling for how heretical it is to converse with a heretic.": "我只能推断你对自己行为的卑鄙毫无概念，因为你已全然麻木于与异端交谈本身便是异端之事。",
  "I can only hope you intend to beg for mercy and throw yourself upon my dubious mercy.  It will be quicker for all concerned.": "我只希望你是来乞求怜悯、听凭我那可疑的宽恕发落的。对大家都更快些。",
  "I cannot accept this deal and the day grows late; I will not take any more of your time.": "我无法接受这笔交易，天色已晚；不再耽搁你的时间了。",
  "I cannot agree to this, Chapter Master, no matter how stubborn you may be.": "战团长，无论你如何固执，我都不能同意此事。",
  "I cannot agree with what you have said, but perhaps you have your reasons. I hope they are good ones.": "我无法苟同你的话，但或许你有你的理由。但愿是充分的理由。",
  "I cannot allow favoritism to affect my calculations.  I decline.": "我不能让偏袒影响我的计算。我拒绝。",
  "I cannot allow such a deal.": "我不能允许这样的交易。",
  "I cannot fathom the path of thought that brought you to this action but it doesn't truly matter; it will be rendered meaningless with your death.": "我无法理解你为何出此下策，但这已无关紧要；你的死会让它失去意义。",
  "I cannot help you at this time and advise that you cease pressing the matter.": "眼下我帮不了你，奉劝你莫再纠缠此事。",
  "I care not for your insults, only for the work you do for the Emperor.": "我不在乎你的侮辱，只在乎你为帝皇所做的事。",
  "I could overrun this sector with half the warriors you have now. Is your “Chapter” so pathetic you need to throw scores more men into the meatgrinder to succeed?  You have not convinced me.  I'd have enjoyed making use of your Chapter, but this was clearly not meant to be.  Make your peace.": "我可用你现有兵力的一半就踏平这个星区。你的“战团”就如此可怜，非得再送几十条性命填进绞肉机才肯罢休？你未能说服我。我本有意启用你的战团，但现在看来此缘已尽。去求个心安吧。",
  "I deny you {obj_controller.faction_leader[eFACTION.CHAOS]}.  And now I shall destroy you.  For the Emperor! [Attack Chaos forces]": "",
  "I do not believe this will help either of us.": "我不认为这会对我们任何一方有帮助。",
  "I do not know if you are guided by choice or incompetence, Chapter Master, however you are not the only player in this most dangerous game you insist upon pursuing.  There is no more room for failure.": "战团长，我不清楚你是出于选择还是无能，但你并非这场危险博弈中唯一的棋手。已再无失败余地。",
  "I do not think so, though you may find others who are more willing.": "我不这么认为，不过你也许能找到更愿意的人。",
  "I don't believe I will accept this request, Chapter Master, but do not let it dishearten you.": "战团长，我想我不会接受这个请求，但别让它挫败你的心志。",
  "I dun't like it but I ain't got no choice.": "俺不喜欢，但俺别无选择。",
  "I expect more of a sapient being.": "我对一个有智慧的生物寄予了更高的期望。",
  "I got a better idea; get zogged!": "俺有个更好的主意：滚蛋吧！",
  "I grow weary of your ineptitude.": "我已厌倦你的无能。",
  "I had every confidence that engaging in a mutually beneficial relationship with you would prove a wise move. I had, in non-logical parlance, a 'hunch'.": "我曾满怀信心，与你建立互利关系会是明智之举。按非逻辑的说法，我曾有过「直觉」。",
  "I have a moment or two to spare.  Speak.": "我有片刻空闲。说吧。",
  "I have been notified of your corrospondences with ": "你与……之间的书信往来，已有人向我通报了。",
  "I have better things to do than listen to your praise.": "我有更重要的事要做，没空听你吹捧。",
  "I have calculated the likely benefits weighed against the risks, and find this venture unsatisfactory.": "我已权衡过可能的收益与风险，发现这桩冒险并不划算。",
  "I have heard words like these a thousand times from Mon'keigh.  And I can only give you one answer; No.": "『猴子』的这番说辞我已听过上千遍。我的回答只有一个：不。",
  "I have little patience for your antics.  You... you... DOUBLE MON-KEIGH.": "我对你的把戏没什么耐心。你……你……简直是双重『猴子』。",
  "I have looked into the strands of fate, with your chapter, and found that the future is not suspect for any of your men.  None of them have their minds poisoned by the taint of chaos.": "我已窥探命运之线，关乎你的战团，发现你的手下未来皆无可疑。无人心智被混沌的污毒侵蚀。",
  "I have looked into the strands of fate, with your chapter.  Your 'battle brother' {_unit.name_role()} has a clouded, dark future- it is advised you watch him carefully.": "",
  "I have received word that you have killed the Planetary Governor of {_assasin_place} and placed a fool in power.  Your attempts to control this sector, and seemingly emulate the Ultramarines, have not gone unnoticed.  Do not think this will go unpunished.": "",
  "I have travelled the stars for millennia.  Worlds have burned at my command, countless souls damned.  The ground trembles with every step.  Now I sit here and listen to you.  Where did it all go so wrong?": "我跨越群星已有一万年。世界曾在我的令下燃烧，无数灵魂被诅咒。脚下的大地随之震颤。而今我却坐在这里听你说话。一切都错得如此彻底？",
  "I have work to do Space Marine, much of it implements of torture and stubborn heretics, please make sure you are ready to commit to a deal when you interrupt my labours next time.": "星际战士，我还有工作要做，多是刑具和顽固的异端。下次打断我劳作时，请确保你已准备好成交。",
  "I haven’t turned traitor and my faith is strong. The Beast has foolishly opened its lair to us. Be ready for my signal.": "我没有背叛倒戈，我的信仰坚定。那头野兽愚蠢地为我们敞开了巢。等我信号。",
  "I hear worrying rumors about your conduct, astartes. I have no doubt we will meet again soon.": "阿斯塔特，我听闻有关你行为的令人不安的流言。我们很快就会再见，这一点我毫不怀疑。",
  "I hope there is a good reason for this affront, Chapter Master, for it is never wise to slight the Emperor's truest servants.": "战团长，但愿你对这次的冒犯有充分的理由，因为得罪帝皇最忠实的仆从从来都不是明智之举。",
  "I hope you have good reason for this audience.": "但愿你觐见有充分的理由。",
  "I must decline.": "我必须拒绝。",
  "I must take care of an urgent matter first.  (Exit)": "我得先处理一件急事。（离开）",
  "I need strength and power to crush my enemies": "我需要力量来碾碎敌人",
  "I never thought I would work with as deplorable a character as yourself, but I accept.": "我从没想过会与你这般可鄙之人合作，但我接受。",
  "I only wish I could assist you in this way, Chapter Master, but I am afraid I cannot.": "战团长，我真希望能以这种方式帮你，但恐怕我做不到。",
  "I remember when these devices were commonplace. Even then, your species was blind to the wisdom of my people. I thank you for the trinket though.": "我还记得这些装置寻常可见的日子。即便那时，你们种族也看不见我族的智慧。不过还是谢你的小玩意儿。",
  "I require more time to corrupt my brethren.": "我还需要更多时间来腐化我的兄弟。",
  "I see no good coming of this.": "我看不到这有什么好处。",
  "I see no problem": "我看不出问题",
  "I seek a favour from the Gods": "我向诸神寻求恩惠",
  "I seek to protect thoes under my command from this hellish existance": "我只求能护住麾下的性命，免遭这地狱般的存在。",
  "I seek wealth and a better life for my men": "我寻求财富和更好的生活给我的兄弟们",
  "I seek wisdom and knowlage to better guide me": "我寻求智慧与知识以指引我",
  "I shall examine this gift for any traps or flaws before rendering you any thanks.": "在致谢之前，我要先检查这份礼物有没有机关或缺陷。",
  "I shall have to reexamine myself, if such a loyal soldier says such things of me.": "若连如此忠诚的士兵都这样评价我，我该重新审视自己了。",
  "I shall keep this gift close, both as a reminder of your generosity and to remind me to watch you carefully, Chapter Master.": "战团长，我会把这份礼物收好，既提醒我你的慷慨，也提醒我要仔细盯紧你。",
  "I sought you out to slay you with my own hands.": "我找上你，是要亲手杀了你。",
  "I spit upon your demands, loyalist dog. Beg your corpse Emperor for something instead.": "我唾弃你的要求，忠诚的狗。去向你的僵尸帝皇乞求点什么吧。",
  "I suggest you leaner to calculate a little further into the future, Space Marine. It will be inefficient for you to continue operating in your current fashion.": "我建议你学会把账算得更长远些，星际战士。继续这样折腾下去，对你不划算。",
  "I suspect you imagined this dusty piece of technology would help us in some way? Amusing. However, we accept the gift anyway.": "我猜你以为这蒙尘的科技物件能在某方面帮到我们？有趣。不过，我们姑且收下这份礼。",
  "I thank you for the compliment but it does not alter our relation in the slightest.": "多谢你的恭维，但它丝毫改变不了我们的关系。",
  "I thank you for the compliment but it will not turn my course.": "多谢你的恭维，但它改变不了我的决定。",
  "I trust you have recalculated how your resources can be best utilised and deemed this trade inefficient.": "我相信你已重新核算过资源的最高效用法，并认定这笔交易得不偿失。",
  "I understand.  I am authorizing the deployment of cyclonic torpedoes.  Make peace with your homeworld, Chapter Master.": "我明白了。我批准投放旋风鱼雷。战团长，和你的母星道别吧。",
  "I will allow you a small portion of my time for an audience, Astartes.": "阿斯塔特，我可以给你一小段接见的时间。",
  "I will await your word with anxious anticipation, honoured ally, for I am sure something of great importance draws you away.": "尊敬的盟友，我将怀着殷切期盼等待你的消息，因为我相信必有要事让你离开。",
  "I will remember those words, but they will not stay my blade if your actions call for it to fall.": "我会记住这些话，但若你的所作所为该当此剑落下，它们也拦不住。",
  "I will remember what you said today and you will be held accountable.": "我会记住你今日所言，你终将为此负责。",
  "I will suffer your presence no longer.": "我再也无法忍受你的存在。",
  "I will trade with you, little loyalist, if only to be closer to laugh at you when you fall to the inexorable machinations of the Gods.": "我会和你交易，小忠诚者，只为离得更近些，好在你落入诸神无情的算计中时嘲笑你。",
  "I would have torn it from your cold, dead hands in any case but this does save us some time.": "反正我无论如何都会从你冰冷僵死的手中夺走它，不过这样倒是省了些时间。",
  "I would not assist you in slitting your own throat, it would hardly be worth my effort. Knowing this, why would you expect me to aid you?": "我都不会帮你割自己的喉咙，那不值当费劲。既然你明白这点，又凭什么指望我帮你？",
  "I would say 'you should know better', ": "",
  "I would spit upon this ‘offer' you bring before me but I find myself too amused by it.": "我就该把你呈上的这件“提案”唾上一口，但我发现自己竟被它逗乐了。",
  "I'll fink about it but I ain't sure it sounds like fun.": "",
  "I'm gunna take dem words and ram ‘em down your throat!": "",
  "I've got good news, humie! ": "",
  "I, Inquisitor Lord {faction_leader[eFACTION.INQUISITION]}, on behalf of the Inquisition, am awaiting your words.": "",
  "I.": "",
  "IDENTIFY NOW": "立即识别",
  "II.": "",
  "III.": "",
  "INI loaded": "",
  "IV.": "",
