  "Icon": "",
  "Icon Grid": "图标网格",
  "Iconoclast": "",
  "Identify": "",
  "Idleness and greed are the signs of a heretic, Chapter Master.": "",
  "Idleness breeds heresy, marine, and I hear that you have been greatly idle of late.": "",
  "If I took on board the criticisms of everyone in the sector, I'd never get a damn thing done.": "",
  "If all Astartes were half as bold as you are courteous, there would be not a single foe left in the galaxy.": "",
  "If checked your Battleships will launch Boarding teams automatically when an eligible target is in range.": "",
  "If checked your Cruisers will launch Boarding teams automatically when an eligible target is in range.": "",
  "If commanding garrison will prevent disposition loss, losses to loyalty are halved": "",
  "If dat's a serious offer, you're out of your tiny ‘uman mind.": "",
  "If only I could believe your actions were as pure as your words.": "",
  "If only to demonstrate how meaningless your efforts are in the grand scheme of the Galaxy, I'll accept this trade.": "",
  "If only you could grasp how little you have understood... I thank you for the compliment none-the-less.": "",
  "If selected You will be able to pick an icon or icon set after selecting a base colour": "",
  "If we truly both follow the many stepped path towards the glory of chaos, you will agree to trade with me.": "",
  "If ya dun’t zog off, I’m gunna ram dis down yer throat!": "你要是再不滚，俺就把这玩意塞你喉咙里！",
  "If ya think dat, ya must have squig dropping between yur ears.": "",
  "If you cross me, I'll pick me teef with your ribs!": "你要是惹我，俺就用你的肋骨剔牙！",
  "If you cross me, the wrath of the Emperor will come down on your head.": "",
  "If you expect gushing thanks or rapturous praise, you will go on waiting. I am not sure how much of a favour you have done me.": "",
  "If you give aid to or converse with a heretic or a traitor, you're either a heretic or a traitor. Either way, consider yourself under close scrutiny, Chapter Master.": "",
  "If you think kissing my boots will make me overlook your crimes you are sorely mistaken.": "",
  "If you think that your words would go unnoticed, you were wrong.": "",
