  "Iota": "",
  "IrnHalo": "",
  "Iron": "",
  "Iron Arm": "钢铁手臂",
  "Iron Claw": "钢铁爪",
  "Iron Halo": "铁光环",
  "Iron Hands": "钢铁之手",
  "Iron Warriors": "钢铁勇士",
  "Irreverance for His Servants": "对祂仆人的不敬",
  "Irreverence for His Servants": "对祂仆人的不敬",
  "Is known for their impeccable honor even in the heat of battle": "以即使在激战中依旧坚守无瑕荣誉而知名",
  "Is mostly a machine, having replaced most of his flesh with bionic replacements.": "已大半成为机械，以生化义体替换了大部分肉身。",
  "Is rapidly gaining momentum with the planets populace and will soon sieze control of the planet if left unchecked": "",
  "Isstvan": "",
  "It appears I have no other choice but to do as you say Mon'keigh.": "『猴子』，看来我别无选择，只能照你说的办。",
  "It bears the taint of Chaos.": "它沾染了混沌的污秽。",
  "It comes from the warp, a relic from the past. It is steeped in the energies of the ethereal tides. Beware.": "它出自亚空间，远古的遗物。其浸透着星海漫天的能量。心生警惕吧。",
  "It glows with an eery, soft blue color.": "它泛着诡异而柔和的蓝光。",
  "It goes against my instincts, but you have a deal.": "这违背我的直觉，但成交。",
  "It has a soothing appearance.": "它的外观令人安心。",
  "It has been carved with such intricate detail that the facets are uncountable.": "它的雕刻如此精微细致，面面交错难数。",
  "It has been stowed away upon {loc}.  It appears to be a ": "",
  "It has been stowed away upon {loc}.  It appears to be a {fetch_artifact(last_artifact).get_type_name()} but should be brought home and identified posthaste.": "",
  "It has many crude purity seals.": "上面钉着许多粗制净化印。",
  "It is a fine day, is it not?  Yet again the Imperium displays its tyrannical, bureaucratic nature by declaring your chapter traitor.  To unmake your forces, alone, is beyond my reach.  It is fortunate I may simply sit back and watch as it is ground to dust by your former allies.  When we meet again, ": "好一个欢快的日子，不是吗？帝国再度展现出它暴虐、官僚的真面目，将你们战团宣告为叛徒。要单独瓦解你的兵力，我还做不到。但我却能安然袖手旁观，看着它被你从前的盟军碾成齑粉。待我们再会时，",
  "It is a wonder your species ever mastered space travel, if this was the pinnacle of your “technology”. I don’t know what you expect me to do with it.": "若你们名为“技术”之物巅峰不过如此，我真好奇贵种族是怎样掌握星际航行的。我也不知你指望我用它来做什么。",
  "It is better to die for the Emperor than to live for yourself.": "为帝皇而死，胜过为己而生。",
  "It is built in the likeness of an attractive human female.": "它被塑成一名美丽的女性人类模样。",
  "It is currently in the possession of {_unit.name_role()}.": "",
  "It is customary to offer reports of your progress to your sector's commander. And your sector commander is me and yet I see a disturbing lack of reports.": "照惯例，你应向本星区指挥官呈报进展。而你的星区指挥官就是我——可我看到的却是令人不安的报告缺失。",
  "It is decorated with gold filigree.": "它饰以金色细丝花纹。",
  "It is fashioned to resemble a massive pile of skulls of all races and ages.": "它被雕琢成一座堆满各族、各时代骸颅的巨塔。",
  "It is good that the vessels of the Emperor's wrath have arrived in this sector- to bring his justice to the xenos and the heretic.": "帝皇之怒的战舰抵达本星区，实在是大好事——将祂的裁决带给异形与异端。",
  "It is hardly courteous to change ones mind when a deal is about to be reached. Still, I suppose you /must/ have your reasons.": "交易即将达成时改主意，可不算礼貌。不过，我想你 /必有/ 自己的理由。",
  "It is illogical and unwise to turn aside the Adeptus Mechanicus' auspices.": "背弃机械神教的庇佑，既不合逻辑也不明智。",
  "It is infested with a Daemonic entity. Destroying it, may cause the entity to materialize.": "它寄生着一头魔物。若将它摧毁，那头魔物恐怕就会成形降临。",
  "It is just that you choose to entrusts such a precious relic to the Inquisition, mankind’s most stalwart defenders in this dark age.": "把这样珍贵的遗物托付给审判庭这个黑暗时代里人类最忠诚的守护者，真是明智之举。",
  "It is logical to agree with you, but I dislike it.": "同意你是合乎逻辑的，但我并不喜欢。",
  "It is massive": "它庞大无比",
  "It is more crude and utilitarian than one might expect from an artifact.": "它粗糙而功利，没有人们所期待的那神遗物之美。",
  "It is my only option, but I will curse you forever for forcing me into this.": "这是我唯一的选择，但我会永远诅咒你逼我至此。",
  "It is not possible for such a thing to be done, whatever your reasons.": "无论你的理由如何，此事都不可能办到。",
  "It is not that I am surprised but I confess a little confusion at your forthright generosity.  Perhaps you expect something in return? Regardless, I thank you.": "我倒不是惊讶，只是对你如此爽快的慷慨有点困惑。也许你期待回报？无论如何，谢谢你。",
  "It is of unusually large size.": "它的尺寸异乎寻常地大。",
  "It is pleasing that you made the logical choice in this matter.  Our evaluation of you will be adjusted accordingly.": "很高兴你在此事上做了合乎逻辑的选择。我们对你评价将相应上调。",
  "It is puzzling to me that you believe this changes anything but I see this means a lot to you so I accept your ‘declaration'.": "我认为你竟认为这能改变任何事，实在令人迷惑，但既然这对你意义重大，我便接受你“宣词”。",
  "It is shaped and contorted into a Fearsome Mask.": "它被扭曲塑造成可怖的面具。",
  "It is squat and fat, though tall, and has simple utilitarian limbs.": "它矮矮胖胖，却生得高大，肢体简单而实用。",
  "It is this blind overconfidence that makes killing a Space Marine so satisfying.": "正是这种盲目的自负，让杀死星际战士如此令人满足。",
  "It is well that you have returned the artifact, late though it may be.": "你归还了神器，虽然晚了点，但总归是好事。",
  "It leaves a bitter taste in my mouth, but you may go in peace.  I will be watching you from now on, however.": "这事让我如鲠在喉，但你可以安然离开。不过从今往后，我会盯着你。",
  "It must be said that while you fail at almost all aspects of commanding a Chapter, you are extremely skilled in causing me slight irritations. Congratulations.": "不得不说，尽管你在指挥战团的几乎各个方面都糟糕透顶，却在惹我烦躁这方面技艺超群。恭喜。",
  "It pains me to deny you but I fear I must.": "拒绝你令我不忍，但我恐怕不得不如此。",
  "It pains me to see an Astartes debase his chapter by using the tools of a heretic, especially when you have access to sanctioned psyker powers.  Ensure that it does not happen again.": "看到一名阿斯塔特使用异端的工具来玷污自己的战团，我深感痛心，何况你本可借助受准许的灵能。确保此事不再发生。",
  "It resembles a bipedal goat with odd skin blemishes and four small horns.": "它像一只直立行走的羊，肤上有奇异的斑痕，头生四对小角。",
  "It resembles a scene of small children with large heads happily jumping into a pit of magma.": "它像的一幅画面：大头小童正兴高采烈地纵身跃入熔岩坑洞。",
  "It resembles an angel, fallen with broken wings, a sad look on its face.": "它像一位折翅坠落的天使，面容忧伤。",
  "It seems that congratulations are in order. While some might think the Inquisition blind to the possibility that it, that is to say we, could ever do wrong, it is not so. I know that we are as fallible as any man, save the Emperor, and can make mistakes when judging character. I took you for a traitor to humanity's cause. I see that I was wrong now and let it not be said I will not give credit where it is due; well done, Chapter Master. May the enemies of mankind speak your name in fear and humanity in adoration.": "看来该恭喜你。有人或许以为审判庭对自己的失误蒙蔽双眼，其实不然。我与你们一样会犯错，惟有帝皇例外——我称赞你。你被我误认得对人类大业背叛，此刻我明白我错了。愿那些枉负我的信任之名者，以恐惧唤你的名，而人类则以崇敬唤你名。干得漂亮，战团长。人类之敌惧你名，人类之民则以颂赞应对。",
  "It was a fine vessel, worthy of any chapter.": "这是一艘出色的战舰，配得上任何战团。",
  "It was the most beneficial action that you could take to inform the Mechanicus of this fragment. I calculated you would take it if ever the opportunity was presented to you.": "将碎片之事告知机械教，是你所能采取的最有益的行动。我早就算定，若有机会你定会如此。",
  "It will go into my vault to be stored with the many others of its type I have collected. Nevertheless, I thank you for the gesture.": "它将被收入我的宝库，与我收藏的众多同类并存。不过，还是要谢谢你的心意。",
  "It will not happen again": "不会再有下次",
  "It will not happen, and you must deal with that.": "这不会发生，你得接受这一点。",
  "It would be illogical and heretical. Extrapolate your answer from that.": "那既不合逻辑，也是异端。你据此推断我的答复吧。",
  "It would be illogical to engage in a trade with one as unreliable as you in any case.": "无论如何，与你这样不可靠的人交易都不合逻辑。",
  "It would be more efficient to discharge a plasma rifle into my own chest cavity. [Simulated Mirth]": "",
  "It wus mine anyway, seein' as I'll take all yer stuff eventually.": "反正它本来就是我的，毕竟你所有的东西早晚都会归我。",
  "It's recommended to send them to the Librarium, however they are unlikely to exceed the role of Lexicanum or Codiciery in their current state.": "建议将其送往智库馆，不过以他们目前的状态，恐怕难以突破典藏官或法典官的层次。",
  "It's tiny nature means no more than five marines can operate in cohesion without being seperated": "",
  "It’s a... not really useful fer anyfin’, is it?": "",
  "It’s a... shinybit! Fanks fer da shinybit Beaky!": "",
  "I’m just tired of listening to you talk, {chaos_leader}.": "",
