  "Lacking a working Lyman's ear, all deep-striked Astartes receive moderate penalties to both attack and defense.": "因莱曼耳失效，所有深空突袭的阿斯塔特在攻击与防御上受到中等减益。",
  "Lacks a working Lyman's ear, and therefore struggles with deep strikes and certain other actions.": "缺少一只可用的莱曼耳，因此深空突袭及某些行动颇为吃力。",
  "Lacks the detoxifying gland called the Preomnor - he is more susceptible to poisons and toxins.": "缺少名为前胃的排毒腺，他更易受毒物与毒素侵害。",
