  "Land Raiders": "兰德掠袭者",
  "Land Raiders are incredibly tanky war machines that protect rear columns and offer tremendous amounts of firepower.  Other super-heavy vehicles will also be placed here.": "兰德掠袭者是极其顽固的战争机器，既能掩护后方纵队，又拥有惊人火力。其他超重车辆也会被部署于此。",
  "Land Speeder": "兰德飞梭",
  "Land Speeders": "兰德飞梭",
  "Land Speeders are incredibly agile attack vehicles that offer a light highly mobile heavy weapon platform.": "",
