  "Let it be": "随它去吧",
  "Let it be so then and may it benefit us both.": "那就这样吧，愿它惠及双方。",
  "Let it be so, and may the Machine God bless this venture.": "就这样吧，愿机械神祝福此行。",
  "Let it be so; it is immaterial in my calculations.": "就这么办；这在计算中无关紧要。",
  "Let it be.  The Inquisition's wrath is not lightly provoked.": "就这样吧。审判庭之怒不可轻惹。",
  "Let it be.  The Mechanicus' wrath is not lightly provoked.": "就这样吧。机械教之怒不可轻惹。",
  "Let this agreement strengthen the bounds of our brotherhood.": "愿此协议巩固我们的兄弟情谊。",
  "Let us feast and celebrate, Chapter Master! Friends like you are rare in these times.": "让我们举宴欢庆吧，战团长大人！如今像你这样的朋友可不多见了。",
  "Let us forget our differences, for we may all reap the rewards of The Greater Good.": "让我们放下分歧，因为我们都能共享致上的善果。",
  "Let's see ya say that without a head!": "不信你摘了脑袋，还能说出这话来！",
