  "Lightining Claw": "闪电爪",
  "Lightly": "",
  "Lightly-dusty stone, mosaics, and statues throughout.": "遍布蒙尘的石头、马赛克与雕像。",
  "Lightning Arc": "闪电弧",
  "Lightning Claw": "闪电爪",
