  "Lightning Warriors": "闪电战士",
  "Lightning claws are specialized close combat weapons with built-in disruptor fields. These lethal claws rip into infantry like butter, bringing terror to the foe.": "闪电爪是内置干扰力场的专业近战武器。这对致命的利爪能像撕开花萼一样撕开敌军步兵，令敌人胆寒。",
  "Like the Khagan this marine is a tempest in combat flowing through enemies with finesse not common for astartes": "",
