  "Manufacturing rapid-fire kinetic weaponry focuses on high-tensile alloys for barrels and the assembly of complex gas-operated cycling mechanisms.": "",
  "Many Marines in your Chapter are favoured by the powers of the Warp, making perils of the Warp happen less frequently for them.": "你战团中许多星际战士深受亚空间诸力的眷顾，亚空间险境于他们而言更少发生。",
  "Many Question his Technical Talents.": "许多人质疑他的技术才能。",
  "Many of the successors for {name()} are removed or otherwise made indisposed.  Your chapter ensures that the new Planetary Governor is sympathetic to your plight and more than willing to heed your advice.  A powerful new ally may be in the making.": "",
  "Many of your Chapter's Apothecaries have fallen in recent battles, whether due to their incompetence or deliberate targeting.": "你战团的许多药剂师在近期战斗中阵亡——无论是出于无能，还是遭敌刻意针对。",
