  "No marines with sufficient technology aptitude for {obj_ini.role[100][eROLE.TECHMARINE]} training": "",
  "No matter what was offered, a true Astartes does not barter away what is both their birthright and their future.  The trading of your Gene-seed must stop.": "",
  "No matter your past deeds, you are now an enemy of the Imperium. Only an enemy would give away our most valued secret, the base of the Astartes themselves.": "",
  "No new imperial defence ships built this month": "本月未建造新的帝国防御舰",
  "No obj_star instance found for combat; battle_object defaulted to noone": "",
  "No one understands decay, rot and eventual death like the loving father of the warp. Only he can end your suffering and and that of your men. To be embraced is all the benevolent Father asks do you accept thse tuerms Chapter Master": "",
  "No remaining warp sensitive marines for training": "没有剩余的亚空间敏感陆战队员可供训练",
  "No remaining {obj_ini.role[100][eROLE.CHAPLAIN]} applicant marines for training": "",
  "No ships designated for Crusade.": "没有指定参加远征的舰船。",
  "No string array named '{property}' found": "",
  "No struct named '{property}' found": "",
  "No tag_name in response, skipping": "",
  "No valid player blocks, exiting": "",
  "No, and that is our final word upon the matter.": "不，这是我们在此事上的最终答复。",
  "Nobility": "",
  "Noctae": "",
  "Noise Marine": "噪音陆战队员",
  "Non-Codex Arming": "非法典武装",
  "Non-Codex Size": "非法典规模",
  "None": "无",
  "None Selected": "未选择",
  "Nonhuman presence detected at ": "",
  "Normal": "",
  "Normal 'we were attacked' line goes here.": "",
  "Normally, I would leave the running of your chapter in your very capable hands. But the trading of your Gene-seed must stop and I will not be moved on this.": "",
  "Nostromo": "",
  "Not Yet": "尚未",
  "Not a chance, ya fleshy pink git!": "没门，你这粉皮呆子！",
  "Not a single instance of obj_star exists!": "",
  "Not a valid GameError": "",
  "Not adhering to the Codex Astartes, Black Templars are a Chapter on an Eternal Crusade with unique organization and high numbers. Masters of assault, they charge at the enemy with zeal unmatched. They hate psykers, and as such, have no Librarians.": "",
  "Not all of your captains are convinced of the need to use deceit and a none have breached the order but it has soured your relations with a few namely {_caps[_worst].name_role()}": "",
  "Not bad, not bad. I'll see if I can find sum grot ta use it.": "不错，不错。俺看看能不能找个小鬼来用。",
  "Not dis time but don't let it get ya down.": "这次不行，但别灰心。",
  "Not engaged, firing": "未接战，正在射击",
  "Not enough equipment: ": "装备不足：",
  "Not enough equipment: {_warn}!": "",
  "Not enough {_wanted_item}; {needed_count - _found} more are required.": "",
  "Not even when the gates of the immaterium have closed, heretic!": "",
  "Not hard to see why your species is so universally viewed as foolish. Still, perhaps you will manage to be a little more enlightened than the rest.": "",
  "Not only have you killed the Chaos Lord, ": "",
  "Nothing can keep them from the fury of melee combat": "没有什么能阻止他们投身近战狂潮",
  "Nova": "",
  "Nova Cannon": "新星加农炮",
  "Now that they have been discovered, scans indicate the chaos space marines are leaving the structures, intent on doing damage.  ": "",
  "Now that they have been discovered, scans indicate the heretics and mutants are leaving the structures en masse.  ": "",
  "Now that they have been discovered, the Eldar seem to have vanished without a trace.  Scans reveal nothing.": "被发现后，灵族似乎踪迹全无。扫描一无所获。",
  "Now this is an unlikely meeting.  What can I do for you, ": "",
  "Nrthcm": "",
  "NtrnBlstr": "",
  "Nu": "",
  "Number": "",
  "Numerous": "大量",
  "Numerous Forces": "大量兵力",
  "Numina": "",
  "Nurgle": "",
  "Nurgle Vomit": "纳垢呕吐",
  "Nurgle_gift": "",
  "Nurgle_path": "",
  "Obj Creation Grid": "",
  "Obliterated": "",
  "Obliterator": "",
  "Obliterator Weapon": "湮灭者武器",
  "Observant": "",
  "Obsessed with doing things correctly": "执着于把事做对",
  "Obstinate Defender": "顽固守卫者",
  "Occultism": "",
  "Of course Chapter master (giggle) and what may they do for you": "",
  "Of course. We are always happy to be able to meet the needs of our friends and allies- such is the philosophy of the Greater Good.": "",
  "Of unknown origins and Founding, the origins of the Blood Ravens are shrouded in mystery and are believed to be tied to a dark truth. This elusive Chapter is drawn to the pursuit of knowledge and ancient lore and produces an unusually high number of Librarians.": "",
  "Offensive": "",
  "Offer": "",
  "Often the simplest solution is a single bolt shell or the swift knife the heart. Kill the Leader.": "",
  "Ogryn": "",
  "Ogryn Melee": "食人魔近战",
  "Oh, but I have one more atrocity to commit you simply shouldn’t miss...": "",
  "Oh, did you see a pretty light? Why don't you go and chase it?  I shall return to my own affairs, which are far beyond your understanding.": "",
  "Oi Beaky! I ain't heard your name round here before! If ya eva get bored of havin' your ‘ead attached to your shouldas, good old ": "",
  "Oi', don't rush off! Why don't ya drink a fungus ale wit me and the nobz? We could discuss business while watching a squigfight! No? Suit ya self.": "",
  "Oi, you want some of dis? Special offer for a limited time only!": "",
  "Old Guard": "老卫队",
  "Omega": "",
  "Omicron": "",
  "OmnAxe": "",
  "Omnissian Axe": "全能之斧",
  "On Planet": "在星球上",
  "On Planet/nCheck to have your Astartes Start on your home planet.": "",
  "Once all are seated Chapter Serfs begin to ferry the covered main dish": "",
  "Once all are seated Chapter Serfs begin to ferry the first of several dishes": "",
  "Once the mainstay of the Legiones Astartes, now the Serpha Pattern Jump Pack is nothing but a sad reminder of these better times and of the terrible atrocities that followed. Mainly used by the Traitors in the modern Imperium, it is nonetheless seen in the Loyalist armouries in which it is prized for its superior energy cells and power cabling, but doesn't provide as reliable of a thruster as, for instance, the most common in the 41st millennium Mark VII Mars Pattern.": "",
  "Once the standard Dreadnought pattern when Primarchs walked the stars and Legions conquered worlds, now one of the closest-guarded secrets in Mechanicum tech enclaves. With an Atomantic arc-reactor at its heart that gave it superior speed, strength and even shielding capabilities, it was far superior to any other Dreadnought pattern save for its maintenance demands and the possible meltdown of the reactor.": "",
  "Once the time is right their target is ambushed ": "",
  "One of his Zygotes is faulty or missing, and therefore will produce no extra gene seed other than the one implanted.": "",
  "One of many Plasma weapon patterns that came from the famed Forge World of Ryza. With its characteristic purple glow, alongside slight curvatures of the design, the mark of its forgeworld is impossible to miss. Featuring greater range and accuracy as well as pure stopping power, this is a weapon that even Terminators should fear to face.": "",
  "One of many Power Weapon types made in the nascent Imperium, the Power Scythes never truly became a staple of any large force outside of specialist elements, and when even those faded into obscurity or went traitor, the production of the Power Scythes was halted. Since then few remain in Imperial use, and most can be found in hands of foul traitors.": "",
  "One of the Zygotes is faulty or missing.  Your Astartes only have one each, generating half the normal gene-seed.  Counts as two mutations.": "",
  "One of the deadliest of the mainstay weapons in the Imperial arsenal during the Great Crusade. The humble Charger is a thermal ray weapon that deflagrates organic matter, combusting the target in extreme cases. Some variants even arc over multiple targets.": "",
  "One of the few Heavenfall Blades from the chapter's armoury and utilizes small amounts of obsidian in its workings, similar to the Sword of Secrets wielded by Supreme Grand Master Azrael of the Dark Angels": "",
  "One of the most noble and renowned chapters, their combat record belies a dark flaw in their gene-seed caused by the death of their primarch. Their primarch had wings and a propensity for close combat, and this shows in their extensive use of jump packs and close quarters weapons.": "",
  "One of your Death Company marines slowly makes his way towards the fallen enemies, as if in a spell.  Once close enough the helmet is removed and he begins shoveling parts of their carcasses into his mouth.": "",
  "One of your Death Company {roles[6]} blitzes to the fallen enemy lines.  Massive mechanical hands begin to rend and smash at the fallen corpses, trying to squeeze their flesh and blood through the sarcophogi opening.": "",
  "One of your Mon'keigh soldiers will no longer act as you expect him to. Be wary, when one Mon'keigh is influenced the rest of the herd will be.": "",
  "One of your marines slowly makes his way towards the fallen enemies, as if in a spell.  Once close enough the helmet is removed and he begins shoveling parts of their carcasses into his mouth.": "",
  "One of your soldiers will cover himself in glory. As his “Chapter Master”, a title I find inherently foolish, you may wish to reward him.": "",
  "One of your soldiers will no longer act as you expect him to. Be wary, when one is influenced the rest of the herd will be.": "",
  "One or more Marine has Dreadnought armour and cannot be changed": "",
  "One would think, with a life span as short as yours, you would have a better memory. It's not as though you live long enough to have enough time to properly forget anything. This insult will not be forgotten, Mon'keigh.": "",
  "Only a true friend would be given such a courteous message as this; the Inquisition does not agree and does not take kindly to such requests.": "",
  "Only in death does duty end.": "唯有死亡，职责方尽。",
  "Only the Emperor is all.": "唯有帝皇是一切。",
  "Only the best for the best.  A room full of torture tools and devices.": "",
  "Only the truest, most noble and most incorruptible servants of the Emperor can be trusted with such an artifact. None but the Inquisition have the immutable will to wield such things. Despite the mistakes you have made in the past, it is good that you have recognised our superiority. Perhaps there is hope for you still, but I doubt it.": "",
  "Oolitic Secretions": "鲕状分泌物",
  "Open Event": "打开事件",
  "Open: Voluntery": "开放：自愿",
  "Opposing your forces are a total of ": "",
  "Options": "",
  "Options:": "选项：",
  "Opulent": "",
