  "Ordo Hereticus": "异端审判庭",
  "Ordo Malleus": "恶魔审判庭",
  "Ordo Xenos": "异形审判庭",
  "Orelius": "",
  "Originally industrial tools used for breaking through bulkheads, this laser weapon is devastating in close combat.": "",
  "Originating from the Warmaster's homeworld [allegedly untrue] of Cthonia, this Autocannon pattern was the chosen type of this weapon for Terminator Squads throughout the Great Crusade and subsequent Horus Heresy. While later designs may have outshined it in fire rate or range, this remains the hardest hitting autocannon to date, perhaps with the Kalibrax as a strong competitor.": "",
  "Ork": "",
  "Ork Armour": "兽人装甲",
  "Ork Contact": "兽人接触",
  "Ork Fleet": "兽人舰队",
  "Ork Sniper": "兽人狙击手",
  "Ork Stronghold": "兽人要塞",
  "Ork WAAAAGH! begins": "兽人 WAAAAGH! 开始了",
  "Ork WAAAAGH! begins.": "兽人 WAAAAGH! 开始了。",
  "Ork Warboss": "兽人头目",
  "Ork Warboss discovered on {numeral_n}.": "",
  "Ork ships Spill their ravenouss hordes accross {name} system and the green skin captains turn their guns towards the surface.": "",
  "Ork ships have crashed across the {name} system.": "",
  "Ork stronghold": "",
  "OrkArm": "",
  "Orks": "欧克兽人",
  "Orks are particularly hated by your Chapter. When fighting Orks damage is increased.": "",
  "Other": "",
  "Our": "",
  "Our Brothers are currently not assigned to train further ": "我们战团当前没有兄弟被指派去训练新兵",
  "Our Brothers assigned to the training of future ": "我们战团的兄弟被指派去训练未来的新兵",
  "Our Chapter currently has no Neophytes - we are at maximum strength and do not require more marines.": "我们战团目前没有新兵——我们已达满编战力，不再需要更多星际战士。",
  "Our Chapter currently has no Neophytes. We are doing our utmost best to find suitable recruits.": "我团现无新兵。我们正全力寻找合适的兵源。",
  "Our Chapter currently has no Neophytes. Without training more our chapter is doomed to a slow death.": "我团目前没有新兵。若不及时训练新血，战团将会在迟滞中慢慢凋零。",
  "Our Chapter currently has one recruit being trained. The Neophyte's name is {recruit_name[0]} and they are scheduled to become a battle brother in {recruit_training[0] + recruit_distance[0]} months' time.": "",
  "Our Chapter currently has {recruits} recruits being trained. {recruit_name[0]} is the next scheduled Neophyte to become a battle brother in {recruit_training[0] + recruit_distance[0]} months' time.": "",
  "Our Chapter is capable of using test-slaves to breed new gene-seed.  Should our number of astartes ever plummet this may prove a valuable method of rapidly bringing our chapter back up to size.": "我们的战团有能力使用试验奴隶培育新的基因种子。一旦我们的星际战士数量暴跌，这或许是一条迅速重振战团的宝贵途径。",
  "Our Chapter is disasterously low in number- it is strongly advised that we make use of test-slaves to breed new gene-seed.  Give me the word andwe can begin installing gestation pods.": "我们战团的人数已低至灾难性的境地——强烈建议我们动用试验奴隶来培育新的基因种子。只消你一声令下，我们便可开始安装孕育舱。",
  "Our Relationship with the Rulers of the planet is {disposition}#": "",
  "Our Test-Slave Incubators are working optimally.  As soon as a batch fully matures a second progenoid gland they will be harvested and prepared for use.": "我们的试炼奴仆孵化器运转良好。一批培育完全成熟、长出第二枚前胚腺体后，便将收割并备好使用。",
  "Our astropaths report that an inquisitor's ship is currently warping towards our Fortress Monastery. It is likely that theInquisitor {obj_controller.inquisitor[inquisitor]}  will attempt to perform inspection on our Fortress Monastery.": "",
  "Our astropaths report that an inquisitor's ship is currently warping towards our systems under chapter control. It is likely that Inquisitor {obj_controller.inquisitor[inquisitor]}  will want to make inspections of any chapter assets and fleets in the system.": "",
  "Our emissaries bring gifts, Chapter Master. Perhaps you would consider a mutually beneficial arrangement?": "战团长，我们的使节带来了礼物。也许你会考虑一项互利的安排？",
  "Our enemies are many and our strength is diminished. We need allies to join with us while we rebuild our forces.": "我们树敌众多、实力受损。在重整军力之际，我们需要盟友并肩。",
  "Our friendship means fractionally less to me than this bargain. I decline.": "这份友谊在我心中的分量，比这笔交易还要稍逊一筹。我拒绝。",
  "Our greatest poets would respond to your laughable taunts, but none of your race could understand them.": "我族最伟大的诗人本该回应你可笑的嘲讽，但你们种族无人能懂。",
  "Our navigators report that an inquisitor's ship is currently warping towards our flagship. It is likely that the inquisitor on board (provided he/she makes it) will attempt to perform an inspection of our flagship.": "领航员报告，一艘审判官之舰正跃迁逼近我们的旗舰。舰上审判官（若他/她能抵达的话）很可能会尝试对我们的旗舰进行搜查。",
  "Our old enemies, the men of metal, are close. You call them “Necrons”, and you will need to fight them soon. Or flee, it matters not to me.": "我们的旧敌——金属之人——已近在咫尺。你们称之为“死灵”，且不久便须与之开战。或逃也行，这对我并无分别。",
  "Our ways are not your ways, ": "",
  "Outdated version, report skipped.": "",
  "Outside": "",
  "OutsideOfRectError": "",
  "Over a hundred Astartes echoe the cry or let out shouts of their own.": "",
  "Over a hundred Astartes nod in acknowledgement and move quickly-": "",
  "Over a hundred Astartes roar in return, their voice one-": "上百名阿斯塔特齐声怒吼，声如一人——",
  "Over your dead body": "除非踏过我的尸体",
