  "SnpRfl": "",
  "So it's krumping time is it, you stupid beaky!? I'm gunna find you and smash your zogging face in with me bare hands! Nobody starts a fight round ‘ere ‘cept me!": "",
  "So wat, ya want a fank you note or summin’?": "",
  "So you have brought yourself before me {obj_ini.master_name}. This pleases me. You are not the first among the Astartes to come to me. Do not look so shocked. Many have gazed upon the decay and decrepitude of the Imperium with open eyes, and heard the empty slogans of the Corpse Emperor with fresh ears and come to the realization I had so many long millennia ago. There is only one truth in the universe, one path worthy of an Astartes to walk. The path of true power. The path of true insight into the nature of reality and what lies beyond. The path of Chaos. Only when free of the pointless bondage of the Imperium can we ascend to our rightful place in the universe.": "",
  "Solid Projectile Assembly": "实弹组装",
  "Some artifacts, like the one you now wield, are a blasphemous union of the Materium's matter and the Immaterium's spirit, containing the essence of a bound daemon.  While they may offer great power, and enhanced perception, they are known to whisper poisonous lies to the wielder.  The path to damnation begins with good intentions, and many times artifacts such as these have been the cause.": "某些遗物——如你此刻手中这件——是现实物质界与亚空间精神界的亵渎结合，其中囚禁着一头恶魔的精魂。它们或许能带来巨大力量与超凡感知，但人人皆知它们会向持用者耳语恶毒的谎言。堕落之路始于善意，而此类遗物往往正是肇始之源。",
  "Some extremely lore friendly backstory": "一段极为贴设定的人物背景",
  "Some of your Chapter's past actions or current practices make the Inquisition suspicious. Their disposition is lowered.": "你们战团的某些过往或现行之举，令审判庭生疑。他们对你的态度随之下降。",
  "Some of your astartes may have been able to jetison and survive the ships destruction": "你的星际战士中或许有人能在舰船炸毁时弹射脱身而幸存。",
  "Somehow it is completely silent in operation.": "它运作时竟悄无声息。",
  "Something will happen soon. The runes do not show me exactly what will happen, only that it concerns you. Watch the horizon, Mon'keigh.": "",
  "Sometimes a lord deigns to exchange with the meanest pauper. It does not make them equals.": "",
  "Sonic Blaster": "音波爆枪",
  "Sons": "",
  "Sony PlayStation 4": "",
  "Sony PlayStation 5": "",
  "Soon, you will be either dead or close enough that it makes no difference.  At this moment, however, I wish to offer you a trade.": "",
  "Soon, your masters will call you to heel like a dog to attack the foes of man. One of your ''Crusades'' of hate, ignorance and bigotry will be called.": "",
  "Sooo many good souls how sweet on my tounge. Enjoy your gift": "",
