  "Space Marine Recruiting: ": "星际战士招募：",
  "Space Marines in my sector are expected to conduct themselves as befits one of the Adeptus Astartes. Do not disappoint me.": "我星区的星际战士应有一名阿斯塔特修士的言行举止。莫让我失望。",
