  "Spawn System Options": "生成系统选项",
  "Speak but do not be offended if I seem not to be paying attention; I'm probably not.": "尽管说吧，若我显得心不在焉也别见怪——我多半真没在听。",
  "Speak up, Mon'keigh.": "大声说，人类。",
  "Speak your next words very carefully, Astartes, for they may be your last.": "阿斯塔特，下一句话请慎言，那可能是你此生最后一句。",
  "Speak, Chapter Master.": "说吧，战团长。",
  "Speak, worm, lest I wipe you from existence before you manage even to beg for mercy.": "说吧，蠕虫，免得你连乞求怜悯都来不及就被我从世上抹去。",
