  "Stygies": "",
  "Subject ID confirmed. Rank Identified. Salutations Chapter Master. The status report is ready.": "身份确认。军衔识别。向你致敬，战团长。状态报告已备妥。",
  "Success is commemorated; Failure merely remembered.": "胜利被铭记；失败徒留回忆。",
  "Success is measured in blood; yours or your enemy´s.": "成功以鲜血衡量——不是你的血，就是敌人的血。",
  "SuccessStatus": "",
  "Successfully loaded {item_total} values from {relative_file_path}": "",
  "Successfully loaded {property} value from {relative_file_path}": "",
  "Successor Chapters: ": "子团：",
  "Such artifacts may provide a return to the Golden age of Mankind and the Inquisition are the best candidates to guide us there. Wise decision, Space Marine.": "",
  "Such relics are a rare and glorious sight, Chapter Master. I thank you for this boon and trust that you know my gratitude will be expressed in a manner pleasing to you.": "",
  "Such sentiments are regrettable. We hope one day you realize your mistakes and submit to The Greater Good.": "此番言论令人遗憾。我们希望你终有一日明白自己的错误，臣服于至上之道。",
  "Suffering is the beginning to penance.": "苦难是赎罪的开始。",
  "Suffers from a faulty Omophagea.": "器官记忆腺体存在缺陷。",
  "Suffers from a faulty Ossmodula, and takes longer to heal from injuries.": "骨骼调节器官存在缺陷，伤势愈合更慢。",
  "Suffers from a faulty mucranoid reducing his resistance to extreme heat and cold.": "黏液腺存在缺陷，对极热极冷的耐受性降低。",
  "Suffers from a faulty occulobe limiting his eyesight enhancements.": "视觉调节腺存在缺陷，视力增强受限。",
  "Summons Deadly Elements and Feral Spirits.": "召唤致命元素与蛮荒之灵。",
  "Sun Burst": "日耀爆发",
  "Supplemental ceramite armour packages provide protection far beyond stock configurations while also adding significant weight to the chassis.": "",
