  "Support the heretics": "",
  "Suppress the Information": "",
  "SurroundsChildError": "",
  "Survival of the Fittest": "适者生存",
  "Survived": "",
  "Survived a battle where all their comrades died. They became more reclusive, but gained immeasurable combat capabilities and are harder to kill.": "",
  "Survived the unthinkable. Whether it was slaying a Warboss, vanquishing a Norn-Queen, or accomplishing another incredible feat, they stood last while their comrades fell": "",
  "Suspicion: {string_plus_minus(suspicion)}{suspicion}\\n": "",
  "Suspicious": "猜疑",
  "Swiftly take the Artifact": "速取神器",
  "Swiftly take the STC Fragment.": "速取STC碎片。",
  "Swimming Pool": "游泳池",
  "Sword Class Frigate": "利剑级巡防舰",
  "Sword of Sanctity": "圣洁之剑",
  "Swords": "",
  "Symphony of Pain": "痛苦交响曲",
  "System": "",
  "System ": "",
  "System Data": "星系数据",
  "System Lost": "星系失守",
  "System Troops": "星系守军",
  "System {name} has been overwhelmed by Necrons.": "",
  "System {name} has been taken by the Tau Empire.": "",
  "T-LVolkCulv": "",
  "T1: {round(_gc_stats.traversal_time / 1000)} ms": "",
  "T2: {round(_gc_stats.collection_time / 1000)} ms": "",
  "THE BLOOD DUEL?  HA DO I EVEN NEED TO EXPLAIN, CHAPTER MASTER?  ASPIRANTS ENTER.  NEOPHYTES LEAVE.  Those worthy of serving the Emperor are rewarded justly and those merely pretending at glory are lost in the BLOOD AND THUNDER of the dome.  Do not be alarmed at the carnage.  The Apothecarium has become quite adept at rebuilding those fit to serve.  The others are given to the {role_data[eROLE.TECHMARINE]}s.  The mind is a terrible thing to waste and the Emperor does hate waste.  Not every man is useful as an Astartes but every man is useful.": "",
  "Tactical": "",
  "Tactical Dreadnought Compartment": "战术无畏舱室",
  "Tactical Marine": "战术陆战队员",
  "Tactical Sergeant": "战术军士",
  "Tactical {squad_name}": "",
  "Tacticals": "",
  "Tagged Training Livery": "标志训练涂装",
  "Tags": "",
  "Take it or leave it, dat's me final offer.": "要就拿走，不要拉倒，这是俺的最终出价。",
  "Take the artifact and spare them": "拿走神器并饶他们一命",
  "Take the artifact and then destroy them": "拿走神器并将其摧毁",
  "Take your liar's, heretic tongue elsewhere, lest I cut it out and roast it on an open fire.": "异端，把你那说谎的舌头收好，否则我不介意把它割下来架在火上烤。",
  "Talent Pick": "天赋选择",
  "Talons": "",
  "Tank Busta": "坦克杀手",
  "Tankbusta": "",
  "Tankbusta Bomb": "坦克杀手炸弹",
  "Tanthius": "",
  "Target Company": "目标连队",
  "Target Role:": "目标职级：",
  "Target force:  ": "",
  "Target is invalid, flipped to {resolve_block_label(enemy)}": "",
  "Target is still invalid, exiting": "",
  "Target planet: {p_data.name()}": "",
  "Targeting Fort": "瞄准堡垒",
  "Tarrengast": "",
  "Tartaros": "",
  "Tartaros Armour": "塔尔塔罗斯甲",
  "Tartrs": "",
  "Tasty humie worldz. All dat loot. All dat MEAT. By Gork an Mork, we's gonna smash it all up wiv an ax, burn it to da ground and have a proppa meal!  ": "",
  "Tau": "",
  "Tau Contact": "钛族接触",
  "Tau Empire": "钛帝国",
  "Tau Ethereal Captured": "钛族以太导师被俘",
  "Tau Fleet": "钛族舰队",
  "Tau are particularly hated by your Chapter. When fighting Tau damage is increased.": "你的战团异常憎恨钛族。对抗钛族时伤害增加。",
  "Tau ship broadcasts subversive messages to {planet_numeral_name(tau_influence_planet, stue)}.": "",
  "Tau|": "",
  "Tech": "",
  "Tech Heresy": "科技异端",
  "Tech Heretic": "科技异端者",
  "Tech Marine Required": "需要技术军士",
  "Tech Priest": "技术神甫",
  "Tech-Brothers": "科技兄弟",
  "Tech-Heresy": "科技异端",
  "Tech-Scavengers": "科技拾荒者",
  "Techies": "",
  "Techmarine": "",
  "Techmarine Training: {blur}": "",
  "Techmarines": "",
  "Techmarines and their servitors are placed within this block.  It is advisable that they are placed near your vehicles and armour.": "技术军士与他们的伺服机仆被置于此区块。建议将其部署在载具与装甲部队附近。",
  "Techmarines: {floor(forge_points)}#": "",
  "Technical": "",
  "Technical Differences!": "技术分歧！",
  "Technological components salvaged for {_requisition_gain} requisition.": "",
  "Technologies": "",
  "Technology": "",
  "Technology {_tech_key} not found in the list!": "",
  "Technophobe": "",
  "Techpriest": "",
  "Telekinesis": "",
  "Telekinetic Dome": "念动穹罩",
  "Tell the apothecaries to let it be.": "让药剂师们随它去吧。",
  "Temperate": "",
  "Tempest Launcher": "风暴发射器",
  "Templars": "",
  "Tempting... but no, I must decline.": "很诱人……但我必须拒绝。",
  "Tend to notice things that most don't": "能注意到大多数人注意不到的事",
  "Tend towards simplistic approaches to achieve goals": "倾向于用最简单的方式达成目标",
  "Term": "",
  "Termagaunt": "",
  "Terminator": "",
  "Terminator Armour": "终结者甲",
  "Terminator Armour is the strongest and most powerful armour designed by humanity, available only to the veterans of the Adeptus Astartes. The Indomitus Pattern is the most widespread and versatile pattern as of M41.": "终结者装甲是人类设计的最强最猛的护甲，仅供阿斯塔特修会的老兵使用。截至第41千年，不屈型是最普及、最通用的型号。",
  "Terminator Assault {squad_name}": "",
  "Terminator Sergeant": "终结者军士",
  "Terminator {squad_name}": "",
  "Terminators": "",
  "Terra": "",
  "Terra Nova": "新泰拉",
  "Test": "",
  "Test-Slave Incubators": "测试奴工孵化槽",
  "Test-Slave Incubators Batch {i} harvested for {_cur_slave.num} Gene-Seed.": "",
  "Texture": "",
  "Thallax": "",
  "Thallax Melee": "塔拉克斯近战",
  "Thank you indeed, Chapter Master. A relic of such magnificence... I thank you more than I can say.": "多谢了，战团长。如此壮丽的圣物……感激之情难以言表。",
  "Thank you indeed, Chapter Master. A relic of such magnificence... I thank you.  This item is precious to me.": "多谢了，战团长。如此壮丽的圣物……我在此致谢。此物于我弥足珍贵。",
  "Thanks are owed for your kind words and I cannot deny they are accurate.": "多谢你的美言，且不得不承认所言属实。",
  "Thanks mate, dis'll make a good toof pick!": "谢啦伙计，这能当个不错的牙签！",
  "That dun't push me one way or the uvver.": "这没让俺往哪边倒。",
  "The ": "",
  "The <weapon>": "",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus are trusting you with a special mission.  They desire a squad of Astartes with bionics to stay upon a Forge World in {_name} for testing, for a duration of 24 months.  You have four years to complete this.  Can your chapter handle this mission?": "",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus are trusting you with a special mission.  They wish for you to bring a Land Raider and six {obj_ini.role[100][16]} to a Forge World in {_name} for testing and training, for a duration of 24 months. You have four years to complete this.  Can your chapter handle this mission?": "",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus await your forces at {_mission_loc}.  They are expecting six {obj_ini.role[100][16]}s and a Land Raider.": "",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus await your forces at {_mission_loc}.  They are expecting ten Astartes with bionics. (Beneficial traits: Weakness of Flesh )": "",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus await your forces at {_name}.  They are expecting at least two squads of Astartes and have placed the testing on hold until their arrival.  {global.chapter_name} have 16 months to arrive.": "",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus await your {obj_ini.role[100][16]}s at {_mission_loc}.  They are willing to hold on the voyage for up to {_mission_time} months.": "",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus have finished experimenting on your marines": "机械教已结束对你的星际战士的试验。",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus is aware of the Artifact.  Do not concern yourself with that which is rightly within our territory.": "机械神教清楚知晓此遗物。既属我等辖内之物，你便不必操心。",
  "The Adeptus Mechanicus offers you this.": "机械神教将此物赠予你。",
  "The Allfather": "万父",
  "The Ancient Ruins on {_planet_name} has been explored.": "",
  "The Artifact has been located upon {name()}; its condition and class are unlikely to be determined until returned to the ship. What is thy will?": "",
  "The Artifact has been safely stowed away upon {loc}.  It appears to be a {fetch_artifact(last_artifact).get_type_name()} but should be brought home and identified posthaste.": "",
  "The Aun's ask much of you, Chapter Master... but we are more than willing to repay you in full.": "以太们向你托付了诸多责任，战团长……但我们十足乐意全都回报于你。",
  "The Aun's decree is final. Your terms do not benefit The Greater Good.": "以太们的谕令已定。你们的条件无益于至高善业。",
  "The Aun's send their humble thanks, Chapter Master. You should feel honoured.": "以太们致以谦逊的谢意，战团长。你应当备感荣耀。",
  "The Bloody-Handed God calls for your destruction.  We shall only rest when your filth is cleansed from this sector.": "染血之神召唤着你的毁灭。在你们的污秽从这个星区彻底被荡清之前，我们誓不休止。",
  "The Boltstorm Gauntlet is a Power Fists with an Integrated Bolter, so aside from being reinforced with a crackling power field and able to crush armour, bone and even thick vehicle plating, it is also capable of firing bolts at an astonishing rate": "风暴突击之拳是一只内置爆弹枪的动力铁拳，除了一层噼啪作响的能量场加固、足以碾碎装甲、骨骼乃至厚重装甲板之外，还能以惊人的速率倾泻爆弹。\",",
  "The Canis Helix of this marine raises him to acts of savage ferocity  matched only by other sons of the Wolf Lord": "这名星际战士的卡尼斯之螺旋将他推向如野兽般狂野暴怒的境地，唯有狼主其他诸子嗣可与之匹敌。",
  "The Celestial Lions are a Space Marine chapter nearly annihilated by the Inquisition after they dared question Inquisitorial atrocities on Armageddon, with their remnants saved from extinction only through the intervention of the Black Templars. Currently they have barely a hundred brothers left.": "天界之狮是一支星际战士战团，因在阿尔玛格顿敢于质疑审判庭的暴行而遭审判庭近乎灭族，幸得黑色圣堂战团介入，残余者才免于灭绝。如今他们只剩百来位兄弟。",
  "The Chaos Lord ": "",
  "The Chaos Lord {obj_controller.faction_leader[eFACTION.CHAOS]} has been slain in combat.  Without his leadership the Black Crusade is destined to crumble apart and disintegrate from infighting.  Sector ": "",
  "The Chaos Lord {obj_controller.faction_leader[eFACTION.CHAOS]}'s flagship has been destroyed with him at the helm.  Without his leadership the Black Crusade is destined to crumble apart and disintegrate from infighting.  Sector {obj_ini.sector_name} is no longer at threat by the forces of Chaos.": "",
  "The Chapter Gene-Seed has mutated.": "战团的基因种子发生了突变。",
  "The Chapter has run out of gene-seed!": "战团的基因种子已经耗尽！",
  "The Chapter's gene-seed has mutated!  Apothecaries are scrambling to control the damage and prevent further contamination.  What is thy will?": "",
  "The Chapter's journey thus far has been arduous & unforgiving, leaving them severely under strength yet not out of the fight quite yet. You begin with five fewer Companies.": "",
  "The Consecrators are a secretive Dark Angels successor chapter dedicated to preserving ancient technologies and traditions from the early Imperium, maintaining a substantial armory of rare Heresy-era weaponry and equipment while continuing their parent chapter's hunt for the Fallen Angels.": "",
  "The Conversion Beam Projector is a heavy energy weapon that harnesses advanced technology to project a concentrated beam of destructive energy. Armor detonates as the matter that comprises it is transformed into pure energy.": "",
  "The Conversion Beam Projector is a heavy energy weapon that harnesses advanced technology to project a concentrated beam of destructive energy. Armor detonates as the matter that comproises it is transformed into pure energy.": "",
  "The Conversion Beam Projector is a heavy energy weapon that harnesses advanced technology to project a concentrated beam of destructive energy. Armor detonates as the matter that comproises it is transformed into pure energy. This is the heavy version for mounting in vehicles.": "",
  "The Crozius Arcanum serves as both a sacred staff of office and a close combat weapon for Astartes Chaplains.": "",
  "The Cult of Iron": "钢铁教派",
  "The Cult of {feature.name} {control_string}": "",
  "The Cursed ranks of living metal spew forth from the Necron tomb below": "",
  "The Dark Angels claim complete allegiance and service to the Emperor of Mankind, though their actions and secret goals seem to run counter to this- above all other things they strive to atone for an ancient crime of betrayal.": "",
  "The Deathwatch mag-clamp rare suspensor discs onto their infernus heavy bolters that reduce the weapon’s effective weight considerably. Such weapons are further bolstered by underslung heavy flamers that can incinerate those enemies that make it through the hail of explosive bolts.": "",
  "The Demise of Forge Master {last_master} means a replacement must be chosen. Several Options have already been put forward to you but it is ultimatly your decision.": "",
  "The Ecclesiarchy have placed a company of sisters on ": "国教已在…部署了一个修女连",
  "The Eight Fold Path": "八重之道",
  "The Emmmisary": "使者",
  "The Emperor": "帝皇",
  "The Emperor was truly merciful when he sent you to us, Chapter Master. I agree!": "",
  "The Emperor's Nightmare bear the curse of a bizarre mutation within their gene-seed. The Catalepsean Node is in a state of decay and thus do not sleep for months at a time until falling asleep suddenly. They prefer shock and awe tactics with stealth.": "",
  "The Fallen on ": "",
  "The Flesh Tearers are a Second Founding chapter, created when the Blood Angels legion split up after the Horus Heresy in accordance with the Codex Astartes. They suffer from a mutation in their gene-seed, making them far more prone to suffer the Black Rage than other chapters with Blood Angels gene-seed. If no cure is found the chapter is likely to be extinct within the next two millennia. The Flesh Tearers are also ill-famed for their savageness and thirst for blood in battle": "",
  "The Force Axe is a psychically-attuned close combat weapon that is only fully effective in the hands of a psyker.": "",
  "The Force Sword is a psychically-attuned close combat weapon that is only fully effective in the hands of a psyker.": "",
  "The Forge World of Ryza is known not only for its mastery of Plasma weaponry, but also for its genius in Las weapon designs. This revered Ryzan Lascannon pattern can be dated to the Great Crusade, and as such it is the pinnacle of its kind as the Imperium was then. A common sight across the Legiones Astartes heavy support squads as well as Solar Auxilia, any Chapter blessed with one should count themselves lucky.": "",
  "The Governor is jettisoned into the local star at the first opportunity.  ": "",
  "The Greater Good thanks you!": "至善之道感谢你！",
  "The Gretchin fire their shoddy weapons and club at your {target_type}.  ": "",
  "The Heavy Bolter is a heavy weapon that fires larger and more powerful bolt shells compared to the standard Bolter.": "",
  "The Heavy Thunder Hammer is the largest man-portable Thunder Hammer that is used by the Adeptus Astartes - a giant, crushing tool of destruction so heavy even a Space Marine cannot use it one-handed.": "",
  "The Immaterium will swallow one of your ships.  Do not look for it to return.": "",
  "The Imperial Chefs are mostly idle, making use of the other rooms and facilities.  ": "",
  "The Imperium": "人类帝国",
  "The Imperium allows Chapter Masters free hands in most of their dealings, but on the trading of Gene-seed we must shackle you, firmly and completely.": "",
  "The Imperium and Inquisition's ignorance and hypocrisy will be the death of my Chapter.": "",
  "The Imperium has bound us and kept us from our true potential.  We seek strength.": "",
  "The Imperium measures and records the psionic activity and power level of psychic individuals through a rating system called The Assignment. Comprised of a twenty-four point scale, The Assignment simplifies the comparison of psykers to aid Imperial authorities in recognizing possible threats.": "",
  "The Imperium, blinded by its own hypocrisy, drowns in corruption and stagnation.If it is civil war they desire, then civil war they shall have.": "",
  "The Infernus Pistol is a compact pistol varient of the melta gun. A brutal blast of heat to burn away the The Emperor's foes.": "",
  "The Inquisition": "审判庭",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty to the Imperium of Mankind and the Emperor.  A radical inquisitor is enroute to {_star.name}, expected within {eta} months.  They are to be silenced and removed.": "",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty to the Imperium of Mankind and the Emperor.  An out of control Demon World {mission_star.name} {scr_roman(onceh)} must be cleansed within {estimate} months.": "",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty to the Imperium of Mankind and the Emperor.  An out of control Spyrer on Hive {mission_star.name} {scr_roman(onceh)} must be removed within {estimate} months.": "",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty to the Imperium of Mankind and the Emperor.  {global.chapter_name} are to capture a Gaunt organism and return it, unharmed- 4x Webbers have been provided for this purpose.": "",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty to the Imperium of Mankind and the Emperor.  {global.chapter_name} are to capture the Tau Ethereal somewhere within the {mission_star.name} system.": "",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty to the Imperium of Mankind and the Emperor.  {global.chapter_name} are to cleanse by fire the mutants in Hive {planet_numeral_name(planet, mission_star)} within {estimate} months.": "",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty to the Imperium of Mankind and the Emperor.  {global.chapter_name} are to land Astartes on {mission_star.name} {scr_roman(planet)} to investigate the planet within {estimate} months.": "",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty to the Imperium of Mankind and the Emperor.  {global.chapter_name} are to selectively purge the Nobles on {mission_star.name} {scr_roman(onceh)} within {estimate} months.": "",
  "The Inquisition demands that your Chapter demonstrate its loyalty.  {global.chapter_name} have been given a Plasma Bomb to seal the Necron Tomb on {mission_star.name} {scr_roman(pop_data.planet)}.  It is expected to be completed within {pop_data.estimate} months.": "",
  "The Inquisition has asked for the return of the Artifact left in your care.  Despite your Marine's best efforts they were unable to waylay the Inquisition, who are now furious.  They demand the Artifact's immediate return.": "审判庭已要求返还托付你保管的神器。尽管你的星际战士尽力拖延，却未能干扰审判庭的进程，众位审判官勃然大怒，要求立即归还神器。",
  "The Inquisition has asked for the return of the Artifact, and your Chapter was able to hand it over without complications.  The mission has been accomplished.": "审判庭已要求返还，而你的战团已顺利归还神器，无疑波折。任务完成。",
  "The Inquisition has left an Artifact in your care, until it may be retrieved.  It has been stored ": "",
  "The Inquisition has noticed your uncalled CONSUMPTION of {msg} and declared your chapter Excommunicatus Traitorus.": "",
  "The Inquisition has noticed your uncalled murder of {inquis_name} and declared your chapter Excommunicatus Traitorus.": "",
  "The Inquisition is displeased with your Chapter for tampering with and awakening a Necron Tomb": "",
  "The Inquisition is trusting you with a special mission.": "审判庭将一项特殊任务托付于你。",
  "The Inquisition is trusting you with a special mission.  A local Inquisitor has a powerful artifact.  You are to keep it safe, and NOT use it, until the artifact may be safely retrieved.  Can your chapter handle this mission?": "",
  "The Inquisition is trusting you with a special mission.  A radical inquisitor named {_name} will be visiting the {_star.name} system in {eta} month's time.  They are highly suspect of heresy, and as such, are to be put down.  Can your chapter handle this mission?": "",
  "The Inquisition is trusting you with a special mission.  An experienced Spyrer on hive world {string(_star.name)} {scr_roman(planet)}": "",
  "The Inquisition is trusting you with a special mission.  They have reason to suspect the Necron Tomb on planet {string(_star.name)} {scr_roman(planet)}": "",
  "The Inquisition is, of course, aware of the artifact in question. What, precisely, are you offering for it?": "审判开明地知悉该神器。你们为它究竟开什么价？",
  "The Inquisition will guard this artifact well, I swear it. Only when it has been assured that the foul daemon contained within has no chance of escape will it be used against the Emperor's enemies. Well done, Astartes, you have done the right thing.": "",
  "The Inquisition wishes for you to investigate {string(_star.name)} {scr_roman(planet)}": "",
  "The Inquisitor claims that this is a massive misunderstanding, and {_gender_third} wishes to prove {gender_pronoun} innocence.  If {global.chapter_name} allow their ship to leave {_gender_third} will give {global.chapter_name} an artifact.": "",
  "The Inquisitor claims that {_gender_third} has key knowledge that would grant the Imperium vital power over the forces of Chaos.  If {global.chapter_name} allow {gender_pronoun} ship to leave the forces of Chaos within this sector will be weakened.": "",
  "The Inquisitor is trusting you with a special mission.  The planet {string(_star.name)} {scr_roman(planet)}": "",
  "The Inquisitor's ship begans to bank and turn, to flee, but is immediately fired upon by your fleet.  The ship explodes, taking the Inquisitor with it.  The mission has been accomplished.": "",
  "The Lamenter's accursed and haunted legacy seems to taint much of what they have achieved; their victories often become bitter ashes in their hands.  Nearly extinct, they fight their last days on behalf of the common folk in a crusade of endless penitence.": "",
  "The Laspistol is the pistol version of the Lasgun and like that weapon fires a coherent beam of energetic photons that can burn through most materials. The Laspistol is powered by a miniature power pack that is usually placed within the grip.": "",
  "The Lord of Rage turns his foul gaze upon this sector.  With it death and destruction will soon come.  You had best be ready when it does.": "",
  "The MKX Tacticus is the most advanced pattern of power armour available to the Adeptus Astartes, featuring advanced armor composites and systems. It was developed by Belisarius Cawl during the development of the Primaris Astartes program.": "",
  "The Master of Sanctity ": "",
  "The Maw of the Warp Yawns Wide": "亚空间的巨口豁然大张",
  "The Mechanicus Research team on planet ": "",
  "The Mechanicus does not forgive theft and the Mechanicus does not forgive. We will avenge this. We will return and make you pay.": "",
  "The Necron Tomb of planet {name()} has not been deactivated in time.  It has awakened, rank upon rank of Necrons pouring out to the planet's surface.  The Inquisition is not pleased with your failure.": "",
  "The Necron Tomb on ": "",
  "The Ork Stronghold Provides near absolute protection for the greenskins within the vast shielding is impressivly effective despite it's seemingly primitive designs": "",
  "The Ork Stronghold on this planet is sizeable and provides the Orks with heavy protection": "",
  "The Phaestos-pattern Flamer is a stark reminder of the time where Mankind's future was yet unmolested by the decaying stench of the Horus Heresy. Oddly shaped for the modern users, it is nonetheless not to be underestimated and its potent promethium-fueled flame has burned through armours of unnumbered heroes.": "",
  "The Planetary Governor hands over the Artifact without asking for compensation.##It has been safely stowed away upon {loc}.  It appears to be a {fetch_artifact(last_artifact).get_type_name()} but should be brought home and identified posthaste.": "",
  "The Planetary Governor of ": "",
  "The Planetary Governor of {planet_numeral_name(i, id)} requests help against {enemy1} forces!": "",
  "The Primus MK II Meltagun's origins have been lost to history, but the knowledge of its power and their bearers who served in the Legiones Astartes remains. Some theories have been made to its Ryzan origins due to the curvature of the body, but the famous Forge World denies those claims.": "",
  "The Promethean Cult": "普罗米修斯教",
  "The Psychic Discipline that your psykers will use by default.": "你的灵能者默认使用的灵能流派。",
  "The Raiding forces on {_planet_string} dispatched with your forces and will continue with their bloody practices.  The citizens remain unsafe and the governor is unimpressed. (planet disp -15)": "",
  "The Raiding forces on {_planet_string} have been removed.  The citizens and craftsman may sleep more soundly. (planet disp +15)": "",
  "The Raptors are a Successor Chapter of the Raven Guard, created in the Second Founding. They are famous for their exceptional survival abilities, and extremely skilled in guerrilla warfare and infiltration operations": "",
  "The Red robed ones, their “Machine God”, calls to them. Soon, one shall lose their tenuos grip on the here and now and follow the pictures in his head.": "",
  "The Rock": "磐石",
  "The STC Fragment has been safely recovered and stowed away.  It is ready to be decrypted or gifted at your convenience.": "",
  "The STC Fragment has been safely stowed away, and is ready to be decrypted or gifted at your convenience.": "",
  "The Sector would benefit from such a deal.": "这样的交易对整个星区都有利。",
  "The Space Hulk {spaceHulk.name} appears near the {star_id.name} system.": "",
  "The Spyrer on ": "",
  "The Spyrer on {_planet_name} has been left unchecked.  In the ensuing carnage some high-ranking officials have been killed, along with several Nobles.  Panic is running amock in several parts of the hives and the Inquisition is less than pleased.": "",
  "The Spyrer on {cur_star.name} {_planet_string} has been removed.  The citizens and craftsman may sleep more soundly, the Inquisition likely pleased.": "",
  "The Spyrer rakes at {target_type} with his {_hostile_weapon}.  ": "",
  "The Stalker Bolter is a scoped long-range variant of the standard Bolter. Depending on the specific modifications made by the wielder, the Stalker Bolter can serve as a precision battle rifle or a high-powered sniper weapon.": "",
  "The Thief of Secrets": "窃密者",
  "The Twin-Lascannons are powerful anti-armour weapons that fire highly focused and devastating energy beams capable of penetrating even the toughest armour. This version is mounted onto vehicles to incease anti-armor capabilities.": "",
  "The Twin-Linked Lascannons are powerful anti-armour weapons that fire highly focused and devastating energy beams capable of penetrating even the toughest armour. This version is mounted onto the sides of vehicles.": "",
  "The Twin-Linked Lascannons is a powerful anti-armour weapons that fire highly focused and devastating duel energy beams capable of penetrating even the toughest armor.": "",
  "The Twin-linked Heavy Bolters are an upgraded version of the standard Heavy Bolter weapon. They are mounted onto vehicles to create effective fire support platforms.": "",
  "The Webber is a close-range weapon that fires strands of sticky web-like substance. It is designed to ensnare and immobilize enemies, restricting their movement and rendering them vulnerable to further attacks.": "",
  "The Whirlwind Missile Launcher is a vehicle-mounted artillery weapon that launches a barrage of powerful missiles at the enemy.": "",
  "The accursed ruins on {nu} where your brothers fell still holds many secrets including the remains of your brothers honour demands you avenge them.": "",
  "The addition of a chainblade has turned it into a chainfist.": "加装链刃后它已成为链拳。",
  "The air rumbles and quakes as ": "空气随着…轰然震颤",
  "The ancient ship within the ruins of {locy} has been fully repaired.  It is determined to be a Gloriana Class vessel and is bristling with golden age weaponry and armour.  Your {string(obj_ini.role[100][16])}s are excited; the Slaughtersong is ready for it's maiden voyage, at your command.": "",
  "The apex of the Monolith pulses with energy.  An instant layer it fires, the solid beam of energy crashing into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "The apex of {_hostile_shots} Monoliths pulse with energy.  An instant later they fire, the solid beams of energy crashing into {target_type}.  ": "",
  "The arms are especially lengthy and massively strong.": "它的双臂格外修长而孔武有力。",
  "The atrocities you’ve visited on this sector are reason enough.": "",
  "The barrier between the realm of man and the Immaterium feels thin and tested to you.  Dark forces are afoot.": "",
  "The blast he had prepared runs loose, smashing himself into the ground!": "他蓄积的冲击波失控，把自己砸入地面！",
  "The blood of martyrs is the seed of the Imperium.": "烈士之血是帝国的种子。",
  "The bright light of dawn reflects off the ": "",
  "The chambers within these ruins were empty, or perhaps scavenged eons ago.": "遗迹内部的殿室空空如也，或许早在万古之前便已被洗劫一空。",
  "The color of your Astartes' left Pauldron.  Normally this Pauldron displays their rank and designation.": "",
  "The color of your Astartes' lenses.  Most of the time this will be the visor color.": "阿斯塔特镜片颜色。大多数时候会与面罩颜色一致。",
  "The color of your Astartes' right Pauldron.  Normally this Pauldron contains the Chapter Insignia.": "",
  "The combat was absolutely brutal- your marines were the first into the fray, and as a result ": "",
  "The combat was as could be expected- ": "战况在意料之中——",
  "The combat was fairly grueling- ": "战斗相当艰难——",
  "The construction of heavy armaments requires specialized power-interface linkages and reinforced alloys to handle high-thermal output and significant kinetic recoil. This expansion allows for the production of man-portable heavy armaments.": "",
  "The coward soon realizes he has been located, and reacts like a cornered animal, brandishing weapons.": "",
  "The cowards soon realize they have been located, and react like cornered animals, brandishing weapons.": "懦夫们很快意识到自己已被发现，如困兽般挥舞武器。",
  "The cult’s rot and control of the planet is complete; even if the cult can be dismantled, the corruption is great and the population will need significant purging and monitoring to remove the taint": "",
  "The daemon has slayed all of your marines onboard.  It works its way to the engine of the vessel, '": "",
  "The default livery all marines will be coloured in": "所有陆战队员的默认涂装颜色",
  "The device is covered in a thin layer of gold, which glitters and shines.": "",
  "The difference between heresy and treachery is ignorance.": "异端与叛变之差别，在于无知。",
  "The enemy Leader has been killed!": "敌方领袖已被击杀！",
  "The enemy forces are made up of ": "敌军由以下兵力组成：",
  "The enemy forces are made up of over 3000 lesser Daemons.  Their front and rear ranks are made up of Maulerfiends and Soulgrinders, backed up by nearly a dozen Greater Daemons.  Each of the four Chaos Gods are represented.": "",
  "The energy readings are much stronger, now that your marines are deep inside the tunnels.  What was once cramped is now luxuriously large, the tunnel ceiling far overhead decorated by stalactites.": "",
  "The equipment this Astartes Role defaults to.  Note that if defaults are set to expensive items the Astartes may instead be provided with more usual equipment.": "",
  "The error log was saved at:\\n{_path_hint}Logs/\\n\\n": "",
  "The error log was saved at:\\n{_path_hint}Logs\\\\\\n\\n": "",
  "The event has ": "事件已",
  "The event is set to be lavish and excessive, with maximum requisition spent": "",
  "The extremists and heretics that have been allowed to grow like a cancer in the Armentarium are rooted out and disposed of.": "",
  "The fallen heretics wore several suits of Terminator Armour- a handful of them were found to be cleansible and worthy of use.  ": "",
  "The fallen warlord of your kind is located somewhere within the {nuum} system.  More I cannot say.  It would be prudent to deal with this soon- that abomination may not remain there long.": "",
  "The fate of your ship {obj_ini.ship[_return_id]} has now become clear. While it did not survive it's travels through the warp and tore itself apart somewhere in the  {_star.name} system. ": "",
  "The fate of your ship {obj_ini.ship[_return_id]} has now become clear\\n A Chaos fleet has warped into the {_star.name} system with your once prized ship now a part of it": "",
  "The father is a loving figure. Farewell may your men rot gently.": "父亲是慈爱的形象。再会吧，愿你的手下静静腐朽。",
  "The final sanction for worlds where there is no other economic means for rooting out heresy corruption or the xenos, Your chapters reputation amoung the planets populace may will be damaged, any residing governor (providing they are fit to rule and survive) will be displeased, collaterals will be huge but it's effects will surely be great": "",
  "The flesh is weak, and the weak shall perish. Such is the creed of these mercilessly efficient cyborg warriors. A chapter with strong ties to the Mechanicum, they crush the foes of the Emperor and Machine God alike with a plethora of exotic technology and ancient weaponry.": "",
  "The fluidity is astounding as the ": "",
  "The forces of Chaos call for your destruction.": "混沌之力呼喊著你的覆灭。",
  "The fortified wall has been breached!": "防御城墙已被攻破！",
  "The fortress was demolished for parts, yielding {_requisition_gain} requisition.": "",
  "The fragment been safely stowed away, and is ready to be decrypted or gifted at your convenience.": "",
  "The garrison is comprised of a single squad,": "驻军由一个小队组成，",
  "The garrison is comprised of {array_length(garrison_squads)} squads,": "",
  "The garrison on {name()} has finished the period of garrison support agreed with the planetary governor.": "",
  "The gene-seed is mutated enough": "基因种子已严重突变",
  "The gene-seed is perfectly pure": "基因种子仍纯净",
  "The gods may have respect when they earn it i'll be back cretin": "",
  "The good that might come from simple acts of benevolence are oft underestimated.  A token goodwill gesture can go far, ": "",
  "The governor of {numeral_name} Thanks you for considering his request for a garrison, you agree that the garrison will remain for at least {garrison_length} months.": "",
  "The governor of {planet_name} fears the planet will not hold in the case of major incursion, it has not seen war in some time and he fears the ineptitude of the commanders available, he asks for aid in planning a thorough plan for defense and schedule of works for a period of at least 6 months.": "",
  "The governor of {planet_name} has Invited a delegate of your forces to take part in ceremony.": "",
  "The governor of {planet_name} has bemoaned the raiding of huge beasts on the fringes of the planets largest city, the numbers have swelled recently and are causing huge damage to the planets small economy. You could send a force to intervene, it would provide a fine test of metal for any that partake.": "",
  "The governor of {planet_name} has expressed his distaste of the neighboring governance of {target.name} {feature.target} he has expressed his views that they engage in heretical ways and harbor xenos enemies though in truth it is more likely that he simply wishes his political enemies disposed of, whatever the case his planet has great economic means and he has made bare his plans to compensate the emperors angels for their aid": "",
  "The governor of {planet_name} has requested a force of marines might stay behind following your departure.\\n\\n\\n assign a squad to garrison to initiate mission, The garrison leeader will need to be capable of conducting himself in a diplomatic manner in order for the garrison duration to be a success": "",
  "The governor of {planet_name} has sent many requests to the sector commander for help with defending against xenos raids on the populace of the planet, the reports seem to suggest the xenos in question are in fact dark eldar.": "",
  "The govornor of {numeral_name} Thanks you for the participation of your elite warriors in your execution of such a menial task.": "",
  "The greater bulk of your Chapter, the tactical marines, go here.  Tactical marines may be situated nearly anywhere.  Note that Apothecaries and Chaplains without jump-packs will also be placed here.": "",
  "The greenskin horde is led by a massive Ork, one who calls himself ": "绿皮大群由一名体型巨大的兽人率领，他自称",
  "The greenskins have gone unchallenged for far too long. A towering Warboss has rallied the ork hordes and halted their infighting. Now unified, the greenskins pose a dire threat to the entire sector!": "",
  "The greenskins have swelled in activity, their numbers increasing seemingly without relent.  A massive Warboss has risen to take control, leading most of the sector's Orks on a massive WAAAGH!": "",
  "The ground beneath one of your battle brothers crumbles, and he falls a great height. The other marines go down in pursuit. Within a great chamber they find the remains of an ancient starship. Though derelict, it is possible to land {obj_ini.role[100][16]}s to repair the ship. 10,000 Requisition will be needed to make it operational.": "",
  "The heavens rumble and thunder as your ship": "你的舰船伴随着天穹的轰鸣",
  "The heavens rumble and thunder as your {_ship}": "",
  "The heretic is killed in a most violent fashion.  With a lack of go-between the meeting cannot proceed.": "异端以极其暴烈的方式被杀。缺少中间人，会面无法进行。",
  "The impossible is nothing to you; despite being a Psyker you have slowly risen to lead a Chapter.  Chapter Master gains every Power within the chosen Discipline.": "不可能对你而言不过是寻常；身为灵能者，你却步步高升领导一个战团。战团长将获得所选流派的全部灵能。",
  "The inquisitor Has chosen to turnj a blind eye to some of your more heretical dealings on this occaision. However, it would perhaps be wise to be more careful in furture ": "",
  "The journey into the Mars Catacombs was a success.  Your {techs_alive} remaining {obj_ini.role[100][16]}s were useful to the Mechanicus force and return with a bounty.  They await retrieval at {star.name} {scr_roman(planet)}.\\n": "",
  "The local Adeptus Mechanicus are preparing to embark on a voyage to Mars, to delve into the catacombs in search of lost technology.  Due to your close relations they have made the offer to take some of your {obj_ini.role[100][16]}s with them for both their unique abilities to function as both scientific helpers and as helpers (high Weapon Skill and Technology is reccomended).  Can your chapter handle this mission?": "",
  "The machine is built out of a type of jade, pure black, with many veins of green.": "",
  "The machine is made out of a strange bronze material that seems impossibly durable.": "",
  "The main color of your Astartes and their vehicles. And the colour of your chapters Ships": "",
  "The man who has nothing can still have faith.": "一无所有的人仍可保持信仰。",
  "The marine's flesh begins to twist and rip, seemingly turning inside out.  His form looms up, and up, and up.  Within seconds a Greater Daemon of ": "",
  "The mission was a failiure. The governor is disapointed and the legend of your chapter has undoubtedly been diminished": "任务失败了。总督大失所望，你战团的威名无疑也已受损",
  "The mission was a success and a great number of beasts rounded up and slain, your marines were able to gain great skills and the prestige of your chapter has increased greatly across the planets populace.": "任务圆满完成，大批野兽被围捕猎杀，你的星际战士习得高强技艺，战团在全行星民众中的声望大幅提升。",
  "The morning light of dawn is blinding your marines!": "黎明的晨光正使你的陆战队员目眩！",
  "The most common kind of Power Weapon. When active, the blade becomes sheathed in a lethal haze of disruptive energy that seamlessly cuts through ceramite and flesh.": "",
  "The most common power armour of the Adeptus Astartes and the only power armour still widely manufactured by the Imperium.": "",
  "The mouths of heretics are ever full of lies and filth.": "异端的口中总是充满谎言与污秽。",
  "The name of this Astartes Role.  The plural form will be ''{_role_name}s''.": "",
  "The name of your Flagship Battle Barge.": "你旗舰战斗驳舰的名称。",
  "The names of your main Advisors.  They provide useful information and reports on the divisions of your Chapter.": "",
  "The new insights have allowed for minor improvements to planetary fortifications (fortification +1)": "",
  "The newest and most advanced of the standard mark power armours as such production has not yet reached maximum capacity creating a supply shortage while chapters rush to get access to them.": "",
  "The next in line for rule of {p_data.name()} has taken over their rightful position of Planetary Governor. {_text_last}": "",
  "The nodes of corruption will be saught out and killed, often in such cases the rot resides in the higher reaches of society such methids are perfect for these instances, cut the head off the snake and the rest will wither, the populations of the oppressed planets are generaly pleased even if the nobles and governors chaffe at the censorship or if neccassary execution": "",
  "The only man-portable heavy support Volkite, the Culverin has been a dreaded presence on the battlefields of the 31st millennium, where it would rend Contemptors apart and combust Marines by the dozen. Featuring the greatest range out of the family amongst the other heavier variants, its beam potency is outmatched by all heavier Volkites.": "",
  "The only people who have any desire to hear the poison that spews from the lips of heretics are other heretics. You have been warned.": "",
  "The orgional training mission was a failiure": "初始训练任务以失败告终",
  "The origin, purpose, authenticity and quality of this gift will be evaluated before you receive any thanks.": "",
  "The orks are nearly defeated, but in a final desperate push, a new Warboss has mustered a fresh WAAAGH! and begun reclaiming their lost worlds.": "兽人几近败亡，但在最后的垂死挣扎中，一名新战帅集结了新的WAAAGH！并开始收复他们失去的世界。",
  "The parent Chapter whose gene-seed your own originates from.": "你基因种子所源出的母战团。",
  "The pistol variant of the long-lost Volkite weapon type, the Serpenta was a mainstay of Moritats and often wielded by Centurions of the Legiones Astartes. Now a symbol of status to match its fearsome potency, a sighting of this ancient weapon would send many foes running.": "",
  "The planetary governor of {name()} has died.  Several subordinates and other parties each claim to be the true heir and successor- war has erupted across the planet as a result.  Heresy thrives in chaos.": "",
  "The plausibility will of your threat": "你真要下手的意愿",
  "The population has grown accustomed to us and their Governor has given us the clear to openly recruit,": "当地民众已习惯我们的存在，总督也准许我们公开招募，",
  "The population has grown accustomed to us and their Governor has given us the clear to openly recruit,\\n\\n": "",
  "The populations you attain aspirants from are less populant than required, chances of recruiting aspirants is 20% lower": "",
  "The power sword known as the Thief of Secrets is inhabited by a machine spirit that has an unquenchable thirst for knowledge. When it tastes the vital fluids of an enemy, those liquids are absorbed into the blade and codified by the honeycombed array of logicum cells within. The biological secrets of the impaled creature are then analysed by the blade’s machine spirit, allowing its wielder to exploit the stolen knowledge from that point on.": "",
  "The primary color of your Astartes' weapons.": "你阿斯塔特武器的颜色。",
  "The production of laser-based weaponry requires the casting of flawless focusing crystals and the installation of high-capacity thermal dissipation vanes. This enables the manufacture of concentrated beam weaponry.": "",
  "The progeny of the Raven lord are exceptionally nimble stealth operatives this Marine is one such example": "",
  "The psychic blast he had prepared runs loose, boiling his own blood!": "",
  "The psychic blast he had prepared runs loose, striking himself!": "",
  "The radical Inquisitor has departed from the planned intercept coordinates.  They will now be nearly impossible to track- the mission is a failure.": "激进派审判官已离开预定拦截坐标。如今几乎无法追踪——任务失败了。",
  "The recruitment is {_recruit_rates[recruiting]}": "",
  "The relative strength of the imperial navy and defence fleet forces and their max supported strength. Increase The number of imperial aligned planets and active forge worlds to increase the limit": "",
  "The reward for one such as you will be great, and I /will/ claim it.": "给像你这样的人的奖赏将是丰厚的，而我 /必将/ 索取它。",
  "The ruins is of an unprecidented size whole legions of old would not feel uncomfortable in such a space": "",
  "The ruins seem much unchange from the last exploration records": "",
  "The runes did not foretell listening to your blabbering Mon-keigh mouth.": "",
  "The safe handling of volatile Promethium fuel requires pressurized fuel-lines and triple-redundant chemical igniters. This expansion enables the manufacturing of flame-based weaponry and pressurized fuel canisters.": "",
  "The second dormant webway gate lays upon ": "",
  "The secondary color of your Astartes and their vehicles.": "你阿斯塔特及载具的颜色。",
  "The sector has no active Forge Worlds as a result The imperial navy are unable to effectivly recover from Combat losses": "",
  "The selected tags will be added to the current selection": "所选标签将添加到当前所选单位",
  "The selected tags will be removed from the current selection": "所选标签将从当前所选单位移除",
  "The servants of the Omnissiah cannot be bought with trinkets, no matter how valuable, Chapter Master.": "",
  "The shadows stretch and morph as the lights cast by your marines move along.  One large shadow begins to move on its own- ": "",
  "The shame they inflicted upon us shall be written in their flesh.": "他们强加给我们的耻辱，将以血肉为纸写在他们身上。",
  "The ship is empty, what happened to the origional crew is a mystery": "舰船空无一人，原船员的下落是个谜",
  "The ship was stuck in the warp for many years so many that even the resolve of the marines began to breakdown, there was a mutiney as many marines thought they would be best to try their luck as renegades in the warp. Those who remained loyal to you prevailed but their geneseed was burnt for fear of corruption": "",
  "The ship {obj_ini.ship[_return_id]} has returned to real space and is now orbiting the {_star.name} system\\n": "",
  "The shortened version of the Phobos Bolgun, this pistol like its brother features a .70 bolt and less bulk than its successors. Despite its most venerable origin it features better quality basic components than its modern counterparts but lacks anything more advanced than its simple firing mechanism and basic optics.": "",
  "The skeins have foretold of our meeting, Space Marine.": "命运之网预示了我们的会面，星际战士。",
  "The smaller brother of the Ryzan Plasma Gun, it shares its characteristics as well as sleek design and purple glow. Once a regular weapon for Sergeants and some Moritats in the Legiones Astartes, with even some Consuls or Centurions favouring them over Volkites or Disintegrators, the humble Ryzan Plasma Pistol has earned its place as a vaunted relic of any armoury lucky enough to have it.": "",
  "The smallest mind strives to comprehend its limits.": "最小的心灵也努力理解自己的极限。",
  "The sons Vulkan are blessed with strong and durable bodies they use to safeguard humanity's flame": "",
  "The sons of Guilliman are equally elite warriors and learned statesman": "",
  "The sound is deafening as the ": "声音震耳欲聋，因为",
  "The statue is of a man with no eyes, ears, or nose.  The teeth are rotted and mishappen.": "",
  "The statue is of an angel, sagging against a spear which has pierced its heart.": "",
  "The statue resembles a fat grinx which smiles and looks outward with a malicious gaze.": "",
  "The steady advance of overwhelming firepower is your Chapter's combat doctrine. Each company has an additional Devastator squad, all infantry have boosted defence, and heavy weapons have increased attack.": "",
  "The strike team returns with remains, but apothecaries report the gene-seed is too contaminated to use; no gene-seed is harvested from the chapter’s fallen. Their legacy lives on through their armaments, we will hold onto their memory.": "",
  "The striking surface has been replaced with a very powerful chainblade.": "",
  "The tides of the Immaterium are unsettled. Of course, it's hard to calculate where the Immaterium will affect the Materium, but I predict it will come soon.": "",
  "The top panel seemingly writhes with motion, the geometric shapes blinding to behold.": "",
  "The trim color that appears on the Pauldrons, armour plating, and any decorations.": "",
  "The true soldiers of the Imperium would not speak so of their rightful commanders.": "帝国的真正士兵不会这样谈论他们合法的指挥官。",
  "The use of magik and sorcery in place of those powers deemed acceptable by the Imperium is simply not acceptable, Chapter Master.  You have been warned.": "",
  "The war already exists, you petulant fool. It has raged for 10,000 years and will outlive us both.": "战争早已存在，暴躁的蠢货。它已肆虐一万年，会活得比我们俩都久。",
  "The weapon is black as night, with green, pulsing veins of an unknown energy.": "",
  "The winds of change whisper a familiar tune. Soon, the veil of deceit shall be lifted, and the true face of the Imperium shall be revealed to all.": "",
  "The words of those who have turned from His light are not worth risking the sanctity of your soul to listen to.": "",
  "The world that your Chapter selects recruits from.  More harsh worlds provide recruits with more grit and warrior mentality.  If you are a homeworld-based Chapter, you may uncheck 'Recruiting World' to recruit from your homeworld instead.": "",
  "The world that your Chapter's Fortress Monastery is located upon.  More civilized worlds are more easily defensible but the citizens may pose a risk or be a nuisance.": "",
  "The {global.chapter_name} Master of Sanctity takes a stand against you.": "",
  "The {global.chapter_name} become Penitent.": "",
  "The {name} system has been ovewhelmed by Necrons!": "",
  "The {name} system has been taken by the Tau Empire!": "",
  "The {weapon_name}": "",
  "The {weapon_name} strikes the {target_name} but fails to penetrate its armour.": "",
  "Their existence outside of the Librarium is an extreme threat. Deal with it, or the consequences may be devastating.": "",
  "Their past has led them to form a deep distrust and cynical outlook on most parts of their life": "",
  "Their screams shall be the harbringer of their contrition.": "他们的尖叫声将是他们悔改的先兆。",
  "Their still-living body is disintegrated by acid.  ": "他们尚存生机的躯体被酸液分解。",
  "Their talents are both a great boon and huge risk to the chapter.": "",
  "Their uncontrolled powers are a threat to the chapter. They must be sent to the Librarium.": "",
  "Then we are in agreement.": "那我们达成共识了。",
  "Then you have awakened to the truth the Imperium so hypocritically denies, that there is only one real power in the universe, and it goes to those with the will to seize it.": "那你已觉醒于帝国虚伪否认的真相：宇宙中只有一种真正的力量，它属于那些有决心去夺取它的人。",
  "There are ": "",
  "There are advantages to staying on the Inquisition’s good side, and I’m not one to ignore an advantage.": "",
  "There are few Astartes who have the wisdom and the humility to recognise when their own abilities are not suited to the task in hand. You are one Marine in a thousand, my friend. The Inquisition shall not forget your humble service to the Emperor.": "",
  "There are few people I would allow to back out of a deal in such a way, Chapter Master.  Think of this as a symbol of my friendship.": "战团长，很少有人能这样全身而退地反悔一笔交易。把这看作我友谊的象征吧。",
  "There are few reasons a Chapter Master might wish an audience, and they are all worthwhile.  What can I and my forces do for you?": "战团长求见的原因屈指可数，且都值得一听。我和我的军队能为你做些什么？",
  "There are many mysteries, not all easy to understand.": "神秘众多，并非都容易参透。",
  "There are no more words to be said.": "无话可说了。",
  "There are some questions about his ability.": "关于他的能力，有些疑问。",
  "There are {_spare_apoth_points} apothecary rescource points available for recruit screening,\\n\\n": "",
  "There have been Many concerns over his experience.": "人们对他的经验多有担忧。",
  "There is a massive explosion of warp energy which injures him and several other marines!": "亚空间能量轰然爆发，击伤了他和几名其他星际战士！",
  "There is a price for all things and the accounting is now.  Know that you reap only what you have sown.": "万物皆有代价，清算的时刻到了。记住，你收获的只有自己所种下的。",
  "There is a snap, and pop, and he disappears entirely.": "",
  "There is a snap, and pop, and he disappears entirely. Reappearing minutes later, barely alive and stunned.": "",
  "There is a {_recruit_find_chance * 100}% of producing a successful recruit this month on the basis of the available apothecary time to screen candidates and the chances of the aspirants passing their trials to an acceptable standard,\\n\\n": "",
  "There is no Artifact set to be displayed at the event.": "没有设定在活动中展示的神器。",
  "There is no clear chain of command on the planet we suspect the existence of Xenos or Heretic Forces": "",
  "There is no such thing as innocence, only degrees of guilt.": "世上没有纯洁，只有罪恶的程度。",
  "There is only the Emperor, and he is our shield and protector.": "唯有帝皇，他是我们的坚盾与庇护。",
  "There would have been no place you could have hidden it from me when I came to claim it, you insignificant worm.": "待我前来索要之时，你根本无处可藏，你这微不足道的蠕虫。",
  "These launchers enable a vehicle to clear an area for its loaded troops, or prevent boarding by an enemy at close range.": "这些发射器能让载具为搭载的部队扫清一片区域，或阻止敌人近距离登舰。",
  "These words spill forth from your mon-keigh mouth like worms.": "这些话语从你这『猴子』嘴里吐出，如蛆虫般恶心。",
  "Theta": "",
  "They are brought to the already-prepared facilities for Fallen, tortured to make {_gender_pronouns} appear a heretic, and then incinerated.  ": "",
  "They have a knack for tinkering around with various technological devices and apparatuses, often augmenting and improving their own equipment": "",
  "They have to be sent to the Librarium, or your chapter may soon see its end, at the hands of a chaos god.": "",
  "They require that you capture a Tau Ethereal from the planet {string(_star.name)} {scr_roman(planet)} for research purposes. You have {string(eta)} months to locate and capture one. Can your chapter handle this mission?": "",
  "They will come very soon, the bearers of hellfire and hate. They will scour the sector for so-called ''Heresy''.": "",
  "Thick plasteel walls protect your forces.": "厚重的塑墙守护着你的部队。",
  "Things get out of hand, and the Governor is torn limb from limb and consumed.  {_gender_pronouns}flesh is torn off and eaten, bone pulverized, and marrow sucked free.  ": "",
  "This Artifact rightly belongs to the Adeptus Mechanicus.  Keep your techno barbarians out of our territory and we shall not be forced to act.": "",
  "This Marine can't shake the feeling that his days are numbered; in battle enemy attacks seem to find their way to softer sections of armor": "",
  "This Multi-Melta design originates, like many others used by Legiones Astartes, in the Dark Age of Technology. Deadlier than the current designs fielded by the Space Marine Chapters, it is a relic of both of the zenith of mankind's science and the last moments of the Emperor's true vision.": "",
  "This Warrior speaks precious few words to those outside his chapter but his mastery of arms is apparent": "",
  "This action will trigger a Charisma test": "此行动将触发一次魅力检定",
  "This armour is used by T'au fire warriors.": "这种甲由钛族火战士使用。",
  "This armour is used by eldar rangers.": "这种甲由灵族游侠使用。",
  "This arrangement does not benefit us at this time.  Perhaps if you were to offer again later...": "",
  "This arrangement will be mutually beneficial.": "这一安排将两利。",
  "This artifact is a {__type_name}": "",
  "This artifact is a {__type_name} gifted by the Chaos Lord.": "",
  "This artifact is an unidentified {cur_arti.get_type_name()}.##It is stored on {cur_arti.get_ship_id() > -1 ? ": "",
  "This artifact is {__type_name}": "",
  "This audience serves no purpose.": "这次会面毫无意义。",
  "This feature will be constructed in {lair_struct.built - obj_controller.turn} months.": "",
  "This flamer weapon utilizes psychically-charged promethium and blessed oils concoction to create an azure flame that bypasses psychich protections. It is particularly effective against Daemons and their ilk.": "",
  "This gift is valuable. Your status in relation to the Mechanicus will be reappraised and reassigned.": "",
  "This is a Neutron blaster, typically found in Sabre Strike Tanks, this one has been mounted for use in a space marine tank.": "",
  "This is a good opportunity to provide experience and training, having at least one marine with experience in such matters would be advisable": "",
  "This is actually really bad for your Chapter. Trust me.": "这其实对你的战团非常不利，相信我。",
  "This is actually really helpful and beneficial for your Chapter. Trust me.": "这实际上对你的战团非常有益。相信我。",
  "This is an acceptable trade, beneficial to both of us. I agree to it.": "这是一笔可接受的交易，对我们双方都有利。我同意。",
  "This is most unlike you, Chapter Master. Are you unwell?": "这太不像你了，战团长。你没事吧？",
  "This is of no concern to us.": "此事与我们无关。",
  "This is our home, Mon'keigh.  Leave it in peace or feel the full wrath of Kaela Mensha Khaine.": "",
  "This is the prototype that turned into the staple of all Heavy Bolter designs. Introduced in early Great Crusade, it was one of the very first heavy support weapons churned out by the forges of Mechanicum.": "",
  "This meeting is long since due.  I pray that you pull back your forces, ": "",
  "This pattern is possibly considered the most advanced form of Terminator Armour, providing greater mobility for the wearer compared to the Indomitus with no loss in durability. In the M41 considered to be incredibly rare with wars being fought to secure more suits.": "",
  "This power pack mounted weapon is capable of unleashing a hail of either armor-piercing or fragmentation rockets. It's ammunition is limited by what the bearer has carried with them.": "",
  "This shoulder fired weapon is capable of firing either armor-piercing or fragmentation rockets. It's ammunition is limited by what the bearer has carried with them.": "",
  "This trade will benefit all.": "这项交易有利于所有人。",
  "This weapon's power systems can be activated with the press of a button to sheathe the axe-head in a lethal haze of disruptive energy. Those fortunate enough to get their hands on two tend to duel-wield them.": "",
  "ThndHmr": "",
  "Though bearing longer range than the Meltagun, this weapon's great size usually restricts it to vehicles though those with Power Armor can carry this cumbersome weapon into battle.": "",
  "Though bearing longer range than the Meltagun, this weapon's great size usually restricts it to vehicles. In this case it is mounted to the sponsons on a vehicle.": "",
  "Though bearing longer range than the Meltagun, this weapon's great size usually restricts it to vehicles. In this case it is mounted to the turret on a vehicle.": "",
  "Though they start empty, you may capture and display your foes in these.": "",
  "Thousand Sons": "千子",
  "Threaten": "",
  "Threaten my Chapter at your own peril.": "威胁我的战团，后果自负。",
  "Throat": "",
  "Throne": "",
  "Thunder": "",
  "Thunder Hammer": "雷神之锤",
  "Thunderclap": "",
  "Thunderfire Cannon Mount": "雷火加农炮架",
  "Thunderhawk Launch Bays": "雷鹰发射舱",
  "TigComBltr": "",
  "Tigers": "",
  "Tigris Combi Bolter": "底格里斯复合爆弹枪",
  "Time is a precious resource and I do not wish to spend much of mine on you.": "时间宝贵，我不想在你身上浪费太多。",
  "Time\\nRemaining": "时间\n剩余",
  "Times change and the Chapter must change with them or be ground into the dust of history.  (Chaos)": "时代在变，战团也须随之而变，否则将化为历史尘埃。（混沌）",
  "Timing their visits right, Your forces scour {name()} burning down whatever the local heretic communities call their homes. Their screams were quickly extinguished by fire, turning whatever it was before, into ash.": "",
  "Tinkerer": "",
  "Titan Starcannon": "泰坦星炮",
  "To Battle": "投入战斗",
  "To Question is to doubt.": "质疑即是怀疑。",
  "To admit defeat is to blaspheme against the Emperor.": "认输便是亵渎帝皇。",
  "To be an Astartes is to be a hunter of xenos, of traitors, of heretics, and of all those that dare defy the Emperor.  What better way to test the worthiness of Aspirants than to have to them hunt the most dangerous predator to be found on their planet?  Such a task requires a combination of wits and cunning, in addition to raw martial skill.  When they have received the blessed geneseed and become full battle brothers, they will hunt across the stars with bolter and chainsword. For now, let them hunt with nothing more than a spear and their wits.": "",
  "To become one of the Imperium’s finest warriors, the Space Marines, is the greatest glory that any human can aspire to. And is glory not worth fighting, bleeding or even dying for? It must be, for whole worlds of ice, ash and sand have buried generations of sons in pursuit of this glory and never once called the price too dear.  To ensure the necessary bloodshed, lies, paranoia and psychosis-inducing drugs have been introduced to .  This trial will seperate the weak from the strong and the chaff from the wheat.": "",
  "To enter into any agreement with you would be a awful error of judgement.": "与你订立任何协定都是严重的判断失误。",
  "To increase recruit success chance more apothecaries will be required on the planet surface, we could also deploy garrisons to make the population more friendly to our chapter.": "要提高招募成功率，行星表面需要更多药剂师；我们也可部署驻军，让当地民众对我们战团更为友善。",
  "To increase recruit success chance more apothecaries will be required on the planet surface.": "要提高招募成功率，行星表面需要更多药剂师。",
  "To speak against us is to speak against the Machine God.": "反对我们即是反对机械神。",
  "To train more, we need {_req_dispo} more Mechanicus Disposition.": "",
  "To wield such heretical powers in the face of an Inquisitorial inspection speaks of a traitorous streak so deep it can only be purged with fire.": "",
