  "Unfortunantly we cannot make use of Test-Slave Incubators.  Due to our missing Zygote any use of gestation pods is ultimately useless- no new gene-seed may be grown, no matter how long we wait.": "",
  "Unfortunately we cannot accept these terms.  I apologize.": "很遗憾，我们无法接受这些条件。抱歉。",
