  "Very well": "很好",
  "Very well Chapter Master I Your service to the imperium is well known i have no doubt that you would not ask such of me without good reasoon. I shall forgoe my normal duties just this onece. \\n do not becomne complacent Chapter Master i may not always be so generous": "",
