  "Wailing Doom": "哀嚎之灾",
  "Waiting for your marines is a twisted landscape.  Mutated, fleshy spires reach for the sky.  The ground itself is made up of choking purple ash, kicked up with each footstep, blocking vision.  ": "",
  "Walks in the footsteps of the Primarchs of old": "踏着远古战帅的足迹",
