  "Was able to find a _star with demons on it for inquisition mission": "",
  "Was able to find a _star with dormant necron tomb for inquisition mission": "",
  "Was able to find a _star with lvl 4 tyranids for inquisition mission": "",
  "Was pullled from beneath the carcesses of his slain {alligience} during the {effort} {attack_defend} of {location} {scr_roman_numeral[planet - 1]} from the Orks": "",
  "Was this communication sent in error? Do we not all serve a Greater Good?": "",
  "Wasps": "",
  "Watch Captain": "守望队长",
  "Wave of Change": "变革之潮",
  "Wave of Entropy": "熵之浪潮",
  "We": "",
  "We accept.  The Greater Good teaches us cooperation, and this is just one of the many ways it applies.": "我们接受。至上之道教导我们合作，这只是其应用的众多方式之一。",
  "We agreed to meet upon {_name}.  Do not squander this opportunity.": "",
  "We apologise if we have caused any offence. We are not above admitting our mistakes.": "若我们冒犯了您，我们致歉。我们不会羞于承认错误。",
  "We are agreed.": "我们一致同意。",
  "We are pleased with your contribution, Astartes. An explorator has been dispatched to receive what is ours- you would do well to ensure the STC sanctity remains intact.": "阿斯塔特，我们对你的贡献感到满意。一名探索者已被派往接收属于我们的东西——你最好确保STC的圣洁完好无损。",
  "We can increase this rate, but it will require us to requisition additional facilities, as well as upkeep, Sir.": "",
  "We can train {_diff} more {_role_tech}(s).": "",
  "We express regret that we cannot currently assist you, Chapter Master.": "战团长，很遗憾我们目前无法协助你。",
  "We extend our sincere gratitude to you, noble ally of the Tau, for your generosity. The STC fragment you have bestowed upon us shall not only serve our cause but also contribute significantly to The Greater Good. ": "",
  "We have attempted diplomacy, Chapter Master.  Time and again, Tau ambassadors have contacted your Imperium with peaceful intentions... and time and again they have been betrayed.  No more.  It is war, Space Marine.  Surrender, or face the fury of those who dream of a Greater Good!": "",
  "We have been expecting you, ": "我们一直在恭候你，",
  "We have calculated the price of your destruction and found it excessive.": "我们已计算过消灭你的代价，发现得不偿失。",
  "We have not met before, ": "我们素未谋面，",
  "We offer you this.": "我们献上此物。",
  "We thank you for the fragment but it has not caused us to forgive or to forget. In the eyes of the Omnissiah, you have been seen to be unworthy.": "多谢你的碎片，但这不会让我们原谅或遗忘。在万能机眼中，你已被视为无价值之辈。",
  "We thank you for your help in retrieving this artifact, though we would doubtless have located it eventually.": "感谢你协助取回此神器，尽管我们无疑迟早会找到它。",
  "We welcome you, Chapter Master. What do you wish of the Tau?": "欢迎你，战团长。你对钛族有何所求？",
  "We will have to consider it.  For now, you would do well to seek another partner.": "我们得考虑考虑。眼下，你最好另寻合作伙伴。",
  "We will not serve the Imperium’s crooked ends any longer. Our Chapter will control its own destiny.  (Renegade)": "",
  "We'll just see if dem words are true, won't we?": "我们倒要看看那些话是真是假，对吧？",
  "We've authorized our brothers to use more extreme methods of recruitment, should we really allow this Milord?\\n\\n": "",
  "We, the Tau, agree to a complete cessation of hostilities.  Perhaps you may yet join us and achieve a Greater Good.": "我们钛族同意完全停止敌对行动。或许你终将加入我们，成就至上之道。",
  "We... thank you, for the gift of this imperial curio. I am sure it will prove useful for something. What, I am not sure.": "",
  "Weakened Apothecarion": "虚弱的药房",
  "Weakness of Flesh": "血肉之弱",
  "Weapon": "武器",
  "Weapon Color": "武器颜色",
  "Weapon Combination": "武器组合",
  "Weapon One": "武器一",
  "Weapon Primary": "主武器",
  "Weapon Secondary": "副武器",
  "Weapon Skill": "武器技能",
  "Weapon Two": "武器二",
  "Weapon slot": "武器槽位",
  "Weapon {name} has 0 attack!": "",
  "Weapon: {col[weapon_color]}": "",
  "Weapon\\nPrimary": "武器\n主武器",
  "Weapon\\nSecondary": "武器\n副武器",
  "Weapons": "",
  "Weapons Battery": "炮组",
  "Web Spinner": "织网者",
  "Webber": "",
  "Webbr": "",
  "Well dat was a waste of time. See ya ‘around Space Marine.": "这一趟可真白搭了。回头见，星际战士。",
  "Well, I don't see no reasons why I shouldn't agree.": "嗯，我没理由不同意。",
  "Well, so long as ya aren't askin' for sum teef in return fer it.": "",
  "Were I a less forgiving man, I might find that rude! But there is little I would not forgive you, my friend!": "",
  "Were I a lesser being, such as yourself, spitting in your face might prove tempting.": "",
  "Were I someone who responded to the slightest praise with preferential treatment, I would not have got were I am today.": "",
  "Were it a logical and efficient use of resources, we would gladly comply but it is not.": "",
  "Were it so simple that I could just take the gift and give you thanks. In these times, there is always a price and always a reckoning.": "",
  "Were we not already engaged in a war 10,000 years old, your declaration might mean something.": "",
  "What are you doing!? The bombardment of our planet is inexcusable and shall be met with an immediate and forceful response!": "",
  "What benefits us both benefits the Imperium. Who better for you to trade with than myself?": "",
  "What better gauge of an Aspirant than in a duel with our astartes?  Our brother, unarmed and unarmoured, will face against the armed challenger until one cannot continue.  It is impossible for the Aspirant to actually succeed these trials, but demonstrates how far they can possibly go, and allow us to judge him accordingly.  As with most trials the Aspirant’s life is in their own hands.  He who has failed the duel- yet proven himself worthy- is rescued from the jaws of death by {role_data[eROLE.APOTHECARY]} and allowed to progress to the rank of Neophyte.": "",
  "What better way to cultivate astartes than to raise them from youth?  The capable children of our recruitment targets are apprenticed to our battle brothers.  Beneath their steady guidance the Aspirants spend several years learning the art of the smith.  The most able are judged by our Chapter’s {role_data[eROLE.APOTHECARY]}s and {role_data[eROLE.CHAPLAIN]} to deem if they are compatible with gene-seed implantation.  If so, the Aspirant’s trial culminates in hunting and slaying a massive beast.  Only the brightest and bravest are added to our ranks.": "",
  "What can I and my forces do for you, Chapter Master?": "我和我的部队能为你做什么，战团长？",
  "What can I do for the hero of {obj_ini.sector_name}?": "",
  "What cause do you have, to listen to reason and logic once more?": "",
  "What da zog do ya want, ‘umie? I ain't in da mood for any of your squig dung, so make it quick before I start shootin'.": "",
  "What do you think you are doing, Chapter Master?  Killing a Planetary Governor?  Replacing them with one of your tools?  Inquisitor Lord {faction_leader[eFACTION.INQUISITION]} will hear of this madness.": "",
  "What do you want, Chapter Master? I have little time for glorified interplanetary brigands such as yourself.": "战团长，你想要什么？我可没多少时间陪你这等自封的星际强盗。",
  "What do you want?": "你想要什么？",
  "What is it, mon-keigh?": "有什么事，人类？",
  "What is it, space marine?": "什么事，星际战士？",
  "What is it?": "什么事？",
  "What is the meaning of this?": "这是何意？",
  "What is the quickest way I may be rid of you?": "我最快怎样才能甩掉你？",
  "What is thy will?": "你意欲何为？",
  "What little game?": "什么无聊把戏？",
  "What say you of this deal?": "你觉得这笔交易如何？",
  "What would you like to do at {pop.star.name}?": "",
  "Whatever your reasons for seeking an audience with traitors, they can not be sufficient and I trust you will not repeat your mistake.": "",
  "When a traitor in all but name gives you a gift, one only survives by first checking it for traps and then killing the traitor. And I intend to survive.": "",
  "When enabled, marine promotions are limited based on their current company and EXP, overall following the Codex Astartes promotion sequence.": "启用后，星际战士的晋升将依据其当前连队与经验限制，总体遵循阿斯塔特圣典的晋升序列。",
  "When enough of your warriors have embraced Chaos, assemble them together in one place and then speak with me, and I will show you the beginning of the Eightfold Path. Now, begone.\\n[[As you leave he calls out to you one more time.]]\\nAnd {obj_ini.master_name}, I expect action within a few years. My patience, unlike Chaos, is not infinite.": "",
  "When the time comes for your extinction, I will carve a list of the many times you irked me into your skin. This incident will go on your ": "",
  "When you choose to act outside the rule of Law and trade in forbidden substances, the Inquisition will either bring you back to the Law or bring the Law to you.": "",
  "When you stand before the Emperor in death, He will remind you of what you said today.": "",
  "When you strike at us, you strike the guns from the hands of the soldiers of the God Emperor. This is unacceptable and you have not heard the last of this.": "",
  "Where is this relic?": "这件圣物在哪？",
  "Whether by accident or design, you speak truth. But do not believe it changes anything about how I see you or how I will treat you.": "",
  "Whether due to being cut off from Forge Worlds or bad luck, your Chapter no longer has enough high quality gear to go around. Your elite troops will have to make do with standard armour.": "",
  "Which fleet would you like to delete?": "你想删除哪个舰队？",
  "While I truly sympathise with your plight, I'm afraid I cannot acquiesce at this time.": "",
  "While I would like to help you, there are more important things afoot in the galaxy than your problem.": "",
  "While a few may have preferred another there are no serious concerns": "",
  "While a variety of melee weapons are used by dreadnoughts, this power fist with an integrated Heavy Flamer is the most common.": "",
  "While actually intended to be used on the battlefield as a tool to repair damaged war machines, the Plasma Cutter is equally adept at slicing through even terminator armour with its intense, constant beam of superheated plasma.": "",
  "While in the warp the geller fields temporarily went down leaving the ships crew to face the horror of the warp": "",
  "While it is immaterial whether the Ecclesiarchy needed those supplies, it is a sign of disrespect for you to act thus. When you slight us, you slight the Emperor, Chapter Master.": "",
  "While on it lets out a tormented scream.": "就在它身上发出痛苦的尖叫。",
  "While this is not the gesture I was referring to, I suppose the fact you are yet to scream and shout about ‘Xenos Scum' must be taken as a minor miracle.": "",
  "While you are intelligent for a Mon'keigh, I sometimes forget the limitations of your race. You find it difficult to plan ahead with any efficiency, so I do not take this as a slight.": "",
  "While you have acted like a loyal servant in this case, it does not erase the records of your trespasses.": "",
  "While you make an acceptable case, we decline to enter into this agreement.": "",
  "While you smite the Heretic and the Xenos, the Inquisition will will bring light to the sector with this artifact.": "",
  "While your mind might be too small to record things for more than a few years, I remember the birth of your “Imperium”. I also remember your words, Mon'keigh. You have, predictably, disappointed me.": "",
  "While your request is not without merit, I think not.": "尽管你的请求并非没有价值，我还认为不。",
  "Whirlwind": "",
  "Whirlwind Missiles": "旋风导弹",
  "Whirlwind fails to inflict damage upon {target_name} ranks.": "",
  "Whirlwind fires upon the {target_name} but it survives.": "",
  "Whirlwind obliterates the {target_name}.": "",
  "Whirlwind pulverizes {casulties} {target_name}.": "",
  "Whirlwinds": "",
  "Whirlwinds are armoured fire-support capable of supporting assaults from a long range safe from enemy retaliation.": "旋风火箭车是装甲火力支援平台，能在远离敌人报复的长距离上支援突击。",
  "White": "",
  "White Scars": "白色伤疤",
  "WhrlMssl": "",
  "Wicked": "",
  "Wild": "",
  "Will of Iron": "钢铁意志",
  "Wind shrieks and blood pours from the sky!  The warp feels unstable.": "",
  "Windows OS": "",
  "Wisdom": "",
  "Witchblade": "",
  "Witches are hated by your Chapter, pleasing the Inquisition and Ecclesiarchy. You cannot create Librarians, but gain a small amount of bonus attack against psykers.": "你的战团憎恶女巫，此举取悦审判庭与国教。你无法培养智库，但对灵能者获得少量攻击加成。",
  "Witchfire": "",
  "With neither faction receiving your favor it is not long until the BloodLetting begins. Within a month a brutal civil war engulfs the Tech ranks with losses suffered on both sides": "",
  "With perfect accuracy ": "",
  "With your full support the so called 'heretics' who have seen through the lies of the bureaucracy of Mars eliminate those who will not be swayed to see the truth.": "",
  "With your limited mental capacity, I suppose you can’t imagine a more advanced piece of technology, which is amusing. I thank you for the jest.": "",
  "Within minutes Necrons begin to appear from every direction.  Their numbers are wihout number.": "",
  "Within minutes Necrons begin to appear from every direction.  There appears to be nearly a hundred, cramped in the dark tunnels.": "",
  "Within minutes Necrons begin to appear from every direction.  There appears to be nearly fourty, cramped in the dark tunnels.": "",
  "Without a force of orks to hold it together the fortress is slowly pulled apart from within by the inhabitants, It's capabilities will constantly decrease until soon there will be nothing left": "",
  "Without him there is nothing.": "没有他，一切皆无。",
  "Wizard": "",
  "Wizards": "",
  "Wolf Cult": "狼群教派",
  "Wolf Prince": "狼王子",
  "Wolves": "",
  "Word Bearers": "圣言教团",
  "Words are cheap, Chapter Master.  Actions are worth far more.": "言语轻贱，战团长。行动才更有分量。",
  "Words are wind and mean nothing between two servants of the Emperor's eternal glory.": "言语如风，在帝皇永恒荣光的两位仆人之间毫无意义。",
  "Words are wind, Astartes.": "话语如风，阿斯塔特。",
  "Words are wind, much like you will be if I don't like what I hear.": "言语如风，若你所言我不中听，你也会像风一样消散。",
  "Words don't last, ‘umie, it's deeds that get remembered.": "话语不长久，人类，被记住的是行动。",
  "Words is all ya got, is it?": "你只会耍嘴皮子，是吧？",
  "Words such as these have no place in my calculations.": "这种话在本座的算计中毫无意义。",
  "Words will not sway me in the slightest. Only actions display worthiness.": "言语丝毫动摇不了我。唯有行动能证明价值。",
  "Work earns Salvation.": "工作换来救赎。",
  "Working Techs : {feature.techs_working}/{worker_capacity}": "",
  "World ": "",
  "World Eater": "噬世者",
  "World Eater Terminator": "噬世者终结者",
  "World Eaters": "噬世者",
  "World Eaters Terminator": "噬世者终结者",
  "World Eaters Veteran": "噬世者老兵",
  "Wot a piece o' rubbish. ‘Ope you got better dakka an' dis somewhere.": "这玩意真垃圾。希望你还有更好的家伙。",
  "Wot, so it’s like a box o’ ideas fer ‘Umie teknology? Fanks!": "",
  "Would a trade such as this be to your satisfaction?": "这样的交易能否令你满意？",
  "Wraith Cannon": "幽魂炮",
  "Wraith Claws": "幽魂之爪",
  "Wraithcannon": "",
  "Wraithguard": "",
  "Wraithlord": "",
  "Wreathed in glowing smoke, these massive weapons are as sinister in aspect as they are lethal in application, and are capable of obliterating even the mightiest heretics in a blaze of killing light.": "",
  "Wrist-Mounted Storm Bolter": "腕戴风暴爆弹枪",
  "WrstBlt": "",
  "Wut?": "嗯？",
  "Wyerns": "",
  "XV25 Stealthsuit": "XV25 潜行服",
  "XV8 (Brightknife)": "",
  "XV8 Bodyguard": "XV8 护卫",
  "XV8 Commander": "XV8 指挥官",
  "XV8 Crisis": "XV8 危机中",
  "XV88 Broadside": "XV88 侧炮",
  "Xbox Series X/S": "",
  "Xeno": "",
  "Xeno Associate": "异形同党",
  "Xeno Trade": "异形贸易",
  "XenoPhs": "",
  "Xenophase Blade": "异相之刃",
  "Xenos": "",
  "Xi": "",
  "Ya got eight words to tell me what you want, ‘cause dat's how many finers I got left. After dat, I'll show ya what I learned losing the other three.": "",
  "Ya know ‘umie, I dun’t like bitz that dun’t do nuffin’. Just sayin’ fer next time.": "",
  "Yeah, all right, why not?": "行，好吧，为什么不呢？",
  "Yeah?  Wut?": "啊？啥？",
  "Year": "",
  "Year-long event": "全年活动",
  "Years training : {train_time_string(train_time_data.base)}\\n": "",
  "Yellow": "",
  "Yer a good mate, givin' me such nice dakka!": "你真是个好哥们儿，给俺这么好的武器！",
  "Yes": "",
  "Yes I supose for a creature of your occupation your fate must be a pressing concern. it's dreary really wandering which rancid little backwater you'll die on fighting a pointless cause for a corpse on a throne, or maybe you only ask because you harbour greater ambitions? The changer of ways knows all things if you'll play a part in his games for him. ohh he does love his games yes he does.": "",
  "Yes we have seen you struggle alone, scurrying from shadow to shadow like a hunted rat. I won’t lie to you though, I’ve seen the potential in you and your….brothers. Alright, we will assist you. It will be no trouble at all to exterminate you, should you displease me.": "",
  "Yes!  We wholeheartedly agree to this deal.  The Tau Empire thanks you for your continuing support.": "是的！我们全心全意同意这笔交易。钛帝国感谢你一如既往的支持。",
  "Yes, ": "",
  "Yes...you do not fit the precious mold the Codex Astartes carves out for you, do you? And the Imperium destroys that which it cannot understand.": "",
  "You": "",
  "You ": "",
  "You Recive an Urgent Transmision A serious breakdown in culture has coccured causing believers in tech heresy to demand that they are given preseidence and assurance to continue their practises": "",
  "You ain't green but ya fink like an ork all right! It's a deal!": "你不是绿皮，可你的脑子跟兽人一样好使！成交！",
  "You always know the right words to inspire your men or strike doubt in the hearts of the enemy.  Increases Disposition and Grants a +10% Requisition Income Bonus.": "",
  "You and the rest of your battle brothers fight your way out of the catacombs, back through the tunnel where you first entered.  By the time you manage it your forces are battered and bloodied and in desperate need of pickup.  The whole meeting was a bust- Chaos Lord ": "你和你的战斗兄弟们一路杀出地下墓穴，循着当初进入的隧道退回。待到脱身时，你的部队已伤痕累累、鲜血淋漓，急需接应。整场会面彻底失败——混沌领主",
  "You and your advisors will be placed within this section.  It is strongly advisable you give them backup in this same column.": "",
  "You approval means less to me than your enmity.": "你的认同对我远不如你的敌意有意义。",
  "You are a true servant of the Emperor! This artifact, while it might be of great value to others, shall forever be a symbol of our friendship.": "你是帝皇真正的仆人！这件神器虽对他人可能价值连城，但将永远是我们友谊的象征。",
  "You are able to convince your captains of the strategic need to cover up the incidence, various excuses are made and fake logs that cover up the disaster of the mission": "",
  "You are amusingly perceptive for your species.": "以你的物种来说，你敏锐得滑稽。",
  "You are as a man upon laying eyes upon the ocean for the first time; amazed at what he has seen but woefully ignorant of how much he is still unaware of.": "",
  "You are as predictable as a the rest of your kind. You say things and make promises, which slip from your tiny mind mere moments afterwards. I pity you more than I scorn you.": "",
  "You are boorish to converse with but I suppose it cannot be helped; you were trained to kill, not to talk or, indeed, to think.": "与你交谈实在粗俗难耐，不过想来也难怪；你受的训练是杀戮，而非交谈，甚至非思考。",
  "You are distracted and bothered by a nagging sensation in the warp.  It feels as though a shadow descends upon your sector.": "",
  "You are impure, illogical and irritating. Keep your army of techno barbarians away from my territory.": "你不洁、不合逻辑且令人恼火。让你那帮技术野蛮人离我的领地远点。",
  "You are like a child.": "你像个孩子。",
  "You are nothing.": "你一无是处。",
  "You are right in that we must account for our sins.  Let our Penitence begin.": "你说得对，我们必须清算自己的罪孽。让我们的苦修开始吧。",
  "You are testing my patience, astartes.": "你在挑战我的耐心，阿斯塔特。",
  "You are to have {person_name} deliver trophy hunted on {start_system} to the {start_system} regiments\\n\\nLeft click to see target fleet intercept system right click to view the trophy bearing marine {person_name}": "",
  "You are too kind, friend, for it is you that the people see as their champion.": "你太客气了，朋友，民众视作他们守护者的正是你。",
  "You are using a debug build. Automated bug reports disabled.\\n\\n": "",
  "You are using an outdated build. Automated bug reports are only accepted for the latest version.\\n\\n": "",
  "You currently have {total_role_number}x {_role_name} across all companies.": "",
  "You dare besmirch the honour of the Inquisition!? You have crossed a line this day!": "你竟敢玷污审判庭的荣誉！？你今日已越过了底线！",
  "You do not understand that which you trifle with.  Leave or be eradicated.": "你并不理解你在玩弄的东西。离开，或被根除。",
  "You drive a hard bargain... but it is for The Greater Good.": "你咬价真狠……但这是为了至善。",
  "You flatter me, but it would be churlish to deny the truth in your words.": "你过奖了，不过否认你话中的真实之处未免有失风度。",
  "You give the order to fire the Cyclonic Torpedo.  After a short descent it lands upon the surface and detonates- the air itself igniting across ": "",
  "You have acted in the interests of the Imperium, giving to us what we can utilize for humanity, now trust our judgment to do the same for you.": "",
  "You have besmirched the honor of our chapter this day, and I will not forget it /my lord Chapter Master/.\\n[[": "",
  "You have captured a Gaunt organism- the Inquisitor is pleased with your work.  The Tyranid will be stored until it may be retrieved.  The mission is a success.": "",
  "You have captured several Gaunt organisms.  The Inquisitor is pleased with your work, though she notes that only one is needed- the rest are to be purged.  It will be stored until it may be retrieved.  The mission is a success.": "",
  "You have done a service to us by making us aware of this artifact. It is a little amusing that is was under our noses this whole time, though now I am sure it can be retrieved.": "",
  "You have earned the gratitude of the Inquisition, my friend, and you shall be rewarded. This artifact will serve as a reminder of my debt to you.": "你已赢得审判庭的感激，我的朋友，你会得到奖赏。这件神器将提醒我欠你的情。",
  "You have either mistaken me for a fool or wish to offend me. Look to your sins, heretic.": "你要么把我当成了傻瓜，要么就是存心冒犯我。审视你的罪孽吧，异端。",
  "You have forsaken the Omnissiah's generosity; now you shall face judgment.": "你已背弃万能机的恩惠；如今你将要面对审判。",
  "You have gone too far this time! Lest suspicion fall on me for simply sharing a sector with you, I have no choice but to destroy you.": "你这次太过分了！为避免仅仅与你同处一个星区便招致怀疑，我别无选择，只能毁灭你。",
  "You have handed away the root of the Imperium's most powerful warriors to foul xenos. Did you truly believe a crime of this magnitude would escape the eye of the Imperium?": "",
  "You have located the radical Inquisitor.  As you prepare to destroy their ship, and complete the mission, you recieve a hail- it appears as though {_gender} wishes to speak.": "",
  "You have made amends with your Mechanicus enemy.": "你已与你的机械教敌人言和。",
  "You have made amends with your enemy in the Ecclesiarchy.": "你已与国教仇敌和解。",
  "You have made amends with your enemy in the Imperium.": "你已与帝国中的敌人言和。",
  "You have made amends with your enemy in the Inquisition.": "你已与审判庭仇敌和解。",
  "You have made an enemy within the ": "",
  "You have no more idea of what you're doing than a headless Grox, do you? I will consider making you end swift, when the time comes.": "你对自己在做的事一无所知，和一只没头的格洛克兽一样。时机到时，我会考虑让你死得痛快点。",
  "You have one thing right, {obj_controller.faction_leader[eFACTION.CHAOS]}. I am here to kill you. Open fire brothers, NOW!  [Battle Chaos forces]": "",
  "You have proven yourself an able ally, ": "你已证明自己是得力的盟友，",
  "You have slain my servants, blunted the tools with which I carve my will into the universe and now you believe I will embrace you as an ally? I think not.": "你杀死了我的仆从，钝化了我用以在宇宙中刻下意志的工具，如今竟以为我会将你拥为盟友？想得美。",
  "You have stepped far beyond the acceptable conduct for an Astartes.  Look to your sins and prepare to face the Emperor's judgment.": "",
  "You honour me beyond words with this gift. I thank you, as do all under my command and all who will benefit from it.": "这份礼物让我受宠若惊。我谨致谢意，我麾下所有人与所有将受益者亦然。",
  "You intend to hand over these resources? Without a promise of compensation?  You are a strange human, Chapter Master. Few would do this, and it will not be forgotten.": "",
  "You know how ta polish a name, but do ya know how to wield a blade?": "",
  "You know not what you speak of.": "你根本不知道自己在说什么。",
  "You know, I think I would actually enjoy watching you attempt it. But I’ll spare you having your soul torn to shreds by daemons, and just give you an agonizing death instead.": "",
  "You lack resources; the Adeptus Mechanicus has much at its disposal.": "你缺乏资源；而机械神教可支配之物多得很。",
  "You look like a heretic, sound like a heretic and act like a heretic, for only a heretic would place such little store on their own Gene-seed. Prove I am mistaken or there will be dire consequences.": "",
  "You made a wise decision in bringing this proposal to me.": "你把提案带给我，是明智的决定。",
  "You may be unclear on how warfare works; You are my foe, however pathetic you might be, and foes do not enter into alliances.": "你可能不明白战争是怎么运作的；无论你多么可悲，你都是我的敌人，而敌人之间不会结盟。",
  "You may consider my response to be a ‘no' and assume my attitude to be whatever you like, Chapter Master.": "",
  "You may not always have what you wish for, Mon'keigh.": "你不可能总得到你想要的，人类。",
  "You may yet be of use to me.  Very well, we will assist you. It will be no trouble at all to exterminate you, should you displease me at a future time.": "你或许还有利用价值。很好，我们会协助你。若你日后惹我不快，灭掉你根本不费吹灰之力。",
  "You must assume the worst for your crew": "你必须为你的船组往最坏处打算",
  "You must forgive us, but we are unable to agree to your terms.  We simply cannot fulfil the obligations you suggest.": "请见谅，我们无法同意你的条件。我们实在无法履行你所提议的义务。",
  "You must think that the servants of Chaos have no memory and no eyes. I assure we have both and know that you would be useless as an ally.": "你一定以为混沌的仆从没有记忆、没有眼睛。我可以向你保证，我们两者皆有，也深知你作为盟友毫无用处。",
  "You personally take the rule of the Planetary Governer, ruling over your homeworld with an iron fist.  Your every word and directive, be they good or bad, are absolute law.": "",
  "You pile infamy on sin, traitorous dog.  I will be happy to wipe the stain of your existence from the galaxy.": "叛徒之犬，你罪行累累，恶名昭彰。我很乐意将你存在的污渍从银河中抹去。",
  "You prepare to have a large public memorial for your fallen marines on the planet surface as a show of defiance. The chapter are pleased by such an act and the population of the planet are mesmerized by the spectacle. The governor is furious not only has his incompetence to deal with the planets xenos issue been made public in such a way that the sector commander has now heard about it but he perceives his failures are being paraded in font of him\\n nGovernor Disposition : -30": "",
  "You recieve an anonymous letter of thanks.  It mentions that motions are underway to destroy any local forces of Chaos.": "你收到一封匿名感谢信。信中提及，针对本地混沌势力的清剿行动正在进行。",
  "You request for an audience is granted, but I would hope that you attempt to keep up more regular contact in future.": "",
  "You require something, ": "你有所求，",
  "You risk much with this audience.  I hope I can make it worth your while.": "这次会面你冒了很大风险。但愿我能让它物有所值。",
  "You risk the sanctitude of the Emperor's holy sons, the Adeptus Astartes, and for what? Some paltry material reward? You will reap the seeds you have sown, traitor.": "",
  "You seem good for a scrap, ya beaky faced ponce! Bring your lads down my way some time and we'll have one!": "",
  "You sense a disturbance in the warp.  It feels something like a massive shadow.": "你感知到亚空间中的扰动。感觉像一片巨大的阴影。",
  "You shall pay dearly for this, as shall your entire chapter. So swears ": "你将为此付出惨重代价，你的整个战团亦然。以下者之名起誓：",
  "You should be grateful that I gave your men a chance to die for their Emperor, to throw their lives away for your corpse god, to squander their might and prestigious gifts on fighting for the glory of a long dead cause. Their deaths, while meaningless to the the rest of the galaxy, must surely have brought them the satisfaction of a vindicated fanatic. Soon, I will give you this gift as well, purely from the generosity of my hearts.": "",
  "You speak only the truth, noble Astartes, as is befitting of one of the Emperor's sons.": "你言必为真，高贵的阿斯塔特，正符合帝皇之子的风范。",
  "You summon {dead_champ.name_role()} to your personal chambers. Darting from the shadows towards {dead_champ.name()} who is a cunning warrior and reacts with precision to your attack, however eventually you prevail and strike him down. With the flesh removed from his skull you place it upon a hastily erected shrine.": "",
  "You summon {dead_lib.name_role()} to your personal chambers. Darting from the shadows you deftly strike his head from his shoulders. With the flesh removed from his skull you place the skull upon a hastily erected shrine.": "",
  "You test my boundries, ": "你在试探我的底线，",
  "You test my patience, ": "你在消磨我的耐心，",
  "You think me ignorant of the ways of Chaos, {chaos_leader}, but I know one truth. There is power in blood. Your blood. My power. They will hear me.": "",
  "You think that the Inquisition forgive slights simply because you hand us gifts? You are wrong, we take it to remove it from your heretical grasp.": "你以为审判庭会因为收到你的礼物就原谅冒犯？你错了，我们收下它，只是为了把它从你异端的手中夺走。",
  "You wanna swap dis ‘ere fine bolter for dat fing?": "",
  "You wield the weapons of a traitor, probably gifted to you by a daemonic ally, and you will be dealt with as a traitor; you will be purged.": "",
  "You will make an enemy among your fellow man. Soon they shall whisper into their lord's ear, telling that you are a threat, a beetle to be crushed beneath their boot.  You would do well to speak carefully, for some time.": "",
  "You will not.  {_star_name} is MINE!": "",
  "You will receive less frequent inspections from the Inquisition, and actions that may not align with the Inquisition will cause less aggressive losses of disposition with the Inquisition": "你将受到审判庭更少的巡查，而可能与审判庭相左的行为，所造成的好感损失也将更为温和",
  "You will regret this day, space marine.  The Tau grow stronger by the hour; a dozen races have joined our cause.  The Greater Good is no mere philosophy but a way of life we will fight for.": "",
  "You won't sway me to your cause with poisoned honey.": "用甜言蜜语无法让我站到你一边。",
  "You would offer me scraps for the keys to a kingdom? You are foolish and, worse, you are unaware of your own incompetence.": "你打算用残羹剩饭换取通往王国的钥匙？你愚蠢，更糟的是，你对自己的无能毫无自知。",
  "You're a lousy ‘umie skumgrod but you got a deal.": "你是个糟糕的人类渣滓，但成交。",
  "You're a mate, ta say such nice fings about little ole' me.": "",
  "You're lucky I'm such a nice boss, no other ork'd agree to this.": "",
  "You'ze wasting my time.": "你在浪费俺的时间。",
  "Your": "",
  "Your ": "",
  "Your 'battle brothers' are twisting like snakes beneath your feet. Watch yourself, Chapter Master.": "",
  "Your Astartes are no longer immune to stun grenades or bright lights, and have a massive penalty during morning battles.": "你的阿斯塔特不再免疫闪光弹或强光，早晨战斗时受到巨大减益。",
  "Your Astartes cannot spit acid, and as a result, have slightly less attack in melee combat.": "你的阿斯塔特无法吐出酸液，因此近战攻击略为减弱。",
  "Your Astartes consume {msg}.": "",
  "Your Astartes descend upon the surface of {name()} and plot the movements and schedule of the governor.  ": "",
  "Your Astartes do not have a Sus-an Membrane; they cannot enter suspended animation and receive more casualties.": "你的阿斯塔特没有假死膜；无法进入假死状态，伤亡更多。",
  "Your Astartes have a knack for finding what has been lost. Items and wargear are periodically found and added to the Armamentarium.": "你的阿斯塔特擅长寻回失物。他们会定期找到物品与装备并加入军械库。",
  "Your Astartes have a voice like a creaking door or a rumble.  Decreases Imperium disposition.": "",
  "Your Astartes have reduced awareness when tired.  Slightly less attack in ranged and melee combat.": "",
  "Your Astartes lack the detoxifying gland called the Preomnor.  They are more susceptible to poisons and toxins.": "你的阿斯塔特缺少名为前胃的排毒腺。他们更易受毒物与毒素侵害。",
  "Your Astartes will attempt to commandeer the vessel, to be permenantely used or salvaged.": "",
  "Your Astartes will attempt to disable the ship by attacking the ship bridge and systems.": "",
  "Your Astartes will use equipped Plasma Bombs to massively damage the boarded ship.": "",
  "Your Astartes' Mucranoid cannot be turned off; the slime lowers most dispositions and occasionally damages their armour.": "你的阿斯塔特的黏液腺无法关闭；其黏液会降低多数势力好感，偶尔还会损坏盔甲。",
  "Your Chapter": "你的战团",
  "Your Chapter Master is guarded by renowned heroes of the Chapter. You start with a larger well-equipped Honour Guard.": "你的战团长由战团著名的英雄护卫。你开局即拥有规模更大、装备精良的荣誉卫队。",
  "Your Chapter cannot make more Astartes until enough research is generated.  Counts as four mutations and decreases Imperium disposition while increasing that of other Astartes.": "你的战团在积累足够研究点之前无法制造更多阿斯塔特。计作四项突变，降低帝国好感，同时提高其他阿斯塔特势力的好感。",
  "Your Chapter cares little for its Reclusiam compared to other Chapters. Fewer Marines have shown the desire to be Chaplains.": "与其他战团相比，你的战团不怎么看重忏悔堂。愿意成为牧师的星际战士寥寥无几。",
  "Your Chapter contains ": "你的战团拥有",
  "Your Chapter contains {temp[36]} {obj_ini.role[100][17]}s, {temp[37]} Codiceries, and {temp[38]} Lexicanum.##Training of more {obj_ini.role[100][17]}s is {blurp}.##Your chapter has {artif}": "",
  "Your Chapter does things that make the Mechanicus upset. Mechanicus disposition is lowered and you have less Tech Marines. You start as a tech heretic tolerant Chapter": "你的战团做出了让机械教不快的事。机械教好感降低，技术军士更少。你以宽容技术异端的战团开局。",
  "Your Chapter has a smaller Librarius compared to other Chapters due to having fewer potent psykers.": "由于强大的灵能者较少，你的战团智库馆规模小于其他战团。",
  "Your Chapter has begun to have visions and nightmares of Sanguinius' fall.  The less mentally disciplined of your battle-brothers no longer are able to sleep soundly, waking from sleep in a screaming, frothing rage.  It appears the Black Rage has returned.": "你的战团开始出现圣吉列斯陨落的幻象与噩梦。心智纪律较弱的战斗兄弟们无法安睡，从睡梦中惊醒时狂吼喷沫。看来黑色狂怒已经回归。",
  "Your Chapter has better ties to the Adeptus Mechanicus; you have more Techmarines and higher Mechanicus disposition.": "你的战团与机械神教关系更好；技术军士更多，机械教好感更高。",
  "Your Chapter has lost its gene-seed stocks in recent engagement. You start with no gene-seed.": "你的战团在近期交战中损失了全部基因种子库存。你开局时没有基因种子。",
  "Your Chapter has strong ties to the Forgeworld of Ryza. Your Techmarines are privy to the secrets of their Techpriests, granting your Chapter enhanced Plasma and Las weaponry.": "你的战团与铸造世界瑞扎联系紧密。你的技术军士深谙其技术神甫的秘密，使你的战团获得强化的等离子与镭射武器。",
  "Your Chapter is an elite fighting force comprised almost exclusively of Veterans. All Tactical Marines are replaced by Veterans.": "你的战团几乎是清一色老兵组成的精英战力。所有战术星际战士均由老兵替代。",
  "Your Chapter is dedicated to preserving ancient wargear and as such have substantially higher amounts of rare Heresy-era armour and weapons than normal.": "你的战团致力于保存古代装备，因此保有远超常量的稀有叛乱时代护甲与武器。",
  "Your Chapter is especially trained with ambushing foes; they have a bonus to attack during the start of a battle.": "你的战团尤擅伏击；战斗伊始便享有攻击加成。",
  "Your Chapter is familiar with the ins-and-outs of fortresses. They are better at defending and attacking fortifications, and better at garrisoning": "你的战团对要塞了如指掌。在攻防要塞与驻防方面更为出色",
  "Your Chapter is more lenient with xenos. All xeno disposition is slightly increased and all Imperial disposition is lowered.": "你的战团对异形较为宽容。所有异形势力态度略升，所有帝国势力态度下降。",
  "Your Chapter is tainted by the Warp. Many of your Marines are afflicted with it, getting caught in perils of the Warp less often but to far more devastating effect. Also greatly reduces Disposition of many Imperial factions.": "你的战团已被亚空间玷污。许多星际战士身受其害，虽然不常遭遇亚空间险境，但一旦遭遇便更为致命。同时大幅降低多个帝国势力的好感。",
  "Your Chapter performs some service to the Inquisition that is of some specific value or mandate of the Inquisition": "你的战团为审判庭效力，承担着审判庭特定价值或使命的职责",
  "Your Chapter places great faith in the Imperial Cult; you start with more Chaplains and any Ecclesiarchy disposition increases are enhanced.": "你的战团极为笃信国教；开局牧师更多，国教好感增幅得到强化。",
  "Your Chapter prefers quick close-quarter assaults on the enemy. Each Company has an additional Assault Squad, and your Marines are more skilled in melee.": "你的战团偏好对敌发动快速近距离突击。每个连队多配一个突击小队，星际战士近战更娴熟。",
  "Your Chapter reveres the Apothecary above all of its specialists. You start with more Apothecaries, and each Company contains an additional Apothecary.": "你的战团对药剂师尊崇备至，胜过一切专家。开局药剂师更多，每个连队额外配一名药剂师。",
  "Your Chapter views artifacts as sacred; you start with better gear and maintain all equipment with more ease.": "你的战团视神器为圣物；开局装备更佳，且维护所有装备更为轻松。",
  "Your Chapter's homeworld is ruled by a single Planetary Governer, who does with the planet mostly as they see fit.  While heavily influenced by your Astartes the planet is sovereign.": "你的战团母星由一位行星总督统治，他多半自行其是。尽管深受你的阿斯塔特影响，该行星仍是主权实体。",
  "Your Chapter's icon.  Click to edit.": "你战团的徽记。点击编辑。",
  "Your Chapter's style of warfare is built around the speedy execution of battle. Infantry have boosted attack at the cost of defence as well as two additional Land speeders and Biker squads.": "你的战团战斗风格围绕速战速决。步兵攻击强化而防御受损，另多两架兰德快艇与两个摩托小队。",
  "Your Fortress Monastery has been raided.  ": "你的要塞修道院遭到突袭。",
  "Your Marines Are ineffective at setting up an ambush the assailants clearly got wind of the operation or the plan was otherwise so ill thought out that by the time your forces arrived there was little that could be done to intercept them": "",
  "Your Marines are susceptible to the Black Rage, having a chance each battle to become Death Company. These units are locked as Assault Marines and are fairly suicidal.": "你的星际战士易受黑色狂怒影响，每场战斗都有几率变成死亡连队。这些单位被锁定为突击星际战士，且相当莽撞。",
  "Your Marines are unorganized and splintered. Your forces are initially spread out across the sector and will take time to regroup.": "你的星际战士组织涣散、四分五裂。你的部队起初分散在星区各处，需要时间重新集结。",
  "Your Marines make planet fall and are directed to report to the governor for the duration of the operation after a period of reconnaissance dig in for their ambush. After a two weeks have passed A message from the governor reaches your astropaths that your marines have not been heard of for some time, The raiders also were not noted to have arrived onor left the planet": "",
  "Your actions simply prove that you are afraid that the hands of the Machine God are coming for you. Deus Vult.": "你的行为恰恰证明你害怕机械神的圣手将伸向于你。神意如此。",
  "Your arrogant, blatant disregard for proper Imperial conduct can no longer go unanswered, Astartes.  Time and time again you have ignored the Imperium's call to arms, refusing to strike out at the enemies of man when it was most needed, and callously ignored the Inquisition's wants.  It has become clear that you are not in line with the High Lords of Terra and His will.  This heresy must be cut from your Chapter like the festering blight it is.  You may either atone for your Chapter's crimes, in penitence, or see it ground to dust around you.": "",
  "Your astartes set out and begin to cleanse {name()} of possible heresy.  The general populace appears to be devout in their faith, but a disturbing trend appears- the odd citizen cursing your forces, frothing at the mouth, and screaming out heresy most foul.  One week into the cleansing a large hostile force is detected approaching and encircling your forces.": "",
  "Your astartes set out and begin to cleanse {planet_numeral_name(_battle_sub_loc, _battle_place)} of possible heresy.  The general populace appears to be devout in their faith, but a disturbing trend appears- the odd citizen cursing your forces, frothing at the mouth, and screaming out heresy most foul.  One week into the cleansing a large hostile force is detected approaching and encircling your forces.": "",
  "Your battle brother chops apart the Governor and eats a sizeable portion of {_gender_pronouns} flesh, focusing upon the eyes, teeth, and fingers.  Once full the rest is disposed of.  ": "",
  "Your battle brothers all nod in acknowledgement and move hastily-": "你的战斗兄弟们纷纷点头会意，匆匆行动——",
  "Your battle brothers echoe the cry, a massive sound felt more than heard-": "你的战斗兄弟们齐声呐喊，声浪巨大，震撼多于听闻——",
  "Your battle brothers echoe the cry, a massive sound felt more than heard.": "你的战斗兄弟们齐声呐喊，声浪巨大，震撼多于听闻。",
  "Your battle brothers have found several entrances into an ancient bunker network.  Its location has been handed over to the PDF. The planet's defense rating has increased to {_new_fort}. (+{_new_fort - _current_fort})": "",
  "Your battle brothers have located several luxury goods and coginators within the Space Hulk.  They are salvaged and returned to the ship, granting {_reqi} Requisition.": "",
  "Your choice Is almost unanimously respected": "你的选择几乎得到所有人尊重",
  "Your clumsy attempt to curry favour with us has been seen through and will be recorded as yet another flaw in your character.": "你拙劣的奉承已被识破，将被记为你品性中的又一处瑕疵。",
  "Your cooperation in this matter will not go unappreciated, nor will the servants of the Omnissiah forget your name.": "你在此事上的配合不会被忽视，万能机的仆人们也不会忘记你的名讳。",
  "Your cruiser and larger ship": "你的巡洋舰及更大舰只",
  "Your cruiser and larger {_ship}": "",
  "Your decision shows you to be a skilful leader, Chapter Master, for only the Inquisition can be trusted with such a hallowed relic.": "战团长，你的决定表明你是个有谋略的领袖——如此神圣的圣物只有审判庭值得托付。",
  "Your deeds speak far louder than the words that issue from your mouth, and they speak of heroism and loyalty.": "你的事迹远比你的话语响亮，诉说着英雄气概与忠诚。",
  "Your defeat was a foregone conclusion, Astartes. Your Chapters are like children compared to the Legions of old and we have only grown stronger after millennia of slaughter. Though you are not worthy of it I will honor you with death and make of it an offering to the Dark Gods.": "",
  "Your demands are much like your misguided faith in the ‘Emperor'; nothing but dust before the implacable winds of Chaos.": "你的要求如同你对『帝皇』的错误信仰，在混沌无情之风面前不过是一粒尘埃。",
  "Your end will soon be at hand; you need not rush toward it so eagerly.": "你的末日很快就会降临；不必如此急切地奔向它。",
  "Your entreaty is noted and will be considered in future.": "你的请求已被记录，将来会考虑。",
  "Your flagship, Battle Barge {obj_ini.ship[0]}.": "",
  "Your fleet contains ": "你的舰队拥有",
  "Your fleet is given the command to fall back to {destination_star.name ?? ": "",
  "Your forces descend beneath the surface of the planet, delving deep into an ancient tomb.  Automated defenses and locks are breached.##": "",
  "Your forces descend into the vaults of the Mechanicus Forge, bypassing sentries, automated defenses, and blast doors on the way.##": "",
  "Your forces descend into the vaults of the Mechanicus Forge.  Sentries, automated defenses, and blast doors stand in their way.##": "",
  "Your forces make a fighting retreat \\n": "",
  "Your forces scour {name()}, burning homes and towns that reek of heresy. The screams and wails of the damned carry through the air.": "",
  "Your forces within the ancient ruins have been surrounded and destroyed, down to the last man. An immediate expedition must be launched to recover and honour them as well as secure any geneseed or equipment not destroyed": "",
  "Your future is clouded, human.  Will you be a tool, or a thorn in our side?": "人类，你的未来迷雾重重。你会成为工具，还是我们的眼中钉？",
  "Your game just encountered a critical error! :(": "你的游戏刚刚遇到一个严重错误！:(",
  "Your game just encountered an error!": "你的游戏刚刚遇到一个错误！",
  "Your game just encountered and caught an error!": "你的游戏刚遇到并已捕获一个错误！",
  "Your generosity will not be forgotten, friend of the Tau.  What you have done shall advance The Greater Good.": "钛族之友，你的慷慨我们不会忘记。你所做的一切将推动至上之道。",
  "Your gifts mean nothing to me, even less than your words do. I will not be swayed by either and will keep my own counsel.": "你的礼物对我毫无意义，还不如你的言语。两者皆不能动摇我，我自有主张。",
  "Your heretic blasphemy shall not go unpunished.  The Adeptus Mechanicus will destroy without exception all that is your chapter.": "你的异端亵渎必将受到惩罚。机械神教将毫不留情地毁灭你的战团。",
  "Your home system is connected to the larger imperium and system by warp routes": "你的母星系通过亚空间航线与更大的帝国相连",
  "Your home system is in a very stable warp area, accessible by several warp lanes": "你的母星系位于非常稳定的亚空间区域，可通过数条亚空间航道抵达",
  "Your home system is logistically secluded with no major warp routes": "你的母星系后勤上相当隔绝，没有主要亚空间航线",
  "Your home system is relativly central in the sector": "你的母星系位于星区相对中央的位置",
  "Your home system sits at the edge of the sector": "你的母星系位于星区边缘",
  "Your kind will be destroyed, in time.": "你这类存在终究会被消灭。",
  "Your logic is clear.": "你的逻辑很清楚。",
  "Your marines are killed down to the last man.  The Inquisition mission is a failure- you were to blow up the Necron Tomb World stealthily, not wake it up.  The Inquisition is not pleased with your conduct.": "你的星际战士全军覆没。审判庭任务失败——你本应悄无声息地炸毁太空死灵墓穴世界，而不是唤醒它。审判庭对你的行为极为不满。",
  "Your marines converge upon the Artifact; resistance is light and easily dealt with.  After a brief firefight the Artifact is retrieved.##": "",
  "Your marines converge upon the STC Fragment; resistance is light and easily dealt with.  After a brief firefight it is retrieved.##": "",
  "Your marines descended into the ancient ruins, mapping them out as they go.  They quickly determine the ruins were once ": "",
  "Your marines drop fast and hard, blowing through guards and mercenaries with minimal resistance.  Before ten minutes have passed all your targets are executed.": "",
  "Your marines enter the massive tunnel complex, following the energy readings.  At first the walls are cramped and tiny, closing about them, but the tunnels widen at a rapid pace.": "",
  "Your marines finally enter the deepest catacombs of the Necron Tomb.  There they place the Plasma Bomb and arm it.  All around are signs of increasing Necron activity.  With half an hour set, your men escape back to the surface.  There is a brief rumble as the charge goes off, your mission a success.": "",
  "Your marines have scoured ": "",
  "Your marines have scouted out ": "",
  "Your marines make a tactical retreat back to the surface, hounded by Necrons all the way.  The Inquisition mission is a failure- you were to blow up the Necron Tomb World stealthily, not wake it up.  The Inquisition is not pleased with your conduct.": "",
  "Your marines maneuver through the hull of the Space Hulk, shadows dancing and twisting before their luxcasters.  The hallway integrity is non-existent – twisted metal juts out in hazardous ways or opens into bottomless pits.  Still, there is loot and knowledge to be gained.  It is not long before your men's sensorium pick up hostile blips.  Your own forces are made up of ": "",
  "Your marines maneuver through the hull of the Space Hulk, shadows dancing and twisting before their luxcasters.  The hallway integrity is non-existent – twisted metal juts out in hazardous ways or opens into bottomless pits.  Your forces are made up of ": "",
  "Your marines move across {name()},": "",
  "Your marines on {planet_numeral_name(planet, id)}": "",
  "Your marines place themselves into a proper fighting position, defensible and ready to fight whatever may come.  Enemies may only come from a few directions, though the ancient corridors and alleyways are massive, and provide little cover.": "",
  "Your marines quickly converge upon the Artifact and remove it, before local forces have any idea of what is happening.##": "",
  "Your marines scour the underhive of {name()}, spraying mutants down with promethium as they go.  It takes several days but a sizeable dent is put in their numbers.": "",
  "Your marines search through the alleyways and corridors likely to contain the Spyrer.  It does not take long before the lunatic attacks, springing off from a wall to fall among your men.  Your ranks are made up of ": "",
  "Your marines search through the alleyways and dens likely to contain the Fallen.  Several days pass before the search is succesful; the prey is located by Auspex and closed in upon.  ": "",
  "Your marines search through the broken craggs and spires of the molten planet.  Among the bubbling lava, and cracking earth, they search for the Fallen.  After several days of searching Auspex detect the prey.  ": "",
  "Your marines search through the cratered surface of the debris field.  Among the cracking earth and dust they search for the Fallen.  After several days of searching Auspex detect the prey.  ": "",
  "Your marines search through the endless glaciers and peaks of the frozen planet.  Among the howling wind, and cracking ice, they search for the Fallen.  After several days of searching Auspex detect the prey.  ": "",
  "Your marines warily stalk through into the entrance of the ruins": "",
  "Your men were no true challenge, Chapter Master, merely wheat before the scythe of my forces. Next time you foolishly send your troops blundering into combat, at least make sure they are troops that offer some diversion. More entertainment was had from the desecration of their corpses than in the stealing of their life, though perhaps this will be true of your entire warband. In time, no doubt I will see.": "",
  "Your message and the error log will be sent to our Discord automatically. You can decline by pressing 'cancel'.\\n\\n": "",
  "Your new {obj_ini.ship_class[last_ship]} '{obj_ini.ship[last_ship]}' has finished being constructed.  It is orbiting {ship_spawn.system.name} and awaits its maiden voyage.": "",
  "Your new {obj_ini.ship_class[last_ship]} Escort '{obj_ini.ship[last_ship]}' has finished being constructed.  It is orbiting {ship_spawn.system.name} and awaits its maiden voyage.": "",
  "Your penitence crusade has been lengthened for your failings": "因你的过失，你的苦修远征已被延长",
  "Your priestesses of war, who worship He Who Fell, will gather their forces soon, to stay.": "",
  "Your questions askers seek to learn more of a planet.  Warp meddlers and free thinkers would be well-served with caution. Beware, Chapter Master.": "",
  "Your recruit world will be in a different system to your homeworld.": "你的招募世界将与母星处于不同星系。",
  "Your recruit world will be in the same system as your homeworld.": "你的招募世界将与母星处于同一星系。",
  "Your recruit world will be the same planet as your homeworld.": "你的招募世界将与母星是同一颗行星。",
  "Your request has been considered and found to be lacking in merit.": "你的请求已被考虑，然并无可取之处。",
  "Your rule of the the planet is being undermined by hostile forces": "敌对势力正在暗中破坏你对这颗行星的统治",
  "Your ship sends over a boarding party, who retrieve the offered artifact- ": "你的舰船派出登舰小队，取回献出的神器——",
  "Your ships have returned from the Crusade.  ": "你的舰船已从远征归来。",
  "Your soul will be mine.": "你的灵魂将归我所有。",
  "Your species generally scrabbles for traces of the time before, when you were far greater than you are now. It is good you are letting go and accepting your present lot.": "",
  "Your strike team locates the site where the previous expedition made their last stand. They airlift whatever equipment and vehicles remain, disposing of anything beyond saving;. {_weapon_text} is repaired and restored to the armamentarium": "",
  "Your strike team locates the site where the previous expedition made their last stand. They find nothing. Your equipment is gone and bodies nowhere to be found, the entire expedition appears to have vanished without a trace; they return empty handed. Something insidious happened. You must find whoever defiled your brothers, and eliminate them, forever.": "",
  "Your supporters are more than our detractors but many are unhappy": "支持你的人多于反对者，但许多人并不满意",
  "Your terms are agreeable, and past deeds have proven your trustworthiness... but I fear the consequences of this trade.": "你的条件可以接受，过往事迹也证明了你的可靠……但我担心这笔交易的后果。",
  "Your terms are most amicable.  May the light of wisdom shine on you ever, Chapter Master.  Greater Good prevails.": "你的条件非常友好。愿智慧之光永远照耀你，战团长。至上之道必胜。",
  "Your terms are practically insulting.  The Greater Good is not so impotent that we cannot simply go to someone else.": "你的条件近乎侮辱。至上之道还没弱到只能与你交易，我们完全可以另寻他人。",
  "Your tiresome slander is noted and dismissed. We do not hold it against you.": "",
  "Your twisted brethren, who fell to the lure of the Immaterium, will soon arrive with their wrath and demons. Beware.": "",
  "Your underlings fight for power, Mon'keigh.  Someone will die who believes he is important. His children and ''friends'' will vie for the rite to call himself or herself governor. Or king. Or whatever self aggrandising title your people name yourselves.": "",
  "Your words are as full of poison as your heart.": "你的话语如你的心一般充满毒药。",
  "Your words are hollow.": "你的话空洞无物。",
  "Your words are illogical and meaningless.": "你的话语不合逻辑且毫无意义。",
  "Your words harm no one but yourself.": "你的话只伤害你自己。",
  "Your words would be better served placating members of your Imperium's Inquisition who will, I am sure, be interested in our correspondences.": "你的言辞更适合去安抚贵帝国的审判官——我相信他们会对我们之间的通信很感兴趣。",
  "Your {obj_ini.role[100][16]} have worked with the Adeptus Mechanicus in a satisfactory manor.  The testing and training went well, but your Land Raider was ultimately lost.  300 Requisition has been given to your Chapter and relations are better than before.": "",
  "Yourself": "",
  "ZAB#Mystic#NelsonH#EttyKitty": "",
  "Zakis Randi": "",
  "Zeal is its own Excuse.": "狂热即是其自身的借口。",
  "Zealous Faith": "狂热的信仰",
  "Zeta": "",
  "Zoanthrope": "",
  "Zoanthrope Blast": "费罗赖德爆破",
