  "\\n#": "",
  "\\n- ": "",
  "\\n- {_role_string}": "",
  "\\n=== END OF COMBAT DEBUG LOG ===": "",
  "\\nAmplification from Attributes (Psy Rating and EXP): {_character_psychic_amplification}%": "",
  "\\nAmplification from Equipment: {_equipment_psychic_amplification}%": "",
  "\\nBattleships Lost: {string(capital_lost)} ({string((capital_lost / max(0, capital_max)) * 100)}%)": "",
  "\\nBut you cannot simply paint the eight-pointed star on your wargear and begin slaughtering in the name of the Dark Gods. No, some within your chapter will resist the choice you’ve made, either out of loyalty to the Corpse Emperor or out of fear of Chaos. Just think, it will be like your own little heresy. The ''": "",
  "\\nCruisers Lost: {string(frigate_lost)} ({string((frigate_lost / max(0, frigate_max)) * 100)}%)": "",
  "\\nDisplays a talent with technology that might make him suited to a role within the armentarium.": "",
  "\\nEscorts Lost: {string(escort_lost)} ({string((escort_lost / max(0, escort_max)) * 100)}%)": "",
  "\\nFocus from Attributes (WIS and EXP): {_character_psychic_focus}%": "",
  "\\nFocus from Equipment: {_equipment_psychic_focus}%": "",
  "\\nFor everyone else? It's time for the emperor's mercy.": "",
  "\\nHas a decent understanding of technology, capable of performing routine maintenance on standard issue equipment.": "",
  "\\nHis strength greatly exceeds that of the standard astartes allowing him to wield weapons that normally require two hands in one.": "",
  "\\nIs a technological luddite capable of little more than cleaning his own bolter.": "",
  "\\nIs a technological prodigy able to understand and build most anything that takes his interest.": "",
  "\\nIs capable enough with technical skills to carry out basic tasks in the field.": "",
  "\\nKnown Powers: ": "",
  "\\nMarines Lost: {string(fallen)}": "",
  "\\nMutation of our gene-seed currently makes us unable to recruit new Neophytes. We are doomed to a slow demise unless the Apothecaries can fix it.": "",
  "\\nShips Damaged: 0 (0%)": "",
  "\\nShips Damaged: {string(ships_damaged)} ({string((ships_damaged / (ships_max - _all_lost)) * 100)}%)": "",
  "\\nThe governor is unhappy and it has done little to improve your reputation with the planets populace but otherwise very little harm has been done. It is likely the raiders will choose better targets without the possible threat of space marine presence for the foreseeable future\\nGovernor Disposition : -10": "",
  "\\nThe total loss of a squad in what was meant to be a routine operation is bad for moral and your chapters reputation you must now decide how to proceed": "",
  "\\nThere is a limit of 10 Bionic augmentations. After that the damage is so extensive that a marine requires a dreadnought to keep going.": "",
  "\\nThere is no more gene-seed in our vaults and we cannot create more neophytes as a result. Something must be done, Chapter Master.": "",
  "\\nThey are in awe of his combat skills, seeing him as a paragon of martial prowess.": "",
  "\\nThey harbor doubts about his combat abilities, having skills seemingly inadequate for his rank.": "",
  "\\nThey regard him with respect, his battle prowess a testament to his leadership.": "",
  "\\nTotal Modifier: x{string_format(forge_cost_mod, 1, 2)}": "",
  "\\nWarboss {_warboss.name}": "",
  "\\nWe're recruiting from one world - {obj_ini.recruiting_name}.": "",
  "\\nWe're recruiting from several worlds.": "",
  "\\nWe're recruiting from two worlds. Finding recruits is vastly accelerated.": "",
  "\\n\\Genestealer influence is now effecting {heres_after}% of the population.": "",
  "\\n\\Tau influence is now effecting {heres_after}% of the population.": "",
  "\\n\\n": "",
  "\\n\\n(Chapter wide loyalty: -10)\\nChaplains note marked changes in behaviour of some brothers": "",
  "\\n\\nAll of your ships are destroyed attempting to flee.": "",
  "\\n\\nCurrent Bionic Augmentations:\\n": "",
  "\\n\\nFocus Success Chance: {100 - unit.psychic_focus_difficulty()}%": "",
  "\\n\\nHere are the current positions of our ships and their contents:": "",
  "\\n\\nHeresy has fallen to {heres_after}%.": "",
  "\\n\\nHonour Guard, having the {_honour_guard_count} most veteran {string_plural(": "",
  "\\n\\nMain Discipline: {_psy_discipline_name}": "",
  "\\n\\nPerils of the Warp Chance: {_perils_chance}%": "",
  "\\n\\nPersonnel: {_role_tech}s: {count_techmarines}, Aspirants: {count_aspirants}.": "",
  "\\n\\nRequired for:\\n- ": "",
  "\\n\\nSome of your ships remain behind to draw off the attack and give the rest of your fleet a chance to escape.": "",
  "\\n\\nThe entire fleet manages to escape with minimal damage.": "",
  "\\n\\nThe planet had a population of ": "",
  "\\n\\nTraining: ": "",
  "\\n\\nYour armamentarium contains some spare equipment- \\n": "",
  "\\n\\n{_bearer_text}": "",
  "\\n{_cur_recruit_rate}.": "",
  "\\n{_cur_recruit_rate}. You must only give me the word and I can begin further increasing our numbers.": "",
  "\\n{_cur_recruit_rate}. You must only give me the word and I can begin further increasing our numbers... though this would violate the Codex Astartes.": "",
