  "a ": "",
  "a Space Marine fortification from earlier times.": "一座早期时代的星际战士要塞。",
  "a WAAAAGH!! of 11000": "一场11000人的WAAAGH！！",
  "a green tide of over 3600": "一场超过3600人的绿潮",
  "a green tide of over 7000": "一场超过7000人的绿潮",
  "a large Canoptek Spyder launches towards your marines, a small group of scuttling Scarabs quickly following.": "",
  "a large plater of mediterranean Grox salad, with nuts and sliced pears.": "",
  "a large vat of stew, made up of Triglyceride Gel and grox meat.": "",
  "a magnificent temple of the Imperial Cult.": "一座壮丽的国教神庙。",
