  "are": "",
  "are a squad of Adepta Sororitas, back up by a dozen priests.  Forming up a protective shield around them are a large group of religious followers, gnashing and screaming out litanies to the Emperor.": "",
  "are generally dissatisfied with his tactical decisions.": "普遍对他的战术决策不满。",
  "are more than a thousand Adepta Sororitas, a large portion of an order, thick clouds of incense and smoke heralding their advance.  A massive pack of religious followers are spread among the force, screaming and babbling hyms to the Emperor.  Many are already bleeding from self-inflicted wounds or flagellation.  Their voices are drowned out by the rumble of Penitent Engines and the loud vox-casters of Excorcists, blasting out litanies and organ music even more deafening volumes.": "",
  "are more than four hundred Adepta Sororitas, thick clouds of incense and smoke heralding their advance.  An equally massive pack of religious followers are spread around, screaming and babbling hyms to the Emperor.  Many are already bleeding from self-inflicted wounds or flagellation.  Several Penitent Engines clank and advance in the forefront.": "",
  "are neutral towards him": "对他持中立态度",
  "are savaged by your marines in hand-to-hand combat.": "在你的星际战士的白刃战下被撕碎。",
  "are several squads of Adepta Sororitas.  A large pack of religious followers forms up a protective shield in front, backed up by numerous Acro-Flagellents.": "",
  "are smashed by your marines.": "被你的星际战士砸碎。",
  "are struck by your marines in melee.": "被你的星际战士近战重创。",
  "are struck with gun-barrels and fists.": "被枪托与拳头痛击。",
