  "currently has limited influence on the planet but is fast gaining speed": "目前在行星上影响力有限，但正快速扩大",
  "curses the Imperium for their view of the ": "",
  "curses the Inquisition for their meddling with the ": "",
  "curses the Ork menace and their numbers- the greenskins must be met with Bolter and Flamer, sooner than later.": "",
  "curses the Tau for their subversive methods and mockery of technology.  Purging some Tau would be cathartic.": "",
  "curses the Tau for their unwant corruption of the Imperium's citizens.  The xenos must be purged, down to the last one.": "",
  "curses the Tyranids for the threat they pose to the sector.  They will be defeated, each time, but at what cost?": "",
  "curses the arrogant Eldar and their meddling.  They will be a lot less haughty with a chainsword through the gut.": "",
  "curses the damned greenskins for their wanton destruction of Imperial worlds.": "",
  "curses the foul traitors for their heresy and corruption of the sector.  Something must be done to end them for good.": "",
