  "is": "",
  "is concerned about the Chapter Master's decision to help the Eldar.  Is it not a Space Marine's duty to cleanse and purge xenos, rather than collaborate with them?": "",
  "is concerned about the Imperium's view of the ": "",
  "is concerned about the Inquisition's view of the ": "",
  "is concerned about the current size of the ": "",
  "is concerned with the Mechanicus' low opinion of the ": "",
  "is displeased with the Imperium's view of the ": "",
  "is eager to enter the field of battle once more.": "渴望再度踏上战场。",
  "is eager to kill more heretics, for Primarch and Emperor.": "渴望为基因原体与帝皇杀死更多异端。",
  "is eager to purge more xenos scum.": "渴望清除更多异形渣滓。",
  "is the entirety of an Adepta Sororitas order, the ground shaking beneath their combined thousands of footsteps.  Forming a shield around them in a massive, massive pack of religious followers, screaming out or babbling hyms to the Emperor.  All of the opposing army is a blurring, shifting mass of robes and ceremite, and sound, Ecclesiarchy Priests and Mistresses whipping the masses into more of a blood frenzy.  Organ music and litanies blast from the many Exorcists, the sound deafening to those too close.  Carried with the wind, and lingering in the air, is the heavy scent of promethium.": "",
  "is unimpressed by the ": "",
  "is unsettled by the ": "",
  "is_changed": "",
  "is_exit": "",
  "issues orders to the Chapter over Vox-": "",
  "it": "",
  "it crumbles apart from the onslaught. It is no more.": "它在猛攻下土崩瓦解。它已不复存在。",
  "it is a finely crafted Bike, conforming mostly to STC standards.  The other ": "",
  "it is a finely crafted Rhino, conforming to STC standards.  The other ": "",
  "it is a small, finely crafted statue wrought in metal.  The ": "",
  "it is a {global.chapter_name} Icon wrought in metal, finely decorated.  Pride for his chapter seems to have overtaken him.  There are no corrections to be made and the item is placed where many may view it.": "",
  "it suffers extensive damage from the bombardment, its integrity reduced by ": "",
  "it suffers heavy damage from the bombardment, its integrity reduced by ": "",
  "it suffers minimal damage from the bombardment.": "",
  "it suffers minor damage from the bombardment, its integrity reduced by ": "",
  "it suffers moderate damage from the bombardment, its integrity reduced by ": "",
