  "wishes to purge more heretics.  Cleaning the homes of the damned with flamer is cathartic for him.": "渴望清除更多异端。用喷火器清扫罪孽者的巢穴于他而言是一种宣泄。",
  "wishes to purge some Eldar.  The arrogant xenos scum must learn their place.": "渴望清除一些灵族。这些傲慢的异形渣滓必须认清自己的位置。",
  "wishes to purge some Orks, sooner than later.  Much like weeds, their numbers must be cut down.": "渴望尽快清除一些兽人。如同杂草一般，必须削减他们的数量。",
  "wishes to purge some Tau, sooner than later.  Watching their armour and vehicles explode in blue flames is enjoyable.": "渴望尽快清除一些钛族。看着他们的盔甲与载具在蓝色火焰中爆炸，颇为赏心悦目。",
